<H1>Tolkāppiyam, Poruḷatikāram, Iḷampūraṇam,
<BR>Kaḷaviyal (TP3)</H1>


<P>((Master file kept in: AA\AKAM\UTF2PDY\TOLK\kalavu.pdy))
<P>((last modification: 2004 september 30th))

<P>((original entry based on the kazhakam edition))
<BR>((file 1: kalavi1.src: pp. 155-180))
