<BR>((file 3: kalavi3.src: pp. 209-247))

<HR>

R 65,T 5

<HR>

<H2><A NAME="_TP3_">((3. kaḷavu iyal))</A></H2>



<P>|ivvōttu |eṉṉa peyarttō |eṉiṉ, kaḷaviyal |eṉṉum peyarttu;kaḷavoḻukkam |uṇarttiṉamiyāṟ peṟṟa peyar. |aḵtātal |īṇṭu|urikkiṉṟataṉāl payaṉ |iṉṟām; kaḷaveṉpatu |aṟam |aṉmiyiṉ[|eṉil], |aṟṟaṉṟu; kaḷavu |eṉṉum coṟ kaṇṭuḻiyellām|aṟappāṟpaṭāteṉṟal |amiyātu. kaḷavāvatu, piṟarkkuriya poruḷmaṟiyiṟ kōṭal. |iṉṉataṉṟi, |ottārkkum mikkārkkum potuvākiyakaṉṉiyarit tamar koṭuppak koḷḷātu, kaṉṉiyar tam |icciyiṉāltamari maṟittup puṇarntu piṉṉum |aṟanilivaḻāmal niṟṟalāl |iḵtu|aṟameṉappaṭum. |aṉtātal |iccūttirattāṉum viḷaṅkum.

<P>|aḵtaṟṟāka, mēli |ottiṉōṭu |ivvōttiṟku |iyipu |eṉṉi yeṉiṉ,mēl kikkiḷi mutaṟ peruntiṇi |iṟuvāyāka |eḻutiṇi |oti |avaṟṟiṉpuṟattu nikaḻun tiṇikaḷum vāyāka |eḻutiṇi |oti |avaṟṟiṉ puṟattunikaḻun tiṇikaḷum |otip pōntār. |avveḻutiṇiyiṉum |orutalivēṭkiyākiya kikkiḷiyum, |oppilkūṭṭamākiya peruntiṇiyum|oḻittu |iruvaraṉpum |otta nilimiyākiya naṭuvaṇ|aintiṇikkaṇṇum puṇarppum piritalum |iruttalum |iraṅkalum|ūṭalumākiya |uripporuḷ kaḷavu kaṟpu |eṉṉum |iruvakik kikōḷiṉumnikaḻumātaliṉ, |avviruvakik kikōḷiṉuṅ kaḷavākiya kikōḷ|ivvōttiṉuḷ |uṇarttutalāṉ |avaṟṟiṉ piṉ kikōḷ |ivvōttiṉuḷ|uṇarttutalāṉ |avaṟṟiṉ piṉ kūṟappaṭṭatu. |itu naṭuvaṇintiṇikkaṇnikaḻum poruṭpākupāṭāyiṉ, |akattiṇiyiyaliṉ piṉ vikkaṟpālatu|eṉiṉ, |āṇṭu vikkak karutiṉ ``veṭci tāṉē kuṟiñciyatu puṟaṉē'[puṟattiṇi- 59] |eṉṉum māṭṭēṟu peṟātām |ataṉiṭik kaḷaviyalumkaṟpiyalum kiṭattalāṉ |eṉka.

<P>maṟṟum, |aḵtu yāṅkaṉam |uṇarttiṉārō |eṉiṉ,
<BR>``kāmap puṇarcciyum |iṭantali paṭalum
<BR>pāṅkoṭu taḻā |alun tōḻiyiṟ puṇarvumeṉṟu
<BR>|āṅkanāl vakiyiṉum |aṭinta cārvoṭu
<BR>maṟiyeṉa mo#āḻitaṉ maṟiyōr |āṟē'' (ceyyuḷiyal. 178)

<BR>|eṉpataṉāṉ |innālvakiyum |itaṉuḷ |urikkappaṭukiṉṟateṉṟukoḷḷappaṭum. kāmappuṇarcci yeṉiṉum, |iyaṟkip puṇarcciyeṉiṉum,muṉṉuṟu puṇarcci yeṉiṉum, teyvap puṇarcci yeṉiṉum |okkum.|iviyellām kāraṇappeyar. |aḵtāvatu, |ottār |iruvar tāmē kūṭuṅkūṭṭam. |iṭantalippāṭāvatu, |iyaṟkip puṇarcci puṇarntatalimakaḷ piṟṟiñāṉṟum |avviṭattuc ceṉṟu |etirppaṭutal. pāṅkaṟkūṭṭamāvatu, |ippuṇarcci pāṅkaṟku |urittu, nī yemakkut tuṇiyākavēṇṭumeṉṟa |avaṉ kuṟivaḻic ceṉṟu talimakaḷ niṉṟa niliyiyuṇarttac ceṉṟu kūṭutal. tōḻiyiṟ kūṭṭamāvatu, |ivaṟṟiṉ piṉṉar|ikkūṭṭam nīṭaccēṟal vēṇṭit tōḻiyi |irantu piṉṉiṉṟu |avaḷvāyilākak kūṭutal. |ivi nāṉkum |immuṟiyē nikaḻum |eṉṟu koḷka.|iṉi |immuṟi nikaḻātu |iṭiyīṭu paṭṭuvarum. |aḵtāmāṟu,talimakaḷ |etirppaṭṭuḻi |aṉpuṭiyār |ellārkkum |iyaṟkippuṇarcci muṭṭiṉṟik kūṭutal |ulakiyal |aṉmiyāṉ talimakaḷiyā#ātāṉum |oriṭattu |etirppaṭṭa talimakaṉ |avaḷkātaṟkuṟippuṇarntu niṉṟu, kūṭṭattiṟku |iṭiyīṭu |uṇṭāyuḻipum|āṇṭuc ceṉṟa vēṭki taṇiyātu niṉṟu, muṉṉi ñāṉṟu kaṇṭāṟ pōlappiṟṟi ñāṉṟum kāṇṭāṟ pōlap piṟṟi ñāṉṟum kāṇalākumō |eṉa |āṇṭuccēṟalum, talimakaḷum |avvāṟē vēṭkiyāṉ |aṭarppuṇṭu|āṇṭuvarutalum |ākiyavaḻip puṇarcci nikaḻum. |āṇṭu |āyattārāṉātalpiṟarāṉātal |iṭiyīṭapaṭṭuḻit taṉvaruttattiṉip pāṅkaṟku |uṇartti|avaṉ talimakaḷ niṉṟuḻi yaṟintu kūṟa, |āṇṭucceṉṟu puṇarum.|avviṭattum |iṭiyīṭu paṭṭuḻit tōḻivāyilāka muyaṉpuṟeytum.|ivvāṟum, |orōvoṉṟu |iṭiyīṭupaṭṭu varutalum |uḷavām. |avvāṟāyiṉ,|iyaṟkip puṇarcci |iṭiyīṭupaṭṭuḻi varinteytal takkataṉṟō|eṉiṉ, varinteytuntiṟam nīṭṭikkumāyiṉ vēṭki niṟuttalāṟṟātārpuṇarcci karuti muyalpa. |ivvāṟu cāṉṟōr ceyyuḷ vantaṉavum |uḷavō|eṉiṉ, cāṉṟōr ceyyuṭkaḷum |ivvāṟu poruḷkoḷḷa |ēṟpaṉa |uḷa.|aviyāvaṉa :-
<BR>``maruntiṉ tīrā maṇṇiṉ |ākātu
<BR>|aruntava muyaṟciyiṉ |akaṟṟalum |aritē
<BR>tāṉcey nōykkut tāṉmarun tākiya
<BR>tēṉ|imir naṟaviṉ tēṟal pōla
<BR>nītara vanta niṟi |arun tuyaramniṉ
<BR>|āṭukoṭi maruṅkiṉ |aruḷiṉ |allatu
<BR>piṟitil tīrāteṉpatu |eḻumō neñcacē
<BR>nāṭuvaḷaṅ koṇṭu pukaḻnaṭutal vēṇṭittaṉ
<BR>|āṭumaḻit taṭakki |aṟuttumuṟi ceyta
<BR>poṟki naṟuntārp puṉitērp pāṇṭiyaṉ
<BR>koṟki |am peruntuṟi kuṉitiri tokutta
<BR>viḷaṅkumuttu |uṟikkum veṇpal
<BR>paṉmāṇ cāyal paratavar makaṭkē.''

<P>|itaṉuḷ ``|āṭukoṭi maruṅkiṉ |aruḷiṉ |allatu piṟitil tīrātu''|eṉpataṉāṉ |iyaṟkip puṇarcci |iṭiyīṭu paṭṭup puṇarccikarutikkūṟiyavāṟu kāṇka.
``mayilkol maṭavāḷkol mānīrt tiriyuḷ
payiltatōr teyvaṅkol kēḷir--kuyil payirum
kaṉṉi |iḷañāḻal pūmpoḻil nōkkiya
kaṇṇiṉ varuntum|eṉ neñcu.'' (tiṇimoḻi-49)
|itaṉuḷ |aiyaniliyip pāṅkaṟku |urittaliṉ puṇarcci |iṉṟāyiṟṟu.
``koṇṭal māmaḻi kuṭakkērpu kuḻitta
ciṟukōl |iṇara peruntaṇ cāntam
vakicēr |aimpāl takipeṟa vārip
pularviṭat tutirta tukaḷpaṭu kūḻip
peruṅkaṇ |āyam |uvappat tanti
neṭuntēr vaḻaṅkum nilavumaṇal muṟṟattup
pantoṭu peyarum parivi lāṭṭi
|aruḷiṉum |aruḷāḷ |āyiṉum peritaḻintu
piṉṉili muṉiyalmā neñcē |eṉṉatū |um
|aruntuyar |avalan tīrkkum
marunta piṟitilli yāṉ|uṟṟa nōykkē.'' (naṟṟiṇi-140)
|itaṉuḷ `|aruḷiṉum |aruḷāḷāyiṉum' |eṉṟamiyāl kūṭṭamiṉmiyum,piṉṉili muṉiyal' |eṉṟamiyāl |irantu piṉṉiṟpāṉākattuṇintamiyum, tōḻiyiṟ kūṭṭattu |iyaṟkip puṇarccikku|oruppaṭṭamiyum |uṇark.
``naṟavukkamaḻ |alari naṟavu vāyvirintu
|iṟaṅkitaḻ kamaḻum |icivāy neytaṟ
kaṇṇit taliyar karuṅkip paratavar
|oṇcuṇaṅ kiḷamuli |oruñāṉṟu puṇariṉ
nuṇkayiṟ ṟuṟuvali numaroṭu vāṅkik
kiti vēli |ivvūrc
ceytūṭ ṭēṉō ciṟukuṭi yāṉē.''
periyīreṉac cēṭpaṭuttavaḻik kūṟiyatu.
``kūṟuvam kollō kūṟalam kolleṉak
karanta kāmam kinniṟuk kallātu
nayantunām viṭṭa naṉmoḻi nampi
|arināḷ yāmattu viḻumaḻi karantu
kārviri kamaḻuṅ kūntaṟ ṟūviṉi
nuṇṇūl |ākam poruntiṉaḷ veṟpiṉ
|iḷamaḻi cūḻnta maṭamayil pōla
vaṇṭuvaḻip paṭarat taṇmalar kūṭaccūl
|amcilam poṭukki |añciṉaḷ vantu
tuñcūr yāmattu muyaṅkiṉaḷ peyarvōḷ
|āṉṟa kaṟpiṟ cāṉṟa periyaḷ
|ammā |ariviyō |allaḷ teṉā|atu
|ā |ay naṉṉāṭṭu |aṇaṅkuṭic cilampaṟ
kaviram peyariya vurukeḻu kavā |aṉ
nērmali niṟicuṉi |uṟiyuñ
cūrmakaḷ mātō |eṉṉumeṉ neñcē.''
|itu tōḻiyiṟkūṭiya talimakaḷ kūṟṟu.

``|avari poruntiya piṅkural |ēṉal
kavari maṭamā ka tū|um paṭarcāral
kāṉaka nāṭa maṟaval vayaṅkiḻikku
yāṉiṭi niṉṟa puṇi.'' (|aintiṇiyeḻu 1)
|itaṉāṉē muntuṟṟakūṭṭamiṉmi yuṇarka. |iṉi |oru kūṭṭamum nikaḻātu|āṇaṭu vantaṭivēṭki |iruvarkkum taṇiyātu niṉṟu varinteytalum|oṉṟu. |ivvakiyiṉāṉ |ikkaḷavoḻukkam mūvakippaṭum.

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_89">{SA TP89i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li>|iṉpamum poruḷum |aṟaṉum |eṉṟāṅku
<li>|aṉpoṭu puṇarnta |aintiṇi maruṅkiṉ
<li>kāmak kūṭṭaṅ kāṇuṅ kāli
<li>maṟipōr tē |ettu maṉṟal |eṭṭaṉuḷ
<li>tuṟiyami nalyāḻt tuṇimiyōr |iyalpē.
</ol>

<P>|iṉi, |itaṉ taliccūttiram |eṉṉutaliṟṟō veṉiṉ,kāmappuṇar/ccikku |ilakkaṇa vakiyāṟ kuṟiyiṭutali |uṇarttutalnutaliṟṟu, |eṉpatu cūttiram.

<P>(|itaṉ poruḷ.) |iṉpamum poruḷu......kāṇuṅ kālili|eṉpatu--|iṉpamum poruḷum |aṟaṉum |eṉṟu collappaṭṭu,|aṉpoṭupuṇarnta naṭuvaṇ |aintiṇiyiṭattu nikaḻum kāmakkūṭṭattiṉi|ārāyuṅkālattu |eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>|aṉpoṭu puṇarnta |aintiṇi |eṉṟataṉāl kikkiḷi peruntiṇiyi|oḻittu niṉṟa mulli kuṟiñci pāli marutam neytal |eṉakkoḷḷappaṭum. |avi |aṉpoṭu puṇarntavāṟu |eṉṉi |aṉpiṉarākippuṇartalum piritalum |iruttalum |ūṭalum |iraṅkalum nikaḻttup|ākalāṉum, |avi nikaḻuṅkāl |attiṇikku |uṟuppākiya |iṭamumkālamum karupporuḷum tuṇiyāki nikaḻumākalāṉum, |ivi |iṉpoṭupuṇarntaṉa |eṉka. |aḵtēl, |aintiṇip puṟattavākiya veṭci, vañci,|uḻiñi, tumpi, vāki |eṉpaṉavum |aṉpoṭu puṇarntaṉavām |eṉiṉ.|avi |aṉpuṭiyār palarkūṭi nikaḻttupavi yākaliṉ, |aṉpoṭupuṇarntaṉavām.

<P>``|aṟattiṟkē |aṉpucārpu |eṉpa |aṟiyār
<BR>maṟattiṟkum |aḵtē tuṇi'' (kuṟaḷ-76)
|eṉpataṉālum koḷka.

<P>|iṉi, |ivvintiṇiyum |iṉpamum poruḷum |aṟamum |āyiṉavāṟu|eṉṉiyeṉiṉ, puṇartal mutalākiya |aintuporuḷum |iṉpantarutaliṉ|iṉpamāyiṉa. mulli mutalākiya |aintiṇikkum |uṟuppākiya nilamumkālamum karupporuḷum |ivaṟṟiṉ puṟattākiya veṭci vañci |uḻiñitumpi |eṉpaṉavum vākayuḷ |oru kūṟum poruḷākayāṉum, poruḷāyiṉa.|ivvoḻukkaṅkaḷ |aṟattiṉvaḻi nikaḻtalāṉum, pāliyākiyayavākippaṭalattuḷ |aṟanili kūṟutalāṉum, |ivi |aṟamāyiṉa. |aḵtēl,kikkiḷi peruntiṇiyum |ivaṟṟiṉ puṟamākiya pāṭāṇpāṭṭum kāñciyum|aṟamutalākiya mūṉṟumaṉṟi |aṉpoṭu puṇartal vēṇṭumeṉiṉ, kāñci|aṉpoṭu puṇarāmiyum, pāṭāṇpāṭṭu |aṉpoṭu puṇartal|orutaliyaṉmiyum |avvōttiṉuḷ kaṇṭukoḷka |ēṉiyiraṇṭum |aṉpoṭupuṇarāmi mēṟcollappaṭṭaṉa. |iṉi |avi |aṟaṉum poruḷumāy|iṉpamākā: |aḵtēl, |aṟaṉum poruḷum |ākāmiyum vēṇṭumeṉiṉ, kulaṉumkuṇaṉuṅ kalviyum |uṭiyarākiya |antaṇar |eṉa vicēṭittavaḻi|ēṉiyōrkku |immūṉṟu poruḷum |iyital vēṇṭumeṉṉum niyamam|iṉmiyiṉ |ēṟṟavaḻik koḷḷappaṭum

<P>|iṉi, |aintiṇimaruṅkiṟ kāmakkūṭṭam |eṉpatu puṇartalmutalākiya |uripporuḷum, |annilamum kālamum karupporuḷum,kaḷaviṉum kaṟpiṉum varutaliṉ, |avi |orōvoṉṟu |iruvakippaṭum.|avaṟṟuḷ, puṇarcciyākiya |iruvakiyiṉum kaḷavākiya kāmakkūṭṭam|eṉakkoḷka.

<P>|iṉṉum |aṉpoṭupuṇarnta |aintiṇimaruṅkiṟ kāmakkūṭṭam|eṉṟataṉāl |ellānilattiṉum kāmakkūṭṭam nikaḻappeṟum |eṉṟu koḷka.|ivvāṟātal cāṉṟōr ceyyuḷakattuk kāṇka.


<P>maṟiyōr tē|et...yōriyalpē |eṉpatu-maṟiyōriṭat tōtappaṭṭamaṇam |eṭṭaṉuḷḷum tuṟiyami nalyāḻiṉi yuṭiyarākiya tuṇimiyōrneṟi |eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>maṟiyōr |eṉṟatu |antaṇari. tē|em |eṉṟatu |avaratākiya nūli.maṇam |eṭṭāvaṉa: piramam, piracāpattiyam, |āriṭam, teyvam,kāntiruvam, |acuram, |irākkatam, picācam |eṉpaṉa. piramamāvatu,kaṉṉiyi |aṇikalaṉ |aṇintu piramacāriya yiruppāṉoruvaṉukkuttāṉamākak koṭuppatu. piracāpattiyamāvatu, makaṭkō#āṭaṟkuriyakōttirattār makaḷ vēṇṭiyavaḻi |irumutukuravarum |iyintukoṭuppatu. |āriṭamāvatu, |oṉṟāṉum |iraṇṭāṉum |āvum |āṉēṟumvāṅkikkoṭuppatu. teyvamāvatu, vēḷvikku |āciriyarāy niṉṟārpalaruḷḷum |oruvarkku vēḷvittī muṉṉark koṭuppatu. kāntiruvamāvatu|otta |iruvar tāmē kūṭuṅkūṭṭam. |acuramāvatu, villēṟṟiṉāṉātaltiripaṉṟi yeytāṉātal kōṭaṟkuriyaṉeṉk kūṟiyavaḻi |atu ceytāṟkukkoṭuttal. |irākkatamāvatu talimakaḷ taṉṉiṉum tamariṉum peṟātuvalitiṟkoḷvatu. picācamāvatu, kaḷittārmāṭṭun tuyiṉṟārmāṭṭuṅkūṭutal.

<P>``|aṟaṉnili |oppē poruḷkōḷ teyvam
yāḻōr kūṭṭam |arum poruḷ viṉiyē
|irākkatam pēynili |eṉṟik kūṟiya
maṟiyōr maṉṟal |eṭṭavi |avaṟṟuḷ
tuṟiyami nalyāḻt tuṇimiyōr puṇarppiṉataṉ
poruṇmi |eṉmaṉār pulami yōrē.''
|eṉapataṉāluṅ koḷka. tuṟiyami nalyāḻttuṇimiyōrāvārkantiruvar. |avar |iruvarākit tiritaliṉtuṇimiyōr |eṉṟār. tuṇiyaṉpāvatu |avar |oḻukalā ṟōṭottumakkaṇmāṭṭu nikaḻvatu. |īṇṭuk kāmakkūṭṭameṉa |otappaṭṭatumaṇavikaṟpamākiya |eṭṭaṉuḷḷuṅ kantiruvameṉṟavāṟu/. mālicūṭṭalyātaṉuḷ |aṭaṅkumeṉiṉ, |atuvum |otta |aṉpiṉarāy nikaḻtaliṟkantiruvappāṟpaṭum.
|aṟaṉum poruḷum |iṉpamum |eṉṉātu, |iṉpamum voruḷum |aṟaṉum|eṉṟatu |eṉṉi |eṉaṉ, palavaki |uyirkaṭkum varum |iṉpam|iruvakippaṭum. |aviyāvaṉa, pōkam nukartalum vīṭupoṟutalum|eṉa. |avaṟṟuḷ vīṭupēṟu tuṟavaṟattil niṉṟārkkallatu |eytal|aritāyiṟṟu. pōkanukartal maṉiyaṟattārk keytuvatu. |avareytum|iṉpamum |avviṉpattiṟkuk kāraṇamākiya poruruḷum |apporuṭkuckāraṇamākiya |aṟaṉum |eṉak kāriya kāraṇam nōkkivittār |eṉka.
|itaṉāṟ colliyatu |īṇṭukkaḷaveṉṟōtap paṭukiṉṟa |oḻukkam|aṟampayavāta puṟaneṟiyaṉṟu; vētaviyākiya tantiram |eṉavikaṟpamākiya neṟi kūṟiyavāṟu. (1)


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_90">{SA TP90i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li>|oṉṟē vēṟē |eṉṟiru pālvayiṉ
<li>|oṉṟi |uyarnta pāla tāṇiyiṉ
<li>|otta kiḻavaṉum kiḻattiyum kāṇpa
<li>mikkō ṉāyiṉuṅ kaṭivari |iṉṟē.
</ol>

<P>|eṉ--|eṉiṉ, |itu kāmakkūṭṭattiṉkaṇ talimakaṉum talimakaḷum|etirppaṭuntiṟaṉum |ataṟkuk kāraṇamum |uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.
(|i-ḷ.) |oṉṟē vēṟē |eṉṟiru pālvayiṉ |eṉpatu--|oruvaṉum|oruttiyumāka |illaṟañ ceytuḻi, |avviruvariyum maṟupiṟappiṉum|oṉṟuvittalum vēṟākkutalumākiya |iruvaki |ūḻiṉum |eṉṟavāṟu.


<P>|oṉṟi |uyarnta pālatāṇiyiṉ |eṉṟatu--|iruvaruḷḷamumpiṟapputtōṟum |oṉṟu nalviṉikkaṇṇē nikaḻnta |uḻiṉatu |āṇiyiṉ|eṉṟavāṟu.


<P>|uyarntataṉmēṟcellum maṉanikaḻcci |uyarnta pālāyiṟṟu.kāmanikaḻcciyiṉkaṇ |otta |aṉpiṉarāyk kūṭutal nalviṉiyāṉ |allatuvārāteṉpatu karuttu.


<P>|otta kiḻavaṉum kiḻattiyuṅ kāṇpa |eṉpatu--
|oppu pattuvakippaṭum. |avi,
``piṟappē kuṭimi |āṇmi |āṇṭōṭu
|uruvu niṟutta kāma vāyil
niṟiyē |aruḷē |uṇarvoṭu tiruveṉa
muṟiyuṟak kiṟanta |oppiṉatu vakiyē'' (meyp. 25)
|eṉṉum meyppāṭṭiyaṟ cūttirattuḷ kūṟiya pattumām. |avaṟṟuḷpiṟappāvatu, |antaṇar, |aracar, vaṇikar, vēḷāḷar, |āyar, vēṭṭuvarkuṟavar, nuḷiyar |eṉṟāṟpōla varuṅkulam. kuṭimiyāvatu|akkulattiṉuḷḷār |ellāruñ ciṟappāka |ovvāmiyiṉ |acciṟappākiya|oḻukkampaṟṟiya kuṭivaravik kuṭimi |eṉṟār.
``piṟappokkum |ellā |uyirkkum ciṟappovvā
ceytoḻil vēṟṟumi yāṉ'' (kuṟaḷ. 972)
|eṉap piṟarum kulattiṉkaṇṇē ciṟappeṉpatu |oṉṟuṇṭeṉṟukūṟiṉārākaliṉ. |āṇmiyāvatu, |āṇmittaṉmi. |aḵtāvatu,|āḷviṉiyuṭimiyum vali peyarāmiyumām.
``moḻiyā tataṉi muṭṭiṉṟu muṭittal'' (marapiyal. 110)
|eṉpataṉāl talimakaḷ māṭṭup poṇmiyum koḷḷappaṭum. |atupeṇṭirkku |iyalpākiya nāṇam mutalāyiṉavum peṇṇīrmiyum.|āṇṭeṉpatu, |oruvariṉoruvar mutiyaraṇṟi |otta paruvattarātal |atukuḻavipparuvaṅ kaḻintu patiṉāṟu pirāyattāṉum paṉṉiraṇṭu to. po.|i.-11
pirāyattāḷum |ātal. |uruvu |eṉpatu vaṉappu. niṟutta kāmavāyil|eṉpatu niliniṟuttappaṭṭa puṇarccikku vāyil. |aḵtāvatu, |oruvarmāṭṭu |oruvarkku nikaḻum |aṉpu. niṟi |eṉpatu |aṭakkam. |aruḷ|eṉpatu piṟar varuttattiṟkup puriyum karuṇi, |uṇarveṉpatu|aṟivutiru |eṉapatu celvam. |ippattu vakiyum |otta kiḻavaṉumkiḻattiyum |etirppaṭuvar |eṉak koḷka.


<P>mikkō......|iṉṟē |eṉpatu--|ikkuṇaṅkaḷāl talimakaṉmikkāṉāyiṉuṅ kaṭiyappaṭātu |eṉṟavāṟu.
|eṉavē, |ivaṟṟuḷ yātāṉum |oṉṟiṉāyiṉum talimakaḷ mikkāḷāyiṉ|aintiṇiyiṟ kaṭiyappaṭum |eṉṟavāṟām.


<P>pālatāṇiyiṉ...kāṇpa |eṉpatu--|oruvari yoruvarkaṇṭuvaḻiyellām puṇarcci vēṭki tōṟṟāmiyiṟ pālatāṇiyāṉ|oruvari yoruvar puṇartaṟ kuṟippoṭu kāṇpa |eṉṟavāṟu.mikkōṉāyiṉum |eṉṟa |ummi |iṟantu taḻī|iya |eccavummi. |eṟṟukku,|etirmaṟiyākki `|iḻintōṉāyiṉum kaṭiyappaṭātu' |eṉṟātkuṟṟameṉṉiyeṉiṉ, centamiḻ nilattu vaḻakkoṭu civaṇivarukiṉṟaperumiyātaliṉ, |iḻintāṉoṭu |uyarntāṭkuḷatākiya kūṭṭamiṉmiperuvaḻakkātaliṉ |atu poruḷākak koḷḷām |eṉpatu. |īṇṭuk kiḻavaṉumkiḻattiyum |eṉa |oruvaṉum |oruttiyumu/pōlak kūṟiṉārāyiṉum,
``|orupāṟ kiḷavi yēṉippāṟ kaṇṇum
varuvaki tāṉē vaḻakkeṉa moḻipa'' (poruḷiyal-26)
|eṉpataṉāṉum, |innūl |ulaka vaḻakkē nōkkutalāṉum |avarpalavakippaṭuvar. |aḵtāmāṟu |antaṇar |aracar vaṇikar viṉiñar|eṉṉum nālvaroṭum |anulōmar |aṟuvariyum kūṭṭap patiṉmarāvar.|ivari nālvaki nilattōṭu |uṟaḻa nāṟpatiṉmarāvar. |ivariyum|avvannilattiṟkuriya |āyar vēṭṭuvar kuṟavar paratavar |eṉṉuntoṭakkattārōṭu kūṭṭap palarāvar. |avariyum |uyirppaṉmiyāṉ nōkkavarampilarāvar.

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_91">{SA TP91i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li>ciṟantuḻi |aiyañ ciṟanta teṉpa
<li>|iḻintuḻi |iḻivē cuṭṭa lāṉa.
</ol>

<P>|eṉ--|eṉiṉ, |aiyam nikaḻum |iṭam |uṇar/ttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>(|i-ḷ.) |oruvaṉ |oruttiyik kaṇṇuṟṟiḻi |avviru vakiyum|uyarvuṭiyarāyiṉ |avviṭattu |aiyam ciṟantatu |eṉṟu colluvar;|avar |iḻipuṭiyarāyiṉ, |avviṭattu |eṉpatu mikuti,|aiyamikutalāvatu makkaḷuḷḷāḷ |allaḷ teyvamō |eṉa mēlāyiṉārōṭē|aiyuṟutal, ciṟantuḻi |eṉpataṟkut talimakaḷtāṉ ciṟantuḻiyumkoḷḷappaṭum; |avaḷik kaṇṭa |iṭam |aiyappaṭutaṟkuc ciṟantuḻiyumkoḷḷappaṭum. |uruvamikutiyuṭiyaḷātaliṉ |āyattāriṭik kāṇiṉumteyvam |eṉṟu |aiyuṟutal. |itaṉāṟ colliyatu |ulakattuttalimakaṉum talimakaḷumāka nammāl vēṇṭappaṭṭār |antaṇarmutalākiya nāṉku varuṇattiṉum |āyar vēṭṭuvar kuṟavar paratavar|eṉṉum toṭakkattiṉum |akkulattārākiya kuṟunila maṉṉar māṭṭum|uḷarāvaraṉṟē; |avarellāriṉum celvattāṉum kulattāṉum vaṭivāṉum|uyarnta talimakaṉum talimakaḷumāyiṉōr māṭṭē |aiyam nikaḻvatu.|allātār māṭṭum |av viḻimarapiṉiyē cuṭṭiyuṇarā niṟkumātalāṉ|eṉṟavāṟu.
`kārārap peyta' |eṉṉum mullik kaliyuḷ (kalit. 109)

``paṇṇit tamartan torupuṟan ti|iya
kaṇṇi |eṭukkallāk kōṭēn takalalkul
puṇṇilār puṇṇāka nōkku muḻumeyyuṅ
kaṇṇaḷō |āyamakaḷ''
|eṉa |aiyamiṉṟic cuṭṭiyuṇarntavāṟu kāṇka.
|iṉi |uyarpuḷvaḻi |aiyam nikaḻuvāṟu:
``|uyarmoḻik kiḷavi |uṟaḻuṅ kiḷavi
|aiyak kiḷavi |āṭū |uviṟku |urittē'' (poruḷiyal-42)
|eṉṟārākaliṉ, |aiyappaṭuvāṉ talimakaṉ |eṉṟu koḷka. talimakaḷ|aiyappaṭātatu |eṉṉiyeṉiṉ, |avaḷ |aiyappaṭuṅkāl teyvamōveṉṟu|aiyuṟal vēṇṭum. |avvāṟu |aiṟṟāl |accam varum. |aḵtu |etuvākakkāma nikaḻcci yuṇṭākātu. (3)


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_92">{SA TP92i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li> vaṇṭē |iḻiyē vaḷḷi pūvē
<li>kaṇṇē |alamaral |imippē |accameṉṟu
<li>|aṉṉavi piṟavum |āṅkaṇ nikaḻa
<li>niṉṟavi kaḷiyuṅ karuvi |eṉpa.
</ol>

<P>|eṉ--|eṉiṉ, |aiyappaṭṭāṉ tuṇitaṟkuk karuvi |uṇarttutalnutaliṟṟu.


<P>(|i-ḷ.) |eṇṇappaṭṭa vaṇṭu mutalākiya |eṭṭum piṟavumāki|avviṭattu nikaḻāniṉṟa |aiyam kaḷiyum karuvi |eṉṟavāṟu.
|aiyameṉpatu |atikārattāṉ vantatu. `nikaḻāniṉṟavi' |eṉpatukuṟukiniṉṟatu. vaṇṭāvatu mayiriṉ |aṇinta pūvic cūḻum vaṇṭu. |atupayiṉṟataṉ mēlallatu cellāmiyiṉ |atuvum makkaḷuḷḷāḷeṉṟaṟitaṟkukkaruviyāyiṟṟu. |iḻiyeṉpatu |aṇikalaṉ. |atu ceyyappaṭṭateṉatatōṟṟutalālum, teyvappūṇceyyā |aṇiyātalāṉum |atuvum |aṟitaṟakukkaruviyāyiṟṟu. vaḷḷi |eṉpatu muliyiṉum tōḷiṉum |eḻutiya koṭi.|atuvum |ulakiṉ |uḷḷatākit tōṉṟutaliṉ (|atuvum) karuviyāyiṟṟu.|alamaral |eṉpatu taṭumāṟutal. teyvamāyiṉ niṉṟavaḻi niṟkum.|avvāṟaṉṟi, niṉṟuḻi niṟkiṉṟilaḷ |eṉṟu cuḻaṟciyum |aṟitaṟkukkaruviyāyiṟṟu. |imip peṉpatu kaṇṇimittal. teyvattiṟkuk kaṇ|imiyāmiyiṉ |atuvum |aṟitaṟkuk karuviyāyiṟṟu. |accameṉpatu|āṇmakkaḷik kaṇṭu |añcutal. |atu teyvattiṟku |iṉmiyāṉ |atuvum|aṟitaṟkuk karuviyāyiṟṟu. |aṉṉavi piṟavum |eṉṟataṉāṉkālnilantōytal, viyarttal, niḻalāṭu koḷka. |ivi karuviyākattuṇiyappaṭum |eṉṟavāṟu.
kāṭci mutalākiya |ittuṇiyum kikkiḷik kuṟippām. |itaṟkuc ceyyuḷvantavaḻik kāṇka. |iṉik kuṟippaṟital kūṟukiṉṟārākiliṉ |akkuṟippunikaḻumvaḻi |iviyellām |akamām. |eṉṉi? |iruvar māṭṭumottanikaḻcci yātalāṉ. |ivi talimakaḷ māṭṭup pulappaṭanikaḻātu.|āṇṭuk kuṟippiṟāṟ ciṟitu nikaḻumeṉṟu koḷka.
|avi varumāṟu :-
``|uṇṭārkaṇ |allatu |aṭunaṟāk kāmampōl
kaṇṭār makiḻceytal |iṉṟu'' (kuṟaḷ. 1090)
|eṉavarum. piṟavum |aṉṉa.


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_93">{SA TP93i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li> nāṭṭam |iraṇṭum |aṟivuṭam paṭuttaṟkuk
<li>kūṭṭi |urikkuṅ kuṟippuri yākum.
</ol>

<P>|eṉ--|eṉiṉ mēl talimakaḷi |ittaṉmiyaḷ |eṉat tuṇintatalimakaṉ kuṟippaṟiyātu cāraluṟiṉ peruntiṇippāṟpaṭu mākalāṉum|ik kantiruvaneṟikku |otta |uḷḷattārātal vēṇṭumātalāṉum, |āṇṭu|oruvarōṭoruvar collāṭutal marapaṉmiyāṉum, |avaruḷḷakkaruttaṟital vēṇṭutaliṉ, |ataṟkuk karuviyāya |uṇarttutalnutaliṟṟu.


<P>(|i-ḷ.) nāṭṭam |iraṇṭum |eṉpatu--talimakaṉ kaṇṇum talimakaḷkaṇṇum |eṉṟavāṟu.

|aṟivuṭampaṭuttaṟku |eṉpatu--|oruvar vēṭkipōla |iruvarkkumvēṭki |uḷatākuṅ kollō |eṉak kavarttu niṉṟa |iruvaratu|aṟiviṉiyum |oruppaṭuttaṟku |eṉṟavāṟu.

kūṭṭiyurikkuṅ kuṟippuriyākum |eṉpatu--tamatuvēṭkiyoṭu kūṭṭi|oruvar |oruvarukku |urikkuṅ kāmakkuṟippuriyām |eṉṟavāṟu.

|itaṉ poḻippu :- |iruvarkkuṅ kavarttu niṉṟa |aṟivi |oruppaṭuttaṟporuṭṭu vēṭkiyoṭukūṭṭik kūṟuṅ kāmakkuṟippuccol |iruvaratunāṭṭamākum |eṉṟavāṟu.

|ākum |eṉpataṉi nāṭṭam |eṉapataṉoṭu kūṭṭiyurikka. |itaṟkucceyyuḷ:-
``pāṉalan taṇkaḻip pāṭaṟintu taṉ|aimār
nūlnala nuṇvaliyāṟ koṇṭeṭutta--kāṉaṟ
paṭupulāl kāppāḷ paṭineṭuṅkaṇ nōkkam
kaṭipollā |eṉṉiyē kāppu.'' (tiṇimāli nūṟ. 31)
kaṇṇiṉāṉ |aṟipa |eṉṟavāṟu.


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_94">{SA TP94i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li> kuṟippē kuṟittatu koḷḷu māyiṉ
<li>|āṅkavi nikaḻum |eṉmaṉār pulavar.
</ol>

<P>|eṉ--|eṉiṉ, mēlataṟkōr puṟaṉaṭi yuṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.


<P>(|i-ḷ.) |oruvar kuṟippu |oruvar kuṟittataṉik koḷḷumāyiṉ,|avviṭattuk kaṇṇiṉāṉ varuṅ kuṟippuri nikaḻum |eṉṟavāṟu.
|eṉavē, kuṟippik koḷḷātavaḻi |akkuṟippuri nikaḻātu |eṉṟavāṟām.|itaṉāṟ colliyatu kaṇṭa kālattē vēṭki muntuṟṟa vaḻiyē|ikkaṇṇiṉāṉ varuṅ kuṟippu nikaḻvatu; |allātavaḻi nikaḻātu|eṉṟavāṟu. |iṉik kuṟippu nikaḻumāṟum |ataṉ vēṟupāṭummeyppāṭṭiyaluḷ kūṟupa. |īṇṭum cila |utāraṇam kāṭṭuvam.
``nōkkiṉāḷ nōkki |iṟiñciṉāḷ |aḵtavaḷ
yāppiṉuḷ |aṭṭiya nīr'' (kuṟaḷ. 1093)
|eṉavum,
``|aciyiyaṟku |uṇṭāṇṭōr |ē|eryāṉ nōkkap
paciyiṉaḷ piya nakum'' (kuṟaḷ-1098)
|eṉavum varum. piṟavum |aṉṉa. talimakaṉ kuṟipput talimakaḷ|aṟinta vaḻiyum kūṟṟu nikaḻātu, peṇmiyāṉ.


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_95">{SA TP95i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li> perumiyum |uraṉum |āṭū|u mēṉa.
</ol>

<P>|eṉ--|eṉiṉ, |itu talimakaṟku |uriyatōr |ilakkaṇamuṇarttutalnutaliṟṟu.


<P>(|i-ḷ.) perumi yāvatu--paḻiyum pāvamum |añcutal |uraṉ|eṉpatu--|aṟivu.
/|ivi yiraṇṭum |āṇmakaṉukku |iyalpu |eṉṟavāṟu.
|itaṉāṉē mēṟcollappaṭṭa talimakaḷatu vēṭkik kuṟippuk kaṇṭatalimakaṉ, |anniliyē puṇarcciyi niṉiyātu, varintu |eytum|eṉpatu peṟutum.
``ceṉṟa |iṭattāl celaviṭā tī tori|i
naṉṟiṉpāl |uyppa taṟivu'' (kuṟaḷ. 422)
|eṉpavākaliṉ. talimakaṉ |ivvāṟu kūṟiyataṟkuc ceyyuḷ :-
``vēyeṉat tiṇṭatōḷ veṟikamaḻ vaṇar|aimpāl
māṉveṉṟa maṭanōkkiṉ mayiliyal taḷarpolki
|aycilppu |ariyārppa valirāḷi |iḻi|imippak
koṭiyeṉa miṉṉeṉa |aṇaṅkeṉa yātoṉṟum
terikallā |iṭiyiṉkaṭ kaṇkavarpu |oruṅkōṭa
vaḷamicāl |uyarciṟappiṉ nuntitol |uṇarkūṭal
/|iḷamiyāṉ |eṟipantō ṭikattantāy kēḷiṉ;
pūntaṇtārp pularcāntiṉ teṉṉavaṉ |uyarkūṭal
tēmpāya |aviḻnīlat talarveṉṟa |amaruṇkaṇ
|ēntukōṭ ṭeḻilyāṉi yoṉṉātārk kavaṉvēliṟ
cēntunī yiṉiyiyāl |ottatō ciṉmoḻi;
poḻipeyal vaṇmiyāṉ |acōkantaṇ kāviṉuḷ
kaḻikaviṉ |iḷamā#āviṉ taḷiraṉṉāy |ataṉtalip
paṇiyami pāymāṉtēr |avaṉceṟṟār niṟampāynta
kaṇiyiṉu nōyceytal kaṭappaṉṟō kaṉaṅkuḻāy;
vakiyami taṇtārāṉ kōṭuyar poruppiṉmēl
takiyiṇar |iḷavēṅki malaraṉṉa cuṇaṅkiṉāy
matavali mikukaṭā |at tavaṉyāṉi maruppiṉum
katavavāl takkatō kāḻkoṇṭa |iḷamuli;
|eṉavāṅku,
|iṉiyaṉa kūṟa |iṟiñcupu nilanōkki
niṉiyupu neṭi toṉṟu niṉippāḷpōṉ maṟṟāṅkē
tuṇiyami tōḻiyark kamartta kaṇṇaḷ
maṉiyāṅkup peyarntāḷeṉ |aṟivakap paṭuttē.'' (kalit. 57)

``|uṟukaḻi maruṅkiṉ |otamoṭu malarnta
ciṟukaru neytal kaṇpōl māmalarp
perun taṇ māttaḻi yirunta |alkul
|aiya |arumpiya cuṇaṅkiṉ vi|eyiṟṟu
miyīr |oti vāṇutaṟ kuṟumakaḷ
viḷiyāṭ ṭāyamoṭu veṇmaṇal |utirtta
puṉṉi nuṇtātu poṉṉiṉ noṇṭu
maṉipuṟan taruti yāyiṉ |eṉiyatū |um
|immaṉik kiḻami yemmoṭu puṇaril
tī tum |uṇṭō māta rāyeṉak
kaṭumpari naṉmāṉ koṭiñci neṭuntēr
kival pākaṉ piyeṉa |iyakka
|arivē yuṇkaṇ paṉivara loṭukkic
ciṟiya |iṟiñciṉaḷ taliyē
periya |evvam māmiva ṇuṟavē.'' (|akam. 230)
 |i vi |uḷḷappuṇarcciyāṉ varital vēṇṭip pāṅkaṟku |urittaṉa.(7)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_96">{SA TP96i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li>|accamum nāṇum maṭaṉum muntuṟutal
<li>niccamum peṇmāṟ kuriya |eṉpa.
</ol>


<P>|eṉ--|eṉiṉ, |itu talimakaṭku |uriyatōr |ilakkaṇam |uṇarttutalnutaliṟṟu.
 

<P>(|i-ḷ.) |accamum nāṇum pētimiyum |immūṉṟum nāṭōṟu muntuṟutalpeṇṭirkku |iyalpu |eṉṟavāṟu.
|eṉavē, vēṭkiyuṟṟuḻiyum |accattāṉātal nāṇāṉātal maṭattāṉātalpuṇarccikku |iciyātu niṉṟu varinteytal vēṇṭumeṉpatu pōntatu.|ivvāṟu |iruvarum |uḷḷappuṇarcciyāl niṉṟu varin teyti meyyuṟum.|itaṟkuc ceyyuḷ:
``tīmpāl kaṟanta kalamāṟṟik kaṉṟellān
tāmpiṟ piṇittu maṉiniṟī|i yāytanta
pūṅkari nīlam puṭi tāḻa meyyaci |ip pāṅkaru
mulliyun tāya pāṭṭaṅkāl tōḻinam
pulliṉat tāyar makaḷirō ṭellām
|oruṅku viḷiyāṭa |avvaḻi vanta
kuruntampūṅ kaṇṇip potuvaṉmaṟ ṟeṉṉi
muṟṟiḻi |ē|er maṭanallāy nīyāṭuñ
ciṟṟil puṉikō ciṟiteṉṟāṉ |ellānī
peṟṟēmyā meṉṟu piṟarceyta |illiruppāy
kaṟṟa tilimaṉṟa kāṇ|eṉṟēṉ muṟṟiḻāy
tātucūḻ kūntal takipeyat ti|iya
kōti puṉikō niṉakkeṉṟāṉ |ellānī
|ētilār tantapūk koḷvāy naṉimikap
pētiyi maṉṟa periteṉṟēṉ mātarāy
|aiya pitirnta cuṇaṅkaṇi meṉmulimēl
toyyi leḻutukō maṟṟeṉṟāṉ yāmpiṟar
ceypuṟam nōkki |iruttumō nīperitum
miyali mātō viṭukeṉṟēṉ tiyalāy
colliya vāṟellām māṟumāṟu yāṉpeyarppa
|allāntāṉ pōlap peyarntāṉ |avaṉinī
|āyar makaḷir |iyalpurit tentiyum
yāyum |aṟiya |urittīyiṉ yāṉuṟṟa
nōyuṅ kaḷikuvi maṉ.'' (kalit. 111)
|itu talimakaḷ |uḷḷappuṇarcciyiṉ |urimipūṇṭiruntavāṟumvarinteytak kūṟaluṟṟavāṟum kāṇka.

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_97">{SA TP97i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li> vēṭki |orutali |uḷḷutal melital
<li>|ākkañ ceppal nāṇuvari |iṟattal
<li>nōkkuva |ellām |aviyē pōṟal
<li>maṟattal mayakkañ cākkāṭu |eṉṟic
<li>ciṟappuṭi marapiṉavi kaḷaveṉa moḻipa.
</ol>


<P>|eṉ--|eṉiṉ, meyyuṟupuṇarcci nikaḻuṅkālam |uṇarttutalnutaliṟṟu.

<P>mēl, ``perumiyum |uraṉum |āṭū|u mēṉa'' |eṉavum,
``|accamum nāṇum maṭaṉum muntuṟutal
niccamum peṇpāṟ kuriya |eṉpa'' (tol. kaḷa. 8)
|eṉavum |otiyavataṉāṉ |uḷḷañ ceṉṟavaḻiyum meyyuṟupuṇarccivarinteyti nikaḻpa |eṉṟārām. |avvāḻi cākkāṭelliyākiyameyppāṭuvariṉ meyyuṟṟup puṇarappeṟu meṉpatu |uṇarttiṟṟu.
(|i-ḷ,) vēṭki mutalākac cākkāṭu |īṟāka |otappaṭṭakāmacciṟappuṭiyaṉavāṟṟāṟ kaḷavu |āmeṉṟu colluvar |eṉṟavāṟu.
|āṉum |āmum |eñci niṉṟaṉa. |ivaṟṟi |avattiyeṉpa |aḵtēl, |avipattuḷavaṉṟē; |īṇṭurittaṉa |oṉpatāleṉiṉ, kāṭci vikaṟpamuṅkūṟiṉār, |aḵtu |uṭpaṭap pattām. kāṭci vikaṟpamākiya |aiyamuntuṇivum mutalatu; vēṭki |iraṇṭāvatu, |eṉṟu koḷka.

vēṭki yāvatu--peṟalvēṇṭu meṉṉum |uḷḷanikaḻcci.

|orutaliyuḷḷuta lāvatu--|iṭiviṭātu niṉittal.
``|uḷḷik kāṇpeṉ pōlvaṉ muḷḷeyiṟṟu
|amiḻtam |ūṟuñ cevvāyk kamaḻakil
|āram nāṟum |aṟalpōṟ kūntaṟ
pēramar maḻikkaṇ koṭicci
mūral muṟuvaloṭu mati|iya nōkkē.'' (kuṟun. 286)

melita lāvatu--|uṇṇāmiyāṉ varuvatu.

|ākkañceppa lāvatu--|uṟaṅkāmiyum |uṟuva|otalum mutalāyiṉakūṟutal.
``|oṇtoṭi |arivi koṇṭaṉaḷ neñcē
vaṇṭimir paṉittuṟit toṇṭi |āṅkaṇ
|uravukkaṭal |olittiri pōla
|iravi ṉāṉun tuyilaṟi yēṉē'' (|aiṅkuṟu. 172)
|eṉavarum.

nāṇuvariyiṟatta lāvatu--nāṇ nīṅkutal.
``kāmam viṭuvoṉṟō nāṇviṭu nalneñcē
yāṉō poṟēṉiv viraṇṭu.'' (kuṟaḷ- 1247)

nōkkuva |ellām |aviyē pōṟa lāvatu--taṉṉāṟ kāṇappaṭṭaṉa |ellāṟtāṉ kaṇṭa |uṟuppuppōlutal.
``|oṅkeḻiṟ kompar naṭuvi teṉappulluṅ
kāntaṭ kivarum karuviḷam pūkkoḷḷum
māntaḷir kiyil taṭavaru māmayil
pūmpoḻi ṉōkkip pukuvaṉa piṉcellun
tōḷeṉac ceṉṟu tuḷaṅkoḷi vēytoṭu
nīḷkatup piḵteṉa nīr |aṟal |uṭpukum'' |eṉṟātpōlvaṉa.

maṟattal--pittātal. mayakkamāvatu--mōkittal. kākkāṭu--cātal.|ivaṟṟuḷ cātal pattām |avattiyātalāl, |oḻinta |eṭṭuṅkaḷavunikaḻtaṟkuk kāraṇamām |eṉṟu koḷka. |itu talimakaṭkumtalimakaṟkum |okkum. |ivaṟṟiṟkuc ceyyuḷ vantavaḻik kāṇka. (9)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_98">{SA TP98i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li> muṉṉili yākkal colvaḻip paṭuttal
<li>naṉṉayam |urittal nakinaṉi |uṟā|a
<li>|annili yaṟital melivuviḷak kuṟuttal
<li>taṉṉili yurittal teḷivakap paṭuttaleṉṟu
<li>|iṉṉavi nikaḻum |eṉmaṉār pulavar.
</ol>


<P>|eṉ--|eṉiṉ, |iḵtu |iyaṟkip puṇarccikkuriyatōr tiṟaṉ|uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.
taṉiyiṉāl talimakaḷi yetirppaṭṭa talimakaṉ taṉatu perumiyum|aṟivum nīkki vēṭki mī tūrap puṇarcci vēṇṭiṉāṉāyiṉum, talimakaḷmāṭṭu niṟkum |accamum nāṇum maṭaṉum nīkkatalum vēṇṭumaṉṟē, |avinīṅkutaṟporuṭṭu |iviyellām nikaḻumeṉpatu. |ulakattuḷḷār|ilakkaṇamellām |urikkiṉṟā rākaliṉ, |ivvāciriyar|urikkiṉṟavāṟṟāk nikaḻtal porumpāṉmiyākavum,
``colliya nukarcci vallē peṟṟuḻi'' (tol. kaḷaviyal-11)
|eṉa |otutaliṉ, |iviyellām nikaḻtaliṉṟic ciṟupāṉmi vēṭkimikutiyāṟ puṇarcci kaṭitiṉmuṭiyavum peṟumeṉavuṅ koḷka.


<P>(|i-ḷ.) muṉṉiliyākkal |eṉpatu--kāmakkuṟippuṇmi |aṟintatalimakaṉ vēṭkiyāṟ cāraniṉittavaḻit talimakaḷum vēṭkikkuṟippuṭiyā ḷāyiṉum kulattiṉ vaḻivanta |iyaṟkiyaṉmiyāṉ nāṇamum|accamum mītūra |akkuṟip pillātārip pōl niṉṟavaḻi |avaḷimuṉṉiliyākap paṭuttuc cila kūṟutal.
``|oḷḷiḻi makaḷirō ṭōriyum |āṭāy
vaḷḷitaḻ neytaṟ ṟoṭaliyum puṉiyāy
viripūṅ kāṉal |oruciṟi niṉṟōy
yāri yōniṟ ṟoḻutaṉam viṉavutum
kaṇṭār kaṇṭā nalatti teṇṭirip
peruṅkaṭaṟ parappiṉ |amarntuṟi |aṇaṅkō
|iruṅkaḻi maruṅkiṉ nilipeṟ ṟaṉiyō
col|iṉi maṭanti |eṉṟaṉeṉ |ataṉ|etir
muḷḷeyiṟṟu muṟuvalun tiṟantaṉa
pallitaḻ |uṇkaṇum parantavāl paṉiyē.'' (naṟṟiṇi-155)

colvaḻip paṭutta lāvatu--tāṉ collukiṉṟa colliṉ vaḻi |avaḷniṟkumāṟu paṭuttuk kūṟutal.
``colliṟ colletir koḷḷāy yāḻaniṉ
tirumukam |iṟiñci nāṇuti katumeṉak
kāmaṅ kimmikiṉ tāṅkutal |eḷitō
koṭuṅkēḷ |irumpuṟam naṭuṅkak kuttip
puliviḷi yāṭiya pulavunāṟu vēḻattiṉ
talimarup pēyppak kaṭimaṇi civantaniṉ
kaṇṇē katava |alla naṇṇār
|āṇṭali matila rākavum muracukoṇṭu
|omparaṇ kaṭanta |aṭupōrc ceḻiyaṉ
perumpeyark kūṭal |aṉṉaniṉ
karumpuṭit tōḷum |uṭiyavāl |aṇaṅkē.'' (naṟṟiṇi-29)

naṉṉaya muritta lāvatu--talimakaḷiṉatu nalattiṉi yurittal.
``cēral maṭavaṉṉañ cēralnaṭi yovvāy
cēral maṭavaṉṉañ cēralnaṭi yovvāy
|ūrtiri vēli yuḻakkit tirivāḷpiṉ
cēral maṭavaṉṉañ cēralnaṭi yovvāy.'' (cilap. kāṉal-23)

nakinaṉi yuṟā|a |annili yaṟitalāvatu--talimakaṉ taṉ naṉṉayamurittalik kēṭṭa talivikku |iyalpāka |akattu |uḷavākummakiḻvāl puṟantōṉṟum muṟuvaṟkuṟippu mikkuttōṉṟā |anniliyiṉittalivaṉ |aṟital.
``māṇ|iḻi pēti nāṟiruṅ kūntal
|āṇamum |illāḷ nīr|uṟi cūruṭic
cilampiṟ kaṇaṅkāy muyaṉṟa ceṟiyiyal
notumal nōkkik kāṇmō neñcē
vaṟitāl muṟuvaṟ keḻumiya
nuṭaṅkumeṉ paṇivēy ciṟukuṭi yōḷē.''

melivu viḷakkuṟutta lāvatu--talivaṉ |akattuṟum nōyāṟpuṟattunikaḻum taḷarviṉik kuṟippāṉ |eṭuttukkūṟalum. |utāraṇam vantuḻikkāṇka.
kuṟippāvaṉa: puṟattuṟuppā yavark kiṉṟiyamiyātaṉa.

taṉṉili yuritta lāvatu--|ap puṟanikaḻcciyiṉ poliviḻavik kaṇṭatalimakaḷmāṭṭut talivaṉ taṉ |uḷḷa vēṭkimītūrviṉinilippaṭakkūṟutal.
``colliṟ colletir koḷḷāy yāḻaniṉ''
|eṉṉum naṟṟiṇippāṭṭuḷ,
``kāmaṅ kimmikil tāṅkutal |eḷitō
... ... ...
... ... kaṭimaṇi civantaniṉ
kaṇṇē katava |alla.'' (naṟṟiṇi-39)
|eṉat taṉṉili yurittavāṟu kāṇka.

teḷivu |akappaṭutta lāvatu--talivaṉ muṉṉiliyākkal mutaliyāṉakūṟip piṉṉar |iyaṟkippuṇarcciyiṉi viḻintu niṉṟāṉāka, |appuṇarcciyiṉik kūṟuvār/, muṉṉam |ottapaṇpuṭimi |uḷḷattu|iruvarmāṭṭum vēṇṭutaliṉ talimakaḷ paṇpiṉit talivaṉ |aṟintu|atteḷivit taṉṉakappaṭuttut tērtal.
``yāyum yāyum yārā kiyarō''
|eṉṉum kuṟuntokippāṭṭuḷ,
``|aṉpuṭi neñcan tāṅkalan taṉavē'' (kuṟaḷ. 40)
|eṉa |iyaṟkippuṇarcci muṉṉart talivaṉ taliviyar |uḷḷam |ottapaṇpiṉik kūṟiyavāṟu kāṇka.
|itukāṟum |iyaṟkippuṇar/ccikkuriya tiṟaṉkūṟi, mēl |iyaṟkippuṇarcci nikaḻumāṟu kūṟukiṉṟār. |aḵtēl, taṉṉili yurittalitteḷivakappaṭuttaluṭaṉ |iṇittu meyyuṟupuṇarcci yākki piṉṉarttōṉṟun tuṟiyākap paṭuttālō |eṉiṉ, |atu cāṉṟōr vaḻakkiṉṟātalāṉum,meyyuṟupuṇarcci muṉ,
``meytoṭṭup payiṟal'' (kaḷaviyal-11)
mutaliyaṉa yāṇṭum nikaḻnatē talivikku meyyuṟupuṇarccinikaḻumātalāṉum |aḵtaṉṟeṉka.

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_99">{SA TP99i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li> meytoṭṭup payiṟal poypā rāṭṭal
<li>|iṭampeṟṟut taḻā|al |iṭiyūṟu kiḷattal
<li>nīṭuniṉin tiraṅkal kūṭuta luṟutal
<li>colliya nukarcci vallē peṟṟuḻit
<li>tīrāt tēṟṟam |uḷappaṭat toki|ip
<li>pērāc ciṟappiṉ |irunāṉku kiḷaviyum
<li>peṟṟavaḻi makiḻcciyum pirintavaḻik kalaṅkalum
<li>niṟpavi niṉi|i nikaḻpavi |urippiṉum
<li>kuṟṟaṅ kāṭṭiya vāyil peṭpiṉum
<li>peṭṭa vāyilpeṟ ṟiravuvali yuṟuppiṉum
<li>|ūrum pēruṅ keṭutiyum piṟavum
<li>nīriṟ kuṟippiṉ nirampak kūṟit
<li>tōḻiyik kuṟiyuṟum pakutiyum tōḻi
<li>kuṟiyavaṭ cārtti meyyuṟak kūṟalum
<li>taṇṭā tirappiṉum maṟṟiya vaḻiyum
<li>collavaṭ cārttaliṟ pulliya vakiyiṉum
<li>|aṟintōḷ |ayarppi ṉavvaḻi maruṅkil
<li>kēṭum pīṭuṅ kūṟalum tōḻi
<li>nīkkali ṉākiya nilimiyum nōkki
<li>maṭalmā kūṟum |iṭaṉumā ruṇṭē.
</ol>


<P>|eṉ--|eṉiṉ, kaḷaviṟ kūṭṭam nāṉkiṉiṭattum talivaṉ kūṟṟunikaḻumāṟum, kātalmikku |āṟṟāmi kiyikappiṉ talivaṉām |iyalumkūṟutal nutaliṟṟu.


<P>(|i-ḷ.) meytoṭṭup payiṟa lāvatu--perumiyum |uraṉumuṭiyatalimakaṉ teḷivakappaṭuttiyatu kāraṇamākak kātal veḷḷampuraṇaṭōṭat taliviyiṉ meyyit tīṇṭiyap payiṟal
``tīṇṭalum |iyivatu kollō māṇṭa
villuṭi viḷiyar kalliṭupu |eṭutta
puṉkaṇ maṭamāṉ nērpaṭat taṉ|aiyar
cilimāṇ kaṭuvicik kaliniṟat taḻuttik
kurutiyoṭu paṟitta ceṅkōl vāḷi
māṟukoṇ ṭaṉṉa |uṇkaṇ
nāṟiruṅ kūntaṟ koṭicci tōṉē.'' (kuṟaḷ-272)

<P>poy pārāṭṭa lāvatu--taliviyiṉ |aimpāl mutaliya kaṭi kuḻaṉṟucitiviṉṟēṉum |aḵtuṟṟatāka maruṅkuceṉṟu toṭṭāṉ |orkāraṇampoyyākap paṭittu |urittup pāraṭṭal.
<BR>``kaṭalpuk kuyirkoṉṟu vāḻvarniṉ |aiyar
<BR>|uṭalpuk kuyirkoṉṟu vāḻkimaṉ nīyum
<BR>miṭalpuk kaṭaṅkāta vemmuliyō pāram
<BR>/|iṭarpuk kiṭukum |iṭiyiḻaval kaṇṭāy.'' (cilap. kāṉal-17)

<P>|iṭampeṟṟut taḻā|al |āvatu--poypārāṭṭal kāraṇamāt talivimāṭṭu|aṇimiyiṭam peṟṟut taḻuvakkūṟal. |utāraṇam:
<BR>``kolyāṉi veṇmaruppum kolval puliyataḷum
<BR>nallāṉi niṉṉiyar kūṭṭuṇaṭu--celvārtām
<BR>|or |ampi ṉāṉeytu pōkkuvaryāṉ pōkāmi
<BR>|īr |ampi ṉāṉeytāy |iṉṟu.'' (tiṇimāli-22)

<P>|iṭiyūṟu kiḷatta lāvatu-- nāṇ maṭaṉ nilikkaḷaṉāk koṇṭatalivi taṉ |aṟivu nalaṉ |iḻantu |oṉṟum |aṟiyātu |uyarttaṉaḷ.|aḵtu |okkumō |eṉiṉ, |okkum. putitāyppukkār, |ūṟṟuṇarvu|eṉṟumpayilāta tam melliyal meyyiṟ paṭa |aṟiviḻappiṉum |uḷ nekku|uyirkkum |eṉka. |atupaṟṟip puliyaṉ toṭu tīmpāl pōl kātal kūrakkompāṉum koṭiyāṉum cārnatāḷit talivaṉ puṟam|occi niṟkavum|āṇṭum kalakkalām poḻutu kūṭāmikku niṉintu |iraṅkal.

<P>kūṭutaluṟuta lāvatu--|iṅṅaṉamāyk kāṭci nikaḻviṉ piṉṉarppuṇarcci |eytalum.

<P>|ituvari |iyaṟkippuṇarcciyāṅ kāraṇaṅkūṟik kūṭutaluṟutalālmeyyuṟupuṇarcci kūṟiṉār.|ivaṟṟiṟkuc ceyyuḷ:
<BR>``vīḻum |iruvarkku |iṉitē vaḷiyiṭi
<BR>pōḻap paṭā|a muyakku.'' (kuṟaḷ-1108)

<P>|itu kūṭutaluṟutal. piṟa vantuḻik kāṇka.

<P>colliya nukarcci vallē peṟṟuḻi |eṉpatu-- |iyaṟkippuṇarccikkuk kaḷaṉāka mēṟkūṟappaṭṭavaṟṟuṭaṉ |av viṉpan tiḷittaliyum virivāka |oṉṟāyp peṟṟa viṭattu.
|itteyvap puṇrccikkup poruḷ kūṟuṅkāl, payiṟal, pārāṭṭal, taḻā|al, kiḷattal, |iraṅkal, |uṟutal, nukarcci, tēṟṟam |eṉṟucollappaṭṭa |irunāṉku kiḷaviyum |eṉa |eṇṇappaṭuttuka.
``meytoṭṭup payiṟal'' mutalākak ``kūṭuta luṟutal'' vari|iyaṟkip puṇarccikkē |uriya kūṟi,
``colliya nukarcci'' mutal ``|irunāṉku kaḷivi'' vari|iṭantalippāṭum cērttu |uṇarttiṉār. |aṟṟāyiṉ nukarcciyumtēṟṟamum |iyaṟkip puṇarcciyaṉṟō, |iṭan talippāṭāmāṟu |eṉṉiyeṉiṉ, naṉṟu kaṭāyiṉāy. meyyuṟupuṇarcciyiṉip pāl kūṭṭumneṟivaḻippaṭṭup peṟṟārkku meytoṭṭup payiṟal mutal |aṟu tuṟiyē|iṉṟiyamiyāt tuṟiyāka, |ēṉiya |iraṇṭum |iṭantalippāṭṭiṟkumcērnta tuṟiyākaliṉ, potuppaṭa |iraṇṭaṟkum naṭuvē vittuc ceppam|ākkiṉāreṉka. nukarcciyum tēṟṟamum |eṉpa pirittuk kūṭṭuka.

tīrāttēṟṟa māvatu--|iyaṟkippuṇarcciyuṭaṉ muṭiyāta teḷivu.
``vēṭṭapoḻutiṉ |aviyavi pōlumē
tōṭṭār katuppiṉāḷ tōḷ.'' (kuṟaḷ-1005)
|iḵtu |iyaṟkip puṇarccit tuṟiyaṉṟu; |iṭantalippāṭṭiṉkaṇtalimakaṉ kūṟiyatu: nukarcci peṟṟatu.
``kaṇṭukēṭ ṭuṇṭuyirt tuṟṟaṟiyum |aimpulaṉum
|oṇtoṭi kaṇṇē |uḷa'' (kuṟaḷ-1101)
|eṉpatō |eṉiṉ, |iyaṟkippuṇarccikkaṇ nukarcci yuṟṟami kūṟiṟṟu|eṉka.
``|emmaṇaṅ kiṉavē makiḻna muṉṟil
naṉimutir/ puṉkiṉ pūttāḻ veṇmaṇal
vēlaṉ puṉinta veṟi |ayar kaḷantoṟuñ
cennel vāṉpori citaṟi |aṉṉa
|ekkar naṇṇiya |emmūr viyaṉ tuṟi
nēr|iṟi muṉki paṟṟic
cūrara makaḷirō ṭuṟṟa cūḷē.'' (kuṟun-53)
/|iḵtu |iyaṟkippuṇarccip piṉṟic coṟṟa tīrāt tēṟṟa vuri.``|iṉṉici yurumoṭu'' |eṉṉum |akappāṭṭuḷ,
``niṉmār paṭitaliṉ |iṉitā kiṉṟē
nummil pulampiṉum |uḷḷutoṟum naliyum'' (|akam-15)
|eṉṟatu |iṭantalippāṭṭil nērnta tēṟṟam.
``pērāc ciṟappiṉ'' |eṭṭu |eṉṟal.
pērum ciṟappiṉi |āṟu |eṉṟali |eṭuttōttāṟ kāṭṭi niṉṟatu.
|ituvari |iyaṟkip puṇarcciyum |iṭantalippāṭum. mēl `vāyilṭeppiṉum' |eṉṉumaḷavum mā#āṅkaṟkūṭṭam; mēl toṭarpavi tōḻiyiṟkūṭṭam.

peṟṟavaḻi makiḻcciyum |eṉpatu--|iṭantalippāṭṭiṉi yoṭṭi nikaḻum|iṉpiṉip peṟṟavaḻi |akattut tōṟṟum perumakiḻvum.
``nīṅkiṉ teṟū|uṅ kuṟukuṅkāl taṇṇeṉṉun
tīyāṇṭup peṟṟāḷ |ivaḷ.'' (kuṟaḷ-1104)
``|oṭuṅkī rōti |oṇṇutaṟ kuṟumakaḷ
naṟuntaṇ nīra ḷāraṇaṅ kiṉaḷē
|iṉiyaḷ |āṉṟavaṭ puṉiyaḷavu |aṟiyēṉ
cilamel liyavē kiḷavi
|aṉimel liyalyā muyaṅkuṅ kālē.'' (kuṟun-70)
|ivi puṇarcciyāṉ makaḻntataṟkuc ceyyuṭkaḷ.

pirintavaḻik kalaṅkalāvatu--|ivvāṟu kūṭiṉa talimakaḷ pirintavaḻik kalakka muṟutalum |eṉṟavāṟu.
``|eṉṟum |iṉiya ḷā#āyiṉum pirital
|eṉṟum |iṉṉāḷ |aṉṟē neñcam
paṉimaruntu viḷikkum parū|ukkaṇ |iḷamulip
paṭucāntu citiya muyaṅkuñ
ciṟukuṭik kāṉavaṉ perumaṭa makaḷē.''
|eṉavarum.
|ittuṇiyum |iṭantalippāṭu. peṟṟavaḻi makiḻtalum pirintavaḻikkalaṅkalum pāṅkaṟ kūṭṭattiṉun tōḻiyiṟ kūṭṭattiṉum nikaḻum.

niṟpavi niṉi|i nikaḻpavi |urippiṉum |eṉpatu--kāmanukarcciyoṉṟaṉiyum niṉiyātu |ivaḷālē namakku |illaṟam |iṉitu naṭakkukameṉṟu |uṭkōṭalum. niṟpavi--|illaṟaviṉi.
``tērōṉ teṟukatir maḻuṅkiṉuṅ tiṅkaḷ
tīrā vemmiyoṭu ticinaṭukku |uṟuppiṉum
peyarāp peṟṟiyil tiriyāc cīrkāl
kulattil tiriyāk koḷkiyuṅ koḷkiyoṭu
nalattiṉ tiriyā nāṭṭamum |uṭiyōy
kaṇṭata ṉaḷaviyiṟ kalaṅkuti peyaṉiṉ|im
maṇtiṇi kiṭakki mānilam
|uṇṭeṉak karuti |uṇaralaṉ yāṉē.''
|itu niṟpavi niṉi|ik kaḻaṟiyatu.
``|iṭikkuṭ kēḷir nuṅkuṟi yāka
niṟukka lāṟṟiṉō naṉṟumaṟ ṟilla
ñāyiṟu kāyum vevvaṟi maruṅkil
kiyil |ūmaṉ kaṇṇiṟ kākkum
veṇṇey |uṇaṅkal pōlap
parantaṉ ṟinnōy noṇṭukoḷaṟ karitē.'' (kuṟun-58)
|itu nikaḻpavi |urittatu,

kuṟṟaṅkāṭṭiyāvāyilāvatu--talivaṉ māṭṭuc cōrvāṉum kātalmikutiyāṉum nērvuṟṟa paḻipāvaṅkaḷi |eṭuttukāṭṭum pāṅkaṉ.

peṭpiṉum--|attakiya pāṅkaṉ |ivviyal paṇṭipap pāl vaḻiyatu |eṉa|eṇṇi |ivvāṟu talimakaṉ maṟuttavaḻi |ataṟ kuṭaṉpaṭal. |avvaḻi,niṉṉāṟ kāṇappaṭṭāḷ |evviṭattāḷ? |ettaṉmiyāḷ? |eṉap pāṅkaṉviṉāvutalum, |ataṟkut talimakaṉ |iṭamum |uruvuṅmataṟku |avaḷnilimi kūṟalu mellām |uḷavām. |avvaḻip pāṅkaṉviṉātalumtalimakaṉ |urittaṉavum |uḷavām. pāṅkaṉ viṉāyataṟkuc ceyyuḷvantavaḻik kaṇṭukoḷka. |avvaḻit talimakaṉ |urittaṟkuc ceyyuḷ :-
``|eluva ciṟā|ar |emuṟu naṇpa
pulavar tōḻa kēḷāy |atti
mākkaṭal naṭuvaṇ |eṇṇāṭ pakkattup
pacuveṇ tiṅkaḷ tōṉṟi yāṅkuk
katuppayal viḷaṅkun ciṟunutal
putukkōḷ yāṉiyiṟ piṇittaṟṟāl |emmē.'' (kuṟun-129)
``kaḻipāṭu |iraṅkap palliyaṅ kaṟaṅka
|āṭumakaḷ naṭanta koṭumpuri nōṉkayiṟṟu
|atavat tīṅkaṉi |aṉṉa cemmukat
tuyttali manti vaṉpaṟaḻ tūṅkak
kaḻikkaṇ |irumpoṟi |ēṟi vicitteḻuntu
kuṟakkuṟu mākkaḷ tāḷaṅ koṭṭumak
kuṉṟakat tatuvē koḻumiḷic cīṟūr
ciṟū rōḷē nāṟumayirk koṭicci
koṭicci kiyakattatu vēpiṟar
viṭuttaṟ kākātu piṇitta|eṉ neñcē.'' (naṟṟiṇi-95)
|iṉṉum |iyaṟkip puṇarcci puṇarnta talimakaṉ varinteytal vēṇṭikkūṟiṉavuṅ koḷka.
``muliyē mukiḻmukiḻt taṉavē taliyē
kiḷi|iya kuralē kiḻakkukavīḻn taṉavē
ceṟiniri veṇpalum piṟamuṟi nirampiṉa
cuṇaṅkuñ cilatōṉ ṟiṉavē |aṇaṅkutaṟku
yāṉtaṉ |aṟivalē tāṉaṟi yalaḷē
yāṅkā kuvaḷkol tāṉē
perumutu celvaṉ |orumaṭa makaḷē.'' (kuṟun-337)
[|itu pāṅkaṉ niṉṉi |aṇaṅkākkiyāḷ |evviṭattavaḷ |evviyaliṉaḷ|eṉṟu viṉāy |aṟintatu.]
|ivvāṟu kēṭṭa pāṅkaṉ |avvaḻic ceṉṟu kaṇṭataṟkuc ceyyuḷ:
``|iravi ṉāṉum |iṉtuyil |aṟiyātu
|aravuṟu tuyaram |eytupa toṇṭit
taṇṇaṟu neytaliṉa nāṟum
piṉṉiruṅ kūntal |aṇaṅkuṟ ṟōrē'' (|aiṅ-175)
|eṉa varum.
|iccūttirattuḷ kūṟṟu variyaṟuttuṇarttāmi pāṅkaṟ kūṟṟum|aṭaṅkaṟkup pōlum.

peṭṭa vāyilpeṟ ṟiravu vaḻiyuṟuppiṉum |eṉpatu--mēṟcol liyavāṟṟāṉ|uṭampaṭṭa pāṅkaṉāl talimakaḷip peṟṟup piṉṉum varinteytalāṟṟātu kaḷaviṟ puṇarcci vēṇṭit tōḻiyi |irantu piṉniṉṟu kūṭṭakkūṭuvaṉ |eṉṉum |uḷḷattaṉāy |avvirattali valiyuṟuttiṉum|eṉṟavāṟu.
valiyuṟuttalāvatu, tāṉ vaḻimoḻintatu yātu tāṉ |avvāṟu ceykuval|eṉṟami.
peṭṭavāyilāl talimakaḷik kaṇṭu kūṟiyataṟkuc ceyyuḷ:
``kaṭalpuk kuyirkoṉṟu vāḻvarniṉ |aiyar
|uṭalpuk kuyirkoṉṟu vāḻvimaṉ nīyum
miṭalpuk kaṭaṅkāta vemmuliyō pāram
|iṭarpuk kiṭuku miṭiyiḻaval kaṇṭāy.'' (cilap.kāṉal-17)

|iṉṉum, peṭṭavāyil peṟṟu |eṉpataṟku |iraṭṭuṟa moḻital |eṉpataṉāltalimakaḷ tāṉ virumpappaṭṭa tōḻiyāki |emakku vāyil nērvāḷ |ivaḷ|eṉappeṟṟup piṉṉiṉarantu kuṟiyuṟa niṉippiṉum |eṉṟumām. |ataṟku ceyyuḷ:
``talippuṇik koḷiṉē talippuṇik koḷḷum
kaṭippuṇik koḷiṉē kaṭippuṇi koḷḷum
puṇiki viṭṭup puṉalō ṭoḻukiṉ
|āṇṭum varukuvaḷ pōlum māṇṭa
mārip pittikattu nīrvār koḻumukic
cevverin |uṟaḻuṅ koḻuṅkaṭi maḻikkaṇ
tuḷitalit tali|iya taḷir |aṉ ṉōḷē.'' (kuṟun-222)
|iravu valiyuṟuttaṟkuc ceyyuḷ vantavaḻik kaṇṭukoḷka.
``koṇṭal māmaḻi kuṭakkērpu kuḻitta
ciṟukōl |iṇara peruntaṇ cāntam
vakicēr |aimpāl takipeṟa vārip
pularviṭat tutirtta tukaḷpaṭu kūḻip
peruṅkaṇ |āyam tukaḷpaṭu kūḻip
pantoṭu peyarum pirivi lāṭṭi
|aruḷiṉum |aruḷā ḷāyiṉum peritaḻintu
piṉṉili muṉiyalmā neñcē |eṉṉatū |um
|aruntuyar |avaln tīrkkum
maruntupiṟi tilliyāṉ |uṟṟa nōyttē'' (naṟṟiṇi-140)
|eṉṉum pāṭṭum |ām.
|ittuṇiyum pāṅkaṟkūṭṭam.

|ūrum... ... pakutiyum |eṉpatu--|ūrāyiṉum pērāyiṉuṅ keṭutiyāyiṉum piṟavāyiṉum nīrmiyiṉāl taṉ kuṟipput tōṉṟak kūṟit talimakaṉ tōḻiyik kuṟiyuṟum pakutiyum |uṇṭu |eṉṟavāṟu. |avaṟṟuḷ |ūrviṉāyataṟkuc ceyyuḷ:-
``|aruvi |ārkkum peruvari naṇṇic
kaṉṟukāl yātta maṉṟap palaviṉ
vērkkoṇṭu tūṅkuṅ koḻuñcuḷip perumpaḻaṅ
kuḻavic cētā mānti |ayalatu
vēṇpayil |iṟumpiṉ |ām |aṟal parukum
peruṅkal vēlic ciṟukuṭi yāteṉac
colluvuñ collīr |āyiṟ kalleṉak
karuvi māmaḻi vīḻnteṉa |eḻunta
ceṅkēḻ |āṭiya ceḻuṅkuraṟ ciṟatiṉik
koypuṉaṅ kāvalum numatō
kōṭēn talkul nīḷtō ḷīrē.'' (naṟṟiṇi-213)
peyar viṉāyataṟkuc ceyyuḷ vantavaḻik kaṇṭukoḷka. keṭutiviṉāyataṟkuc ceyyuḷ :-
``nariparanta cāntam |aṟa|eṟintu nāḷāl
|uṟiyetirntu vittiya|ūḻ |ēṉal--piṟiyetirnta
tāmaripōl vāḷmukattut tāḻkuḻalīr kāṇīrō
|ēmari pōntaṉa |īṇṭu.'' (tiṇimāli-1)
``|illuṭik kiḻami yemmoṭu puṇaril
tītum |uṇṭō māta rīrē''
|eṉṟatu piṟavāṟu viṉāyatu. piṟavumaṉṉa.

tōḻi kuṟi...|iṭaṉumāruṇṭē |eṉpatu--tōḻi kuṟiyit talimakaḷic cārtti meyyuṟak kūṟutalum, |amiyā tirappiṉum maṟṟiya vaḻiyum, collavaṭ cārttaliṟ pulliya vakiyiṉum, |aṟintōḷ |ayarppiṉ |avvaḻi maruṅkiṟ kēṭum pīṭum kūṟutaliṉ nīkkaliṉākiya nilimiyum nōkki maṭalvā kūṟutalum |uṇṭu talimakaṉkaṇ |eṉṟavāṟu.
talimakaṉkaṇ |eṉpatu |āṟṟalāṟ koḷḷakkiṭantatu. |ummiyāṟpiṟakūṟutalumuṇṭēṉṟavāṟu. puṇarcci nimittamākat talimakaṉ |irattaluṅ kuṟiyuṟutalum maṭalēṟuval |eṉak kūṟutalum peṟumeṉṟavāṟu |īṇṭu, kuṟiyavaṭ cārtti meyyuṟak kūṟal |eṉpatu--tōḻikūṟṟuḷ |arumiyi ṉakaṟci yeṉṟu |otappaṭṭatu. taṇṭātiratta lāvatu--talimakaṉ palakāluñceṉṟu |irattal. maṟṟiyavaḻi |eṉpatu--piṉvaraveṉṟal mutalāyiṉa. collavaṭ cārttaliṟpulliyavaki |eṉpatu--muṉṉuṟu pupuṇarcci muṟiniṟut tuṇarttaleṉa |otappaṭṭatu. |aṟintōḷayarp peṉpatu--pētami yūṭṭal |eṉa |otappaṭṭatu. kēṭu kūṟutalāvatu--|ulakurittoḻippiṉum |eṉa |otappaṭṭatu. pīṭukūṟutalāvatu-perumiyiṟ peyarppiṉum |eṉa |otappaṭṭatu. nīkkaliṉākiya nilimi |eṉpatu--|añci |accuṟutta leṉa |otappaṭṭatu. |iviyellān tōḻi kūṟṟiṉuṭ kāṇppaṭum.
tōḻiyik kuṟiyuṟum pakutivarumāṟu :-
``tōḷuṅ kūntalum palapā rāṭṭi
vāḻtal |ollumō maṟṟē ceṅkōṟ
kuṭṭuvaṉ toṇṭi |aṉṉa
|eṟkaṇṭu mayaṅkinī nalkāk kālē'' (|ainkuṟu-178)
|iṉi maṭalēṟuval |eṉpataṟkuc ceyyuḷ:
``māveṉa maṭalum |ūrpa pūveṉak
kuvimukiḻ |erukkaṅ kaṇṇiyuñ cūṭupa
maṟukiṉ |ārkkavum paṭupa
piṟitum |ākupa kāmaṅkāḻk koḷiṉē.'' (kuṟan-17)
|avvaḻit talimakaṉ kūṟiya coṟkēṭṭu, |iḵtu |aṟivum |aruḷumnāṇamum |uṭiyār ceyyār |eṉak kūṟiyavaḻit talimakaṉ kūṟiyataṟkucceyyuḷ:
``nāṇoṭu nallāṇmi paṇṭuṭiyēṉ |iṉṟuṭiyēṉ
kāmuṟṟār |ēṟum maṭal'' (kuṟaḷ-1133)
|eṉavum,
|aṟikilā rellārum |eṉṟēyeṉ kāmam
maṟukil maṟukum maruṇṭu.'' (kuṟaḷ-1159)
|eṉavum varum. piṟavu maṉṉa. maṭalmā kūṟātu piṟa kūṟiyataṟkucceyyuḷ :-
``piṇittōṭ kuṟumakaḷ pāvi ti|iyum
pañcāyp paḷḷañ cūḻntu maṟṟivaḷ
|urutteḻu vaṉamuli |oḷipeṟa |eḻutiya
toyyil kāppōr |aṟitalum |aṟiyār
muṟiyuṭi |aracaṉ ceṅkōl viyattu
yāṉtaṟ kaṭaliṉ yāṅkā vatukol
peritum pēti maṉṟa
|aḷitō tāṉēyil |aḻuṅkal |ūrē.'' (kuṟun-279)
|ivvāṟu |irantu piṉṉiṟṟalum maṭalēṟuval |eṉṟalum kikkiḷiporuntiṇip pāṟpaṭumō |eṉiṉ, |avvāṟu varuvaṉa |akattiṇikkumpuṟattiṇikkum potuvāmāṟu varukiṉṟa cūttirattāṉ viḷaṅkum. (11)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_100">{SA TP100i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li> paṇpiṟ peyarppiṉum parivuṟṟu meliyiṉum
<li>|aṉpuṟṟu nakiṉum |avaṭpeṟṟu maliyiṉum
<li>|āṟṟiṭi yuṟutalum |avviṉik kiyalpē.
</ol>


<P>|eṉ--|eṉiṉ, |eytiyatu vilakkutal nutaliṟṟu.


<P>(|i-ḷ.) mēl talimakaṉ `maṭalmā kūṟum |iṭaṉumā ruṇṭē' |eṉṟār,|iḵtu |avaṉ maṭalvā kūṟutaṟku nimittamākiya nīkkattiṉi māṟupaṭṭuk kūṟāt talimakaḷ |iyalpik kūṟippeyarppiṉum, |aḵtaṟintu tām |uṭaṉpaṭat talimakaṉ varuttattiṉāṉ melikiṉṟami kūṟiya |iṭattiṉum, talimakaṉ kuṟiyi maṟuppuḻi |aṉpu tōṉṟa nakka |iṭattum, tōḻi |uṭaṉpāṭuṟṟavaḻiyum, talimakaṉum mēṟ collappaṭṭa maṭalmākūṟutal |iṭiyūṟupaṭutalum tōḻiyiṟ kūṭṭattiṟku |iyalpu |eṉṟavāṟu.
|ummi |iṟantatu taḻī|iya |eccavummi.
paṇpiṟ peyarppiṉum--talimakaḷ |iḷamippaṇpu kūṟippeyarttavaḻit talimakaṉ kūṟiyatu. |ataṟkuc ceyyuḷ :-
``kuṉṟak kuṟavaṉ kātal maṭamakaḷ
vaṇṭupaṭu kūntal taṇtaḻik koṭicci
vaḷiyaḷ muḷivāḷ |eyiṟṟaḷ
|iḷiya ḷāyiṉum |āraṇaṅ kiṉaḷē.'' (|aiṅkuṟu.236)

parivuṟṟu meliyiṉum--parinta vuḷḷattuṭaṉ melitaluṟutalum. parivuṟṟut tōḻi melitalāvatu `|uṭampaṭuvaḷiyāḷ' |eṉṟāṟpōla varuvatu. |avvaḻit talimakaṉ kūṟṟu :-
``toṭalik kuṟuntoṭi tantāḷ maṭaloṭu
māli |uḻakkun tuyar.'' (kuṟaḷ-1135)

|aṉpuṟṟu nakiṉum--|aṉpu tōṉṟum |uḷḷattuṭaṉ nakkakālum kūṟṟu nikaḻum. |aṉpuṟṟu nakkavaḻit talimakaṉ kūṟiyataṟkuc ceyyuḷ :-
``nayaṉiṉ miyiṟ payaṉitu |eṉṉātu
pūmpoṟip polinta |aḻalumiḻ |akaṉpip
pāmpuyir |aṇarki yāṅkum |īṅkitu
takā|atu vāḻiyō kuṟumakaḷ nakā |atu
|urimati yuṭiyumeṉ |uḷḷañ cāral
paccūṉ peyt pakaḻi pōlac
cēyari paranta |āyiḻi maḻikkaṇ
|uṟā |a nōkka muṟṟavēṉ
pital neñcam |uyyu māṟē.'' (naṟṟiṇi.75)

|avaṭpeṟṟu maliyiṉum--tōḻi |uṭampapāṭṭiṉip peṟṟu makiḻal. |iraṭṭuṟa moḻitalāṉ talimakaḷi |iruvakik kuṟiyiṉum peṟṟu makiḻiṉum |eṉṟum koḷka.
|utāraṇam :-
``|emakkunayan taruḷiṉi yāyiṟ paṇittōḷ
naṉṉutal |ariviyoṭu melmela |iyali
vantaciṉ vāḻiyō maṭanti
toṇṭi |aṉṉaniṉ paṇpupala koṇṭē.'' (|aiṅkuṟu. 175)
|itu |avaṭpeṟṟu maliyun talivaṉ kūṟṟu.
|iṉi, |uḷḷap puṇar/cciyā ṉiṉṟi yiyaṟki yiṭiyīṭupaṭṭuḻi, piṉ talimakaḷ kuṟiyiṭaṅ kūṟiyavaḻi yataṉip pāṅkaṟ kurittaṟkuc ceyyuḷ:-
``|aṇaṅkuṭip paṉittuṟit toṇṭi |aṉṉa
maṇaṅkamaḻ poḻiṟkuṟi nalkiṉaḷ nuṇaṅkiḻip
poṅkari paranta |uṇkaṇ
|aṅkaliḻ mēṉi |aciyiyal |emakkē.'' (|aiṅkuṟu. 174)
|eṉavuñ ciṟupāṉmi varum.
``kāṇiṟ kuvaḷi kaviḻntu nilaṉōkkum
māṇiḻi kaṇ |ovvēm |eṉṟu'' (kuṟaḷ-1114)
|itu taliviyip pakaṟkuṟikkaṇpeṟṟu malital.
``matiyum maṭanti mukaṉum |aṟiyā
patiyiṟ kalaṅkiya mīṉ.'' (kuṟaḷ-1116)
|iḵtu |iravukkuṟikkaṇ talivaṉ |avaṭpeṟṟu malintatu.
``mātar mukampōl |oḷiviṭa valliyēl
kātali vāḻi mati.'' (kuṟaḷ-1118)
|eṉapatum |atu.
|āṟṟiṭi |uṟutalum--tāṉcēṟum |āṟṟiṭi |iṭiyūṟu |uṇṭāy viṭattumkūṟṟu nikaḻum. |iraṭṭuṟa moḻivāṉ variviṭi vittup pirintāṉ tāṉcēṟum |āṟṟiṉkaṇ varuttamuṟṟuk kūṟalum koḷḷappaṭum.
``kuruti vēṭki |urukeḻu vayamāṉ
valimiku muṉpiṉ maḻakaḷiṟu pārkkum
marampayil cōli maliyap pūḻiyar
|uruvat turuviṉ nāḷmēyal |ārum
māri |eṇkiṉ maliccura nīḷiṭi
nī nayantu varutal |evaṉeṉap palapularntu
|aḻutaṉi |uṟiyum |ammā |arivi
payaṅkeḻu palaviṉ kollik kuṭavarip
pūtam puṇartta putitiyal pāvi
virikatir |iḷaveyil tōṉṟi |aṉṉaniṉ
|a|āynalam |uḷḷi variṉemakku
|ēmam |ākum malimutal |āṟē.'' (naṟṟiṇi. 192)
|in naṟṟiṇippāṭṭu talivi |āṟṟiṉatu |arumi ceppat talivaṉceppiyatu.
``|ōmpuvāti vāḻiyō maṭi pāmpiṉ
tūṅkutōl kaṭukkun tūveḷ ḷaruvik
kalluyar |ārum muṉṟiṟ
pulvēy kurampi nallōḷ |ūrē.'' (kuṟun: 235)
/|ic kuṟuntokip pāṭṭu talivaṉ variviṭattuc cēṟuvāṉ kūṟiyatu.

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_101">{SA TP101i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li> pāṅkar nimittam paṉṉiraṇ ṭeṉpa.
</ol>


<P>|eṉ--|eṉiṉ, palavaki maṇattiṟ pāṅkarāyiṉār tuṇiyākumiṭam|ittuṇi yeṉa variyaṟuttuṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>pāṅkarāyiṉār tuṇiyākak kūṭum kūṭṭam paṉṉiraṇṭu vakiyeṉṟavāṟu.

<P>nimittam |eṉpatu nimittamākak kūṭum kūṭṭam. |akkūṭṭamnimittameṉa |ākupeyarāy niṉṟatu. pāṅkarāṟ kūṭṭam pāṅkarnimittameṉa vēṟṟumit tokiyāyiṟṟu. |aviyāvaṉa:- piramammutaliya nāṉkum, kantiruvap pakutiyākiya kaḷavum, |uṭaṉpōkkum|ataṉkaṇ kaṟpiṉ pakutiyākiya |iṟkiḻattiyum, kāmakkiḻattiyum,kātaṟparattiyum, |acuram mutalākiya mūṉṟumeṉa |ivi. (13)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_102">{SA TP102i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li> muṉṉiya mūṉṟum kikkiḷik kuṟippē.
</ol>


<P>|eṉ--|eṉiṉ, mēṟcollappaṭṭa paṉṉiruvakiyiṉum kikkiḷippāṟpaṭuvaṉa vakuttuṇar/ttutal nutaliṟṟu.
|eṇvakimaṇattiṉuḷḷum muṉṉiyavākiya |acuram mutal mūṉṟumkikkiḷippāṟpaṭum |eṉṟavāṟu.

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_103">{SA TP103i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li> piṉṉar nāṉkum peruntiṇi peṟumē.
</ol>


<P>|eṉ--|eṉiṉ, mēṟcollappaṭṭavaṟṟuḷ peruntiṇikkuriyaṉa|uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.
|eṇvaki maṇattiṉuḷḷum piramam mutaliya nāṉkum peruntiṇippāṟpaṭum |eṉṟavāṟu. (15)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_104">{SA TP104i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li>mutaloṭu puṇarnta yāḻōr mēṉa
<li>tavalaruñ ciṟappiṉ |ainnilam peṟumē.
</ol>


<P>|eṉ--|eṉiṉ, mēṟcollappaṭṭa |oru talikkāmamum poruntākkāmamumaṉṟi, |otta |aṉpiṉ varuṅ kūṭṭam |uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.


<P>(|i-ḷ.) mutal |eṉpatu nilamum kālamum. nilattoṭum kālattoṭumporuntiya kantiruvar pāṟpaṭṭaṉa keṭutalillāta ciṟappiḷi yuṭiya|aintuvakippaṭum |eṉṟavāṟu.
mutaloṭu puṇarnta |eṉṟārēṉum `vantatu kaṇṭu vārātatu muṭittal'(marapiyal-112) |eṉpataṉāl |oḻinta karupporuḷum |uripporuḷumkoḷḷappaṭum. nilam |eṉpatu |iṭam. |itaṉāṟ colliyatu,|ottakāmamākik karupporuḷoṭum puṇarnta kantiruvaneṟi |iṭavakiyāṉ |aintuvakippaṭum |eṉṟavāṟu. |aviyāvaṉa: kaḷavum,|uṭaṉpōkkum, |iṟkiḻatti, kāmakkiḻatti, kātaṟparattiyum |eṉaccollappaṭṭa |aivakik kūṭṭam.
|iccollappaṭṭa paṉṉiruvakippaṭṭa kūṭṭattiṟkum pāṅkarāyiṉārnimittamāka vēṇṭutaliṉ, |avaṟṟuḷ talivaṟkum talivikkum |ottakāta luḷvaḻip pāṅkarāyiṉārāl nikaḻum nikaḻccikantiruvappakutiyākavum, |orutali vēṭkiyākiya vaḻi |ivarālvarum nikaḻcci kikkiḷiyākavum |oppilkūṭṭa mākiyavaḻipperuntiṇiyākavum koḷka. |ainnilam |eṉpataṉi mulli kuṟiñcimutalāyiṉaveṉṟār |uḷarāleṉiṉ, `mutaloṭu puṇar/nta' |eṉapataṉālnilampeṟu mātalāṉ nilam |eṉpataṟku - vēṟuporuḷ |urittalvēṇṭumeṉka. |aḵtu |aṟṟāka, |iṟkiḻatti |eṉpār |uḷḷap puṇarcciyāṉātalpēyum |appāṟpaṭum. |ivi muṉṉiya mūṉṟum kikkiḷiyāyavāṟu.``kāmañ cālā |iḷami yōḷvayiṟ'' (to.poru. 50) kikkiḷiciṟappuṭit teṉṟaṟkup pullit tōṉṟum |eṉakkūṟi, |itaṉi vāḷātu`kuṟippu' |eṉṟār. |āṇṭup piṟkālattaṉṟik kāṭcikkaṇ maṇam|ataṟkiṉmiyiṉ |īṇṭu maṇam kūṟum vaḻik kūṟātu |akattiḷiyiyaluṭkūṟiṉār. (tol.kaḷa. 14. nacci.)
teyyuṟupuṇarcciyāṉātal variyappaṭṭārākap poruṭpeṇṭirākiyakātaṟparattiyar kūṭṭam |otta kāmamākiyavā ṟeṉṉi yeṉiṉ, |arumporuḷāṉātal, |accattāṉātal |aṉṟi |aṉpiṉāṟ kūṭutaliṉ |atuvuṅkantiruvappapāṟpaṭum. |avvāṟaṉṟi |avarip piṟitu neṟiyāṟkūṭuvarāyiṉ |ivaṉmāṭṭut talimi |iṉṟāmeṉpatu |uṇarntu koḷka.|aḵtāmāṟu.
``|aṉṉi kaṭuñcol |aṟiyātāy pōlanī
|eṉṉip pulappatu |oṟukkuvēṉ maṉyāṉ
ciṟukāli |iṟkaṭi vantu kuṟiceyta
|avvaḻi |eṉṟumyāṉ kāṇēṉ tiritā
|evvaḻip paṭṭāy kamaṉāka |ivveḷḷal'' (kalit-90)
|eṉavum, ``kaṇṭēṉiṉ māyaṅ kaḷavātal'' |eṉṉuṅ kaliyuḷ,
``..nōyum vaṭuvuṅ karantu makiḻcerukkip
pāṭupeyal niṉṟa pāṉāḷ |iravil
toṭipoli tōḷum muliyuṅ katuppum vaṭivār kuḻiyum |iḻiyumpoṟiyā
|oṭivatu pōlum nucuppō ṭaṭitaḷarā
vārāk kavaviṉ |oruttivan talkaltaṉ
cīrār ñekiḻañ cilampac civantuniṉ
pōrār katavam mititta tamiyumō'' (kalit-97)
|eṉavum, parattiyar |aṉpiṉāṟ kūṟiyavāṟum |ivar |iṟkiḻattiyumkāmakkiḻattiyum |aṉmiyum |aṟaṟintu koḷka. |ivvaki varuvaṉa|aintu nilaṉāy varum. |aḵtēl, marutakkaliyuḷ,
``.........................
|aṭakkamil pōḻtiṉkaṇ tanti kāmuṟṟa
toṭakkattut tāyuḻip pukkāṉ'' (kalit-82)
|eṉavum,
`vaḻimuṟittāy' |eṉavum, `putiyōḷ' |eṉavum, |ivvāṟu kūṟakkēṭkiṉṟakāmakkiḻattiyu meṉa maṉiviyar nālvaruḷar. |avarellāriyum kūṟātumaṉikkiḻattiyar |iruvar |eṉṟataṉāṟ payaṉ |iṉṟeṉiṉ, |avrellārum|iṟkiḻattiyum kāmakkiḻattiyu meṉa |iraṇṭu pakuppiṉuḷ |aṭaṅkupa.|aṉṟiyum, |ivar nālvarōṭu parattiyuṭpaṭa |aivarkantiruvappakutiyar |eṉa |urippiṉum |amiyum.
`paratti vāyil nālvarkkum |urittē' (poruḷiyal. 28)
|eṉa |otutalāṉum, talivaṟkup piramam mutalāka varum nāṉkuvaruṇattup peṇpālārum parattiyum |eṉa |aivakippaṭumeṉpatū |um|oṉ ṟeṉak koḷka. (16)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_105">{SA TP105i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li>|iruvakik kuṟipiḻip pākiya |iṭattum
<li>kāṇā vakiyiṟ poḻutunaṉi |ikappiṉum
<li>tāṉakam pukā|aṉ peyartal |iṉmiyiṟ
<li>kāṭci yāciyiṟ kaḷampukkuk kalaṅki
<li>vēṭkiyiṉ mayaṅkik kiyaṟu poḻutiṉum
<li>pukā|ak kālip pukketirp paṭṭuḻip
<li>pakā|a viruntiṉ pakutik kaṇṇum
<li>vēḷāṇ |etirum viruppiṉ kaṇṇun
<li>tāḷāṇ |etirum pirivi ṉāṉum
<li>nāṇuneñ calippa viṭuttaṟ kaṇṇum
<li>varital vēṇṭit tōḻi ceppiya
<li>puritīr kiḷavi pulliya |etirum
<li>varivuṭam paṭutalum |āṅkataṉ puṟattum
<li>puripaṭa vanta maṟuttalōṭu toki|ik
<li>kiḻavōṉ mēṉa |eṉmaṉār pulavar.
</ol>

<P>|itu. tōḻiyiṟ kūṭiya talimakaṉ varinteytuṅkāṟum kūṟumporuṇmi yuṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>(|i-ḷ.) |iruvakik kuṟipiḻippākiya |iṭattum |eṉpatu--pakaṟkuṟiyum |iraviṟkuṟiyum piḻippākiya |iṭattum |eṉṟavāṟu.pakaṟkuṟi |iraviṟkuṟi yeṉpatu |eṟṟāṟpeṟutu meṉiṉ,
``kuṟiyeṉap paṭuva tiraviṉum pakaliṉum
|aṟiyak kiḷanta |āṟṟa teṉpa'' (kaḷaviyal. 40)
|eṉpataṉāṟ koḷka. |akkuṟikkaṇ talivi varavu piḻittaviṭattuttalivaṉ kūṟṟu nikaḻum |eṉṟavavāṟu.
``maḻivara vaṟiyā maññi yālum
|aṭukkal nallūr |acinaṭik koṭicci
tāṉem maruḷāḷ |āyiṉum
yāntaṉ |uḷḷupu maṟantaṟi yēmē.''
|itu, kuṟipiḻittavaḻi tōḻikkuc colliyatu.
``|illōṉ |iṉpaṅ kāmuṟ ṟā|aṅku
|arituvēṭ ṭaṉiyāl neñcē kātali
nallā ṉākutal |aṟiyā tōyē.'' (kuṟun.120)
|itu, kuṟipiḻittavaḻit tōḻikkuc colliyatu.

kāṇā vakiyiṟ poḻutunaṉi |ikappiṉum |eṉpatu--talimakaḷikkāṇāvakiyiṟ poḻutu mikavum kaṭppiṉuṅ kūṟṟu nikaḻum |eṉṟavāṟu.ceyyuḷ:
``|uḷḷik kāṇpeṉ pōlval muḷḷeyiṟṟu
|amiḻtal |ūṟuñ cevvāyk kamaḻakil
|āram nāṟum |aṟalpōṟ kūntaṟ
pēramar maḻikkaṇ koṭicci
mūral muṟuvaloṭu mati|iya nōkkē'' (kuṟun.186)
|eṉa varum.
tāṉakampukā|aṉ peyartal |iṉmiyiṟ...poḻutiṉum |eṉpatu--kāṇāvakiyiṟ poḻutu mikakkaḻin tuḻik kāṭci yākiyiṉāṟkuṟiyiṭattuc ceṉṟu |āṇṭuk kāṇātu kalaṅki vēṭkiyāṉ mayakkamuṟṟucceyalaṟṟu niṟkuṅ kālattiṉuṅ kūṟṟu nikaḻum |eṉṟavāṟu.
pukāṉ |eṉpatu muṟṟu vāypāṭṭāṉ vanta viṉiyeccam. ceyyuḷvantavaḻik kāṇka.

pukā|ak kāli pukketirp paṭṭuḻip...kaṇṇum |eṉpatu--tāṉ pukutaṟkuttakutiyillāta kālattukkaṇ |akampuk ketirppaṭṭuḻi |avarālnīkkappaṭāta viruntiṉ pakutiya ṉākiyavaḻiyum kūṟṟu nikaḻum|eṉṟavāṟu. ceyyuḷ:
``|iraṇṭaṟi kaḷaviṉnam kāta lōḷē
muraṇkoḷ tuppiṟ cevvēl maliyaṉ
muḷḷūrk kāṉam naṇṇuṟa vantu
naḷḷeṉ kaṅkul nammō raṉṉaḷ
kūntal vēynta viravumalar |eṇṇey nīvi
|amarā mukatta ḷākit
tamarōr |aṉṉaḷ vikaṟi yāṉē.'' (kuṟun.312)
|eṉa varum.

vēḷā ṇetirum viruppiṉ kaṇṇum--|eṉpatu talivi |upakāram|etirppaṭṭa viruppiṉ kaṇṇum kūṟṟu nikaḻum |eṉṟavāṟu.
|atu kuṟivaḻikkaṇṭu kūṟutal. |avvaḻit talivikkuk kūṟiya ceyyuḷ:
``cilampukamaḻ kāntaḷ naṟuṅkuli yaṉṉa
nalpeṟu kiyiṉeṉ kaṇputit tōyē
pāyal |iṉtuṇi yākiya paṇittōḷ
tōki māṭciya maṭanti
nīyala tuḷarō|eṉ neñcamarn tōrē.'' (|aiṅkuṟu.193)
/|itu talivi kaṇputittavaḻit talivaṉ kūṟiyatu.
``kuruti vēṭki |urukeḻu vayamāṉ
valimiku muṉpiṉ maḻakaḷiṟu pārkkum
marampayil cōli maliyap pūḻiyar
|uruvat turuviṉ nāḷmēyal |ārum.
māri |eṇkiṉ maliccura nīḷiṭi
nīnayantu varutal |evaṉeṉap palapulantu
|aḻutaṉi |uriyum |ammā |arivi
payaṅkoḻu palaviṉ kollik kuṭavarip
pūtam puṇarnta putitiyal pāvi
vitikatir |iḷaveyil tōṉṟi yaṉṉaniṉ
|emma |ākum malimuta lāṟē.'' (naṟṟiṇi.192)
|eṉavum varum.

tāḷāṇ |etirum pirivi ṉāṉum |eṉpatu--tāḷāṇmi |etirum pariviṉkaṇṇum |eṉṟavāṟu. |eṉavē neṭṭāṟu cēṟalaṉṟi |aṇi mikkaṇ piriveṉṟukoḷka.
``|iṉṟē ceṉṟu varuvatu nāḷik
kuṉṟiḻi |aruviyiṉ veṇṭēr muṭuka
|iḷampiṟi yaṉṉa viḷaṅkucuṭar nēmi
vicumpuvīcu koḷḷiyiṟ pimpayir tumiyak
kāliyaṟ celaviṉ māli yeytic
ciṉṉiri vālvaḷik kuṟumakaḷ
paṉmāṇ |ām |aṭintuvak kuvamē.'' (kuṟun.189)
pirintavaḻik kūṟiyataṟkuc ceyyuḷ:-
``|ompumati vāḻiyō vāṭi pāmpiṉ
tūṅkutōl kaṭukkun tūveḷ |aruvik
kalluyar naṇṇi yatuvē nelli
mariyiṉam |ārum muṉṟil
pulvēy kurampi nallōḷ |ūrē.'' (kuṟun.235)
|eṉavum varum.

nāṇuneñ calippa viṭuttaṟ kaṇṇum |eṉpatu. nāṇan talivi neñciṉivaruttutalāṉē nīkki niṟuttutaṟkaṇṇum |eṉṟavāṟu.
|aḵtu, |alarākum |eṉṟañci nīkkutal. |avvaḻit talivaṉ kūṟṟunikaḻum |eṉṟavāṟu. |avvaḻi |ivvāṟu kūṟukiṉṟatu. puṉinturiyeṉṟukarutik kūṟutalum meyyeṉṟu karutik kūṟutalum |uḷavām.
``kaḷittoṟuṅ kaḷḷuṇṭal vēṭṭaṟṟāṟ kāmam
veḷippaṭun tōṟum |iṉitu'' (kuṟaḷ.1045)
|itu puṉinturiyeṉṟu karutik kūṟiyatu.
``|uṟā |atu |ūraṟi kuvi |ataṉip
peṟā |atu peṟṟaṉṉa nīrttu.'' (kuṟaḷ.1145)
`|ūraṟinta kuvi naṉṟē kāṇ; |ataṉik kuṟṟamākak koḷḷātu peṟātupeṟṟa nīrmittākak koḷ' |eṉṟamiyāṉun tamarvarivuṭaṉ paṭuvar|eṉak kūṟiyavāṟām. |itu meyyākak koṇṭu kūṟiyatu.

varital vēṇṭi...pulliya |etirum |eṉpatu--varintu kōṭal vēṇṭittōḻiyāṟ collappaṭṭa kuṟṟantīrnta kiḷavi poruntiya |etirppāṭṭukkaṇṇuṅkūṟṟu nikaḻum |eṉṟavāṟu.
``nalluri |ikantu pullurit tā |ay
peyalnīk kēṟṟa pacuṅkalam pōla
|uḷḷam tāṅkā veḷḷam nīnti
|aritavā vuṟṟaṉi neñcē naṉṟum
peritāl |ammaniṉ pūcal |uyarkōṭṭu
makavuṭi manti pōla
|akaṉuṟat taḻī|ic kēṭkunarp peṟiṉē.'' (kuṟun.29)
|eṉavarum

varivuṭampaṭutalum--tōḻikūṟiya coṟkēṭṭu varivuṭampaṭutaṟ kaṇṇumkūṟṟuṟa nikaḻum |eṉṟavāṟu.
``|ārkaḷiṟu mititta nīrtikaḻ cilampiṟ
cūrnacin taṉiyiyāy naṭuṅkal kaṇṭē
naranta nāṟuṅ kuviyiruṅ kūntal
nirantilaṅku veṇpal maṭanti
parittaṉeṉ |allaṉō |iṟiyiṟi yāṉē.'' (kuṟun.52)
|eṉa varum.
|āṅkataṉ puṟattum |eṉpatu--|av varivunikaḻccik kaṇṇum kūṟṟunikaḻum |eṉṟavāṟu. ceyyuḷ vantavaḻik kāṇka.
puripaṭavanta maṟuttaloṭu toki|i |eṉpatu--kuṟṟampaṭa vantamaṟuttaloṭukūṭa |eṉṟavāṟu.
|aḵtu |avarmaṟuttaṟ kaṇṇun talimakaṉmāṭṭuk kūṟṟu nikaḻum|eṉṟavāṟu. |ataṟkuc ceyyuḷ:
``poṉ |aṭarn taṉṉa |oḷḷiṇarc ceruntip
paṉmalar vēynta nalampeṟu kōtiyuḷ
tiṇimaṇal |aṭikari |alavaṉ |āṭṭi
|aciyiṉa ḷirunta |āypoṭik kuṟumakaḷ
nalañcāl viḻupporuḷ kalaniṟi koṭuppiṉum
peṟalaruṅ kuriya ḷāyiṉ |aṟanterintu
nāmuṟi tē|e marū|uppeyarn tavaṉoṭu
|irunīrc kuṭṭam puṇiyoṭu pukkum
paṭuttaṉam paṇintaṉam |aṭuttaṉam |iruppil
tarukuvaṉ kollō tāṉē viritirik
kaṇtiraḷ muttaṅ koṇṭu ñāṅkart
tēṉ|imir |akaṉkarip pakukkuṅ
kāṉalam peruntuṟip paratavaṉ namakkē.'' (|akam.280)
|eṉa varum.

kaḻivōṉ mēṉa |eṉmaṉār pulavar |eṉpatu--|ic collappaṭṭaṉa vellāṅkiḻavōṉ |iṭattaṉa |eṉṟavāṟu.
kūṟṟeṉṉātu potuppaṭak kūṟutalāṉ |uḷḷa nikaḻcciyum kūṟṟumkoḷḷappaṭum.

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_106">{SA TP106i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li> kāmat tiṇiyiṟ kaṇniṉṟu varū|um
<li>nāṇum maṭaṉum peṇmiya |ākaliṉ
<li>kuṟippiṉum |iṭattiṉum |allatu vēṭki
<li>neṟippaṭa vārā |avaḷvayiṉ |āṉa.
</ol>

<P>|eṉpatu mēl talivaṟ kuriya kiḷavikūṟi, |iṉit talivikkuriyakiḷavi kūṟukiṉṟārākaliṉ, kāmavoḻukkattiṉkaṇ kuṟippiṉāṉum|iṭattiṉāṉumallatu vēṭki pulappaṭa nikaḻātu taliviyiṭattu|eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>kāmattiṇi |eṉpataṉik kuṟippeṉpataṟku muṉṉē kūṭṭi yurikka|accamum |iyalpaṉṟōveḷiṉ, |atuvum vēṭkikkuṟipṉāṉ nīṅkumeṉpa,|accamuḷvaḻi vēṭki nikaḻāmiyiṉ. vēṭki yuḷvaḻi nāṇum maṭaṉumnīṅkāvō |eṉiṉ, |atu varukiṉṟa cūttirattāṟ kūṟupa. |itaṉāṟcolliyatu talivi talivaṉi |etirppaṭṭu muṉṉiliyākkal mutalākattalivaṉmāṭṭu nikaḻntamipōlat talivimāṭṭu nikaḻpavi |uḷavōveṉiṉ, |avaḷmāṭṭuk kuṟippiṉāṉātal, collutaṟkut takkaviṭattiṉāṉātal tōṟṟuvatallatu, pulappaṭṭu nikaḻā teṉṟavā ṟāyiṟṟu.
``|uṇṭārkaṇ |alla taṭunaṟāk kāmampōṟ
kaṇṭār makiḻceytal |iṉṟu,'' (kuṟaḷ.1090)
|eṉṟatu talivaṉik kaṇṭa talivi vēṭkik kuṟippiṉāl taṉṉuḷḷēkarutiyatu.
|iṭampaṟṟi vēṭki tōṟṟiyataṟkuc ceyyuḷ :-
``.........................
neṭuṅkoṭi nuṭakkum nāvāy tōṉṟuva
kāṇā mōveṉak kāviṟ citiyā
nillātu peyarnta pallō ruḷḷum
|eṉṉē kuṟitta nōkkamoṭu naṉṉutāl
|oḻikō yāṉeṉa |aḻitakak kūṟi
yāṉpeyarka |eṉṉa nōkkit tāṉtaṉ
neṭuntērk koṭiñci paṟṟi
niṉṟōṉ pōlum |iṉṟum|eṉ kaṭkē.'' (|akam.110)
|eṉat taṉ kuṟippuk kālattāṟ kūṟuta lāṟṟātu piṉ |iṭam peṟṟuḻikkūṟiyavāṟu kāṇka.

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_107">{SA TP107i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li> kāmañ collā nāṭṭam |iṉmiyiṉ
<li>|ēmuṟa |iraṇṭum |uḷaveṉa moḻipa
</ol>

<P>|eṉpatu, mēlataṟkōr puṟaṉaṭiyuṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.
vēṭkiyuriyāta kaṇ |ulakattiṉmiyāl talivaṉ |ēmuṟaṟ poruṭṭunāṇum maṭaṉum |uḷavām |eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>|itaṉāṟ colliyatu mēl talivikku |iyalpāyk kūṟappaṭṭa |accamumnāṇum maṭaṉum |eṉpaṉavaṟṟuḷ vēṭkiyāl |accam nīṅkiṉavaḻi nāṇummaṭaṉum nīṅkāvō |eṉṟiyuṟṟārkku |avi talimakaṟku |ēma mātaṟporuṭṭu nīṅkāvām |eṉpatū |um, vēṭkikkuṟippuk kaṇṇiṉāṉ |aṟiyalāmeṉpatū|um |uṇarttiyavāṟu. |eṉṉi? nāṇum maṭaṉum |illātārittalimakkaḷ |avamatippārātalāl. |utāraṇam:-
``kaṭalaṉṉa kāmam |uḻantum maṭalēṟāp
peṇṇiṟ peruntakka til.'' (kuṟaḷ.1173)
|itaṉuḷ `kaṭalaṉṉakākakamam |uḻantum' |eṉṟataṉāṉ vēṭki mikkaniliyiṉiyum, maṭalēṟāp peṇ' |eṉṟamiyāṉ nāṇum maṭaṉum nīṅkāniliyiṉiyum kūṟutal kāṇka.
``kaṇṇoṭu kaṇ|iṇi nōkkokkiṉ vāyccoṟkaḷ
|eṉṉa payaṉum |ila.'' (kuṟaḷ.1100)
|itaṉuḷ |akattunikaḻ vēṭkiyiṉik kaṇṇiṉāl |aṟiyakkiṭantamikūṟiyavāṟu kāṇka. (19)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_108">{SA TP108i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li> colletir moḻital |arumit tākaliṉ
<li>|alla kūṟṟumoḻi |avaḷvaḷayi ṉāṉa
</ol>

<P>|eṉpatu, |ituvum talivimāṭṭu |oru kūṟṟuccol nikaḻumāṟu|uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>talivaṉ |iyaṟkippuṇarcci karutikkūṟuñ colletir tāṉ vēṭkikkuṟippiṉaḷāyiṉum |ataṟkuṭampaṭṭa neṟiyik kūṟutal |arumiyuṭittātalāṉ |ataṟku |uṭampāṭallāta kūṟṟumoḻi taliviyiṭattaṉa|eṉṟavāṟu. |eṉṟatu |icivillātārippōlak kūṟutal.

<P>|utāraṇam:-
``yārivaṉ |eṉṉi vilakkuvāṉ nīruḷar
pūntā marippōtu tanta viravuttārk
kallāp potuvaṉi nīmāṟu niṉṉoṭu
collalōm peṉṟār |emar.'' (kalit.112)
|eṉavarum. |itaṉpiṉ,
``......................
|evaṉ kolō
māyap potuvaṉ |uritta |uriyellām
vāyāva tāyiṉ talippaṭṭām poyyāyiṉ
cāyaliṉ mārpiṟ kamaḻtār kuḻittaniṉ
|āyita muṇkaṇ pacappat taṭameṉtoḷ
cāyiṉum |e|ēr |uṭittu.'' (kalit.112)
|eṉa |uṭampāṭu kūṟiṉāḷātaliṉ muṟkūṟiyatu |allakuṟṟāyiṟṟu. (20)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_109">{SA TP109i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li> maṟintavaṟ kāṇṭal taṟkāṭ ṭuṟutal
<li>niṟinta kātalil colletir maḻuṅkal
<li>vaḻipāṭu maṟuttal maṟuttetir kōṭal
<li>paḻitīr muṟuval ciṟutē tōṟṟam
<li>kippaṭṭuk kalaṅkiṉum nāṇumika variṉum
<li>|iṭṭuppiri viraṅkiṉum |arumicey tayarppiṉum
<li>vantavaḻi |eḷḷiṉum viṭṭuyirt taḻuṅkiṉum
<li>nontuteḷi voḻippiṉum |accam nīṭiṉum
<li>pirintavaḻik kalaṅkiṉum peṟṟavaḻi maliyiṉum
<li>varuntoḻiṟ karumi vāyil kūṟiṉum
<li>kūṟiya vāyil koḷḷāk kāliyum
<li>maṉippaṭṭuk kalaṅkic citintavaḻit tōḻikku
<li>niṉittal cāṉṟa |arumaṟi |uyirttalum
<li>|uyirāk kālattu |uyirttalum |uyircela
<li>vēṟṟuvarivu variṉ|atu māṟṟutaṟ kaṇṇum
<li>neṟippaṭu nāṭṭattu nikaḻntavi maṟippiṉum
<li>poṟiyiṉ yātta puṇarcci nōkki
<li>|orumik kēṇmiyiṉ |uṟukuṟi teḷintōḷ
<li>|arumi cāṉṟa nāliraṇṭu vakiyiṟ
<li>perumi cāṉṟa |iyalpiṉ kaṇṇum
<li>poytali |aṭutta maṭaliṉ kaṇṇuṅ
<li>kiyaṟu tōḻi kaṇṇīr tuṭippiṉum
<li>veṟiyāṭ ṭiṭattu veruviṉ kaṇṇum
<li>kuṟiyiṉ |oppumi maruṭaṟ kaṇṇum
<li>varivutali variṉum kaḷavaṟi vuṟiṉum
<li>tamartaṟ kātta kāraṇa maruṅkiṉum
<li>taṉkuṟi taḷḷiya teruḷāk kāli
<li>vantavaṉ peyarnta vaṟuṅkaḷam nōkkit
<li>taṉpiḻip pākat taḻī |it tēṟalum
<li>vaḻuviṉṟu nili|iya |iyaṟpaṭu poruḷiṉum
<li>poḻutum |āṟum puriva taṉmiyiṉ
<li>|aḻivutali vanta cintik kaṇṇum
<li>kāmañ ciṟappiṉum |avaṉaḷi ciṟappiṉum
<li>|ēmañ cāṉṟa vuvakik kaṇṇum
<li>taṉvayiṉ |urimiyum |avaṉvayiṟ parattiyum
<li>|aṉṉavu muḷavē |ōriṭat tāṉa.
</ol>

<P>|eṉṟatu, talivikku |iyaṟkippuṇarcci mutalākak kaḷaviṉkaṭ`kuṟippiṉu miṭattiṉumallatu' (kaḷaviyal-18) nikaḻcciyellāvaṟṟiṉum kūṟṟu nikaḻumiṭam |uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.


<P>(|i-ḷ.) maṟintavaṟ kāṇṭal |eṉpatu--taṉṉit talivaṉ kāṇāmaltāṉ |avaṉik kāṇuṅ kāṭci.

taṟkāṭṭuṟutal |eṉpatu--taṉṉi |avaṉ kāṇumāṟu niṟṟal

niṟinta...maḻuṅkal |eṉpatu--nirampiya vēṭkiyāl talivaṉ kūṟiyacoṟ kēṭṭu |etirmoḻi kūṟātu maṭintu niṟṟal.
|im mūṉṟiṭattiṉuṅ kūṟṟu nikaḻātu.
vaḻipāṭu maṟuttal |eṉpatu--|ataṉpiṉ |ivaḷ vēṭkik kuṟippuk kaṇṭucāraluṟṟavaḻi |ataṟkuka |uṭampaṭātu maṟuttal
|atu kuṟippiṉāṉum kūṟṟaṉāṉum varum.

maṟuttetirkōṭal |eṉpatu--maṟuttāṅku maṟātu piṉṉum |ēṟṟukkōṭal.

paḻitīr...tōṟṟal--kuṟṟantīrnta muṟuvalciṟitu tōṟṟuvittal.
|atu puṇartaṟku |uṭaṉpāṭu kāṭṭi niṟkum. |ivi |āṟuniliyumpuṇarccikku muṉ nikaḻum. |īṇṭuṅ kuṟippunikaḻcciyallatu kūṟṟunikaḻcci |arukiyallatu vārātu. |avaṟṟuḷ cilavarumāṟu:
``|ikalvēntaṉ cēṉi'' |eṉṉum mullikkaliyuḷ,
``māmaruṇ ṭaṉṉa maḻikkaṇciṟ ṟāyttiyar
nīmaruṭṭuñ coṟkaṇ maruḷvārk kuriyavi
yāmuṉiyā |ēṟupōl vikaṟ patiṉmarik
kāmuṟṟuc celvāyōr kaṭkuttik kaḷvaṉi
nī|evaṉ ceyti piṟarkku;
yām|evaṉ ceytum niṉakku;
|itu vaḻipāṭu maṟuttatu. |iṉṉum |itaṉuḷ,
``tēṅkoḷ poruppaṉ ciṟukuṭi |em|āyar
vēntūṭṭu |aravattu niṉpeṇṭir kāṇāmal
kāñcittā tukkaṉṉa tāteru maṉṟattut
tūṅkuṅ kuraviyuḷ niṉpeṇṭir kēḷāmi
|āmpaṟ kuḻalāṟ payirpayir |empaṭappik
kāñcikkīḻc ceytēṅ kuṟi.'' (kalit.108)
|itu maṟuttetir kōṭal.
paḻitīr muṟuval ciṟitē tōṟṟaṟku |utāraṇam:
``|aṉṉiyō,
maṉṟattuk kaṇṭāṅku cāṉṟār makaḷiri
|iṉṟi |amiyēṉeṉ ṟiṉṉavuñ colluvāy
niṉṟāynī ceṉṟī |emarkāṇpar nāḷiyuṅ
kaṉṟoṭu cērum pulantu'' (kalit.110)
|itaṉuḷ ``|aṉṉiyō'' |eṉpatu nakiyoṭu kūṭiyacol.

kippaṭṭuk kalaṅkiṉum |eṉpatu--talivaṉ kiyakappaṭṭapiṉpu|eṉceytē māyiṉēm |eṉak kalakkamuṟiṉum |eṉṟavāṟu.

nāṇumikavariṉum |eṉpatu--talivikku muṉpuḷḷa nāṇattiṉum mikanāṇam vantuḻiyum |eṉṟavāṟu.

|iṭṭuppiri viraṅkiṉum |eṉpatu--talivaṉ |iṭṭu vittup pirivaṉ|eṉa |añciyataṟku |irakkamuṟiṉum |eṉṟavāṟu.

|arumicey tayarppiṉum |eṉpatu talivaṉaṉ varutaṟkuk kāvalākiya|arumi ceytataṉāl |avaṉum varutalittaviriṉum |eṉṟavāṟu.
varutalit tavirtali |ayarppu |eṉaṟār. |aṉṟiyum puṟattuviḷiyāṭutaṟku |arumi ceyya mayakkamvariṉum |eṉṟumām.ceyteṉpataṉic ceyaveṉat tirikka.

vantavaḻi |eḷḷiṉum |eṉpatu--talivaṉ vantaviṭattu |alarākumeṉṟañci |ikaḻntavaḻiyum |eṉṟavāṟu.

viṭṭuyirttaḻuṅkiṉum |eṉpatu--maṟiyātu colli |iraṅkiṉum|eṉṟavāṟu.

nontu teḷivoḻippiṉum |eṉpatu--talivaṉ teḷivitta teḷivi nontu,|ataṉi yoḻippiṉum |eṉṟavāṟu.

|accam nīṭiṉum |eṉpatu--talivaṉ varukiṉṟatu |iṭiyīṭāka |accammikkuḻiyum |eṉṟavāṟu.

pirintavaḻik kalaṅkiṉum |eṉpatu--talivaṉ pirintavaḻik kalakkamuṟiṉum |eṉṟavāṟu.
|atu tāḷāṇetirum pirivu.
peṟṟavaḻi maliyiṉum |eṉpatu--talivaṉōṭu kūṭṭam peṟṟavaḻimakiḻiṉum |eṉṟavāṟu.

varuntoḻiṟku |arumi vāyil kūṟiṉum |eṉpatu--talivaṉvarutaṟku|iṭiyīṭākak kāvalar kaṭukutalāṉ |īṇṭuvarutal |ariteṉattōḻitalivikkuc colliṉum |eṉṟavāṟu.

kūṟiya...kāliyum |eṉpatu--tōḻi |ivvāṟu kūṟiyataṉi maṉaṅkoḷḷātakālattiṉum |eṉṟavāṟu.

maṉippaṭṭu |arumaṟi yuyirttalum |eṉpatu--puṟattu viḷiyāṭutal|oḻintu maṉippaṭṭuk kalaṅkic citintavaḻit tōḻikkuccūḻtalaminta |ariya maṟipporuḷic collum |eṉṟavāṟu.
|eṉavē citiyātavaḻit tōḻikkuc collāḷām collāḷām |eṉpatu pōntatu.vēṭki maṟikkappaṭutaliṉ maṟiyāyiṟṟu.
`kippaṭṭuk kalaṅkal' mutalākak `kūṟiya vāyil koḷḷākkāli'yiṟākac collappaṭṭa paṉṉiruvakiyiṉum talimakaḷ tōḻikku|urikkappeṟum. |aḵtu |urikkuṅkāl maṉippaṭṭuk kalaṅki mēṉicitinta vaḻiyē |urikkappeṟuvatu. |āṇṭum |itaṟku |eṉceyvām |eṉa|ucāvutalōṭukūṭat taṉatu kātaṉmi tōṉṟa |urikkum |eṉṟavāṟu.maṉippaṭākkāl |avaṉik kāṇṭalāl |urikkavēṇṭuyavatilliyeṉṟavāṟāyiṟṟu. |ippaṉṉiraṇṭum |oruttimāṭṭu |oruṅku nikaḻvaṉa|alla. |ivviṭaṅkaḷ |urittaṟku |iṭameṉa |ilakkaṇaṅ kūṟiyavāṟu.
|avaṟṟuṭ kippaṭṭuk kalaṅkiyataṟkuc ceyyuḷ :-
`koṭiyavuṅ kōṭṭavum' |eṉṉuṅ kuṟiñcikkaliyuḷ,
``narantanā ṟirunkūntal |eñcātu naṉipaṟṟip
polampuṉi makaravāy nuṅkiya cikaḻiki
nalampeṟac cuṟṟiya kural |ami |orukāḻ
viraṉmuṟi cuṟṟi mōkkalum mōntaṉaṉ
naṟā |aviḻn taṉṉa |eṉ melviraṟ pōtukoṇṭu
ceṟā |ac ceṅkaṇ putiya vittup
paṟā |ak kurukiṉ |uyirttalum |uyirttaṉaṉ
toyyil |iḷamuli |iṉiya tivantu
toyyalan taṭakkiyiṉ vīḻpiṭi |aḷikkum
miyal yāṉiyiṉ maruṭṭalum maruṭṭiṉaṉ;
|ataṉāl,
|allal kaḷintaṉaṉ tōḻi nannakar
|aruṅkaṭi nīvāmi kūṟi ṉaṉṟeṉa
niṉṉoṭu cūḻval tōḻi nayampurin
tiṉṉatu ceytāṉ |ivaḷeṉa
maṉṉā |ulakattu maṉṉuvatu purimē.'' (kalit.54)
|itaṉuṭ kippaṭṭuk kalaṅkiyavāṟum |arumaṟi |uyirttavāṟum |ivvāṟuceyyākkāl |iṟantapaṭuvaṉ |eṉṉuṅa kuṟippiṉaḷāy `maṉṉāvulakattumaṉṉuvatu puriyum' |eṉavuṅ kūṟivāṟu kāṇka.
nāṇumikavantataṟkuc ceyyuḷ:-
``nōkkuṅkāl nōkkit toḻū|umpiṟar kāṇpār
tūkkili tūṟṟum paḻiyeṉak kivittup
pōkkuṅkāṟ pōkkum niṉintirukkum maṟṟunām
karkakum |iṭamaṉ ṟiṉi;
|ellā |evaṉceyvām nām.'' (kalit.63)
|itu nāṇam mikkavaḻit tōḻiyoṭu |ucāviyatu.
|iṭṭuppiriviraṅkiyataṟkuc ceyyuḷ:-
``|amma vāḻi tōḻi kātalar
pāvi yaṉṉa|eṉ |āykaviṉ toliya
nalmā mēṉi pacappac
celvēm |eṉpatam malikeḻu nāṭṭē.'' (|aiṅkuṟu. 221)
|eṉavarum.
vantavaḻi yeḷḷiyataṟkuc ceyyuḷ:-
``kaṇtiraḷ muttam mayakkum |iruṇmunnīrp
paṇṭaṅkoḷ nāvāy vaḻaṅkun tuṟivaṉi
muṇṭakak kāṉaluṭ kaṇṭēṉ |eṉatteḷintēṉ
niṉṟa |uṇarvilā tēṉ.'' (|aintiṇiyeḻu.56)
|itaṉuḷ `piṉṉum varuvaṉ |eṉṟiruntēṉ; |ataṉāṉ |eḷḷiṉēṉ' |eṉpatukaruttu.
``.........................
|ēṟiraṅ kiruḷiṭi |iraviṉiṟ patampeṟā |aṉ
māṟiṉeṉ |eṉak kūṟi maṉaṅkoḷḷun tāṉeṉpa
kūṭutal vēṭkiyāṟ kuṟipārttuk kuralnoccip
pāṭōrkkuñ ceviyoṭu pitalēṉ yāṉāka.'' (kalit. 46)
|iḵtu |eḷḷiṉāyeṉa niṉittāṉ |eṉṟavaḻik kūṟiyatu.
viṭṭuyir taḻuṅkiyataṟkuc ceyyuḷ:-
``piṇiniṟan tīrntu perumpaṇittōḷ vīṅka
maṇimali nāṭaṉ varuvaṉkol tōḻi
kaṇiniṟa vēṅki malarntuvaṇ ṭārkkum
maṇiniṟa mālip poḻutu.'' (tiṇimoḻi.9)
|eṉavum,
``mariyā |ukaḷum marampayil cōli
|uricār maṭamanti |oṭi |ukaḷum
puritīr malināṭaṉ pūṇēn takalam
|uriyā |uḻakku|eṉ neñcu.'' (kinnili.6)
|eṉavum varum.
nontu teḷivoḻittaṟkuc ceyyuḷ:-
``maṉṟat tuṟukaṟ karuṅkaṇ mucu|ukaḷuṅ
kuṉṟaka nāṭaṉ teḷitta teḷiviṉi
naṉṟeṉṟu tēṟit teḷintēṉ taliyaḷi
|oṉṟumaṟ ṟoṉṟum |aṉittu.'' (|aintiṇiyeḻu.9)
|eṉavarum.
|accam nīṭiṉum |eṉpataṟkuc ceyyuḷ:-
``meṉtiṉi mēynta taṟukaṭ paṉṟi
vaṉkal |aṭukkattut tuñcu nāṭaṉ
|enti yaṟital |añcikkol
|atuvē maṉṟa vārā miyē.'' (|aiṅkuṟu.261)
|eṉavum,
``maṉṟa marā|atta pē|emutir kaṭavuḷ
koṭiyōrt teṟū|um |eṉpa yāvatum
koṭiyar |allar|uṅ kuṉṟukeḻu nāṭar
paci|ip pacantaṉṟu nutalē
ñekiḻiya ñekiḻntaṉṟu taṭameṉ tōḷē.'' (kuṟun. 87)
|eṉavum varum.
pirintavaḻik kalaṅkiyataṟkuc ceyyuḷ:-
``varuvatu kollō tāṉē vārātu
|avaṇuṟi mēvaliṉ |amivatu kollō
puṉavar koḷḷiyiṟ pukalvaru maññi
|iruvi |irunta kuruvi veruvuṟap
pantāṭu makaḷiriṟ paṭartaruṅ
kuṉṟukoḻu nāṭaṉoṭu ceṉṟa|eṉ neñcē.'' (|aiṅkuṟu.3)
|eṉavum,
``|atukol tōḻi kāma nōyē
vatikuru kuṟaṅku miṉṉalip puṉṉi
|uṭitirit tivali |arumpun tīnīr
mellam pulampaṉ pirinteṉap
pallitaḻ |uṇkaṇ pāṭol lāvē.'' (kuṟun.5)
|eṉavum,
``maṇiniṟa neytal |iruṅkaḻic cērppaṉ
|aṇinalam |uṇṭakaṉṟāṉ |eṉṟuko lempōl
tiṇimaṇa lekkarmēl |otam peyarntu
tuṇimunnīr tuñcā tatu.'' (|aintiṇiyeḻu.60)
|eṉavum,
``neñcattār kāta lavarāka veytuṇṭal
|añcutum vēpāk kaṟintu.'' (kuṟaḷ. 1128)
|eṉavum,
kaṇṇuḷḷār kāta lavarākak kaṇṇum
kaḻutēm karappāk kaṟintu.'' (kuṟaḷ.1127)
|eṉavum varum.
|uṟaṅkāmiyum |uṇṇāmiyum kōlañ ceyyāmiyum varuttam piṟavuñcollutal. |ivvaḻi nī varuntāti niṉmāṭṭu |aṉpu perituṭiyāṉ |eṉattōḻi |āṟṟuvittavaḻi |āṟṟāmiyāṟ kūṟiyataṟkuc ceyyuḷ:-
``ciṟutiṉi mēynta taṟukaṭ paṉṟi
tuṟukal |aṭukkattut tuṇiyoṭu vatiyum
|ilaṅkumali nāṭaṉ varū|um
maruntum |aṟiyuṅkol tōḻiyavaṉ viruppē.'' (|aiṅkuṟu.262)
|eṉa varum.

<P>peṟṟavaḻi maliyiṉu meṉpataṟkuc ceyyuḷ:-
``|amma vāḻi tōḻi paṉmāṇ
nuṇmaṇal |aṭikari nammōṭāṭiya
taṇṇan tuṟivaṉ maṟii
|aṉṉi |aruṅkaṭi vantunṉ ṟōṉē" (|aiṅkuṟu.115)

|eṉavum

"muḷivaḷar mutala" |eṉṉum |akappāṭṭiṉuḷ,
"........... vēṭṭōrkku
|amiḻtat taṉṉa kamaḻtār mārpiṉ
vaṇṭiṭip paṭā|a muyakkamun
taṇṭāk kātalum talināḷ pōṉmē" (|akam. 332)

|eṉavum
"peyalkaṇ maṟittaliṉ vicumpukā ṇalarē
nīrparan toḻukaliṉ nilaṅkā ṇalarē
|elli cēṟaliṉ iruḷperitu paṭṭaṉṟu
pallōr tuñcum pāṉāṭ kaṅkul
yāṅkuvan taṉiyō ōṅkal veṟpa
vēṅki kamaḻum em ciṟukuṭi
yāṅkaṟintaṉiyō nōkō yāṉē. " (kuṟun. 355)

|eṉavum

|amma vāḻi tōḻi nalamika
nalla vāyiṉa |aḷiyameṉ tōḷkaḷ
mallal |iruṅkaḻi malarum
mellam pulampaṉ vanta vāṟē.'' (|aiṅkuṟu.120)
|eṉavum varum.

<P>varuntoḻiṟ karumi vāyilkūṟiyavaḻit talivi kūṟiyataṟkucceyyuḷ:-
``|aruṅkaṭi |aṉṉi kāval nīvip
peruṅkaṭi |iṟantu maṉṟam pōkip
pakalē palaruṅ kāṇa vāyviṭṭu
|akalvayaṟ paṭappi |avaṉūr viṉavic
ceṉmō vāḻi tōḻi paṉṉāḷ
karuvi |ārkkum |ayantikaḻ cilampiṉ
vāṉtōy māmalik kiḻavaṉic
cāṉṟōy |alli |eṉṟaṉam varaṟkē.'' (naṟṟiṇi.365)
|eṉavarum.

<P>kūṟiyavāyil koḷḷākkālattut taliviyurittaṟkucceyyuḷ :-
``kalvari yēṟik kaṭuvaṉ kaṉivāḻi
|elluṟu pōḻtiṉ |iṉiya paḻaṅkavuṭkoṇ
ṭolleṉa vōṭu malināṭaṉ taṉkēṇmi
collac coriyum vaḷi.'' (kinnili.7)
|eṉavarum.

<P>maṉippaṭṭuk kalaṅkic citinta vaḻit tōḻikku niṉittal cāṉṟa|arumaṟi |uyirttaṟkuc ceyyuḷ:-

<P>``palaviṉ paḻampeṟ piṅkaṇ kaṭuvaṉ
|elaveṉṟu |iṇipayirum |ēkalcūḻ veṟpaṉ
pulavuṅkol tōḻi puṇarvaṟin taṉṉi
celavuṅ kaṭintāḷ puṉattu.'' (tiṇimoḻi.10)
|eṉavum,

<P>poḻutum |elliṉṟu peyalum |ōvātu
kaḻutukaṇ paṉippa vīcum |ataṉṟalip
pulippal tālip putalvarp pulli
|aṉṉāy |eṉṉum |aṉṉiyum maṉṉō 
|eṉmalin taṉaṉkol tāṉē taṉmali
|āram nāṟu mārpiṉaṉ
māri yāṉiyiṉ vantuniṉ ṟōṉē.'' (kuṟun.16)
|eṉavum varum.

<P>|ivi yellām |iyaṟkippuṇarcci puṇarntapiṉ nikaḻvaṉa.|uḷḷappuṇarcciyāṉ |urivi pūṇṭiruntavarum |ivvāṟu kūṟappeṟum|eṉṟu koḷka, |āṇṭu maṉanikaḻcci |oruppaṭṭu niṟṟaliṉ.

<P>|uyirākkālattu |uyirttalum |uyircela |eṉpatu--|ivvāṟukūṟākkālattu |uyircellumāṟu colutalum |eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>|īṇṭu, |uyirttal |eṉpatu cuvātam |eṉiṉum |amiyum.|innikaḻcciyit tōḻikku nāṇattatāl |uriyāḷāyiṉ, nōyaṭavaruntum|eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>|utāraṇam:-
<P>``taḻiyaṇi |alkul tāṅkal cellā
nuḻiciṟu nucuppiṟa kevva māka
|ammel lākam niṟiya vīṅkiya
kommi varimuli ceppuṭaṉ |etiriṉa
yāṅkā kuvaḷkol pūṅkuḻi |eṉṉum
|avala neñcamō ṭucāvāk
kavali mākkaṭṭip pēti yūrē.'' (kuṟun.159)

itu yāṅkākuvaḷ eṉa uyircelavu kuṟittu niṉṟatu

iṉṉa ḷāyiṉaḷ naṉṉutal eṉṟavart
tuṉṉac ceṉṟu ceppunarp peṟiṉē
naṉṟumaṉ vāḻi tōḻinam paṭappi
nīrvār pimputaṟ kalitta
mārip pīrattalarcila koṇṭē

|eṉa varum.

<P>vēṟṟuvarivu...taṉpiḻippākat taḻī|it tēṟalum|eṉpatu-vēṟṟuvarivu variṉ |atu māṟṟutal mutalākat tamar taṟkāttakāraṇappakkam |īṟāka nikaḻumvaḻit taṉkuṟi tappit talivaṉ|etirppaṭutalillāk kālattu vantavaṉ peyarnta vaṟuṅkaḷam nōkkittaṉkuṟiyākavuṭampaṭṭut tēṟutalum |eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>|āṇṭu kalakkamiṉṟit tēṟumeṉpatu kūṟiṉārām.

<P>|avvaḻi, vēṟṟu varivu variṉ |atu māṟṟutaṟkaṇṇum|eṉpatu--piṟaṉoruvaṉ variya variṉ |ataṉi māṟṟutaṟkākavumtaṉkuṟi tappum |eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>neṟippaṭu...maṟippiṉum |eṉpatu--kūṭṭam |uṇmi vaḻakkiyalālnāṭukiṉṟa kālattu mey vēṟupāṭu nikaḻntuḻi, tōḻi |aṟiyāmalumcevili |aṟiyāmalun talivi maṟippiṉum |eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>poṟiyiṉ...|iyalpiṉ kaṇṇum |eṉpatu--poṟi yeṉpatu |ūḻ. |ūḻāṟkaṭṭappaṭṭa puṇarcciyik kuṟittu |oṟṟumippaṭṭa kaṇpiṉāṉētalivaṉ varitaṟkuk kuṟiyuṟukiṉṟataṉit teḷinta taliviceytaṟku |arumiyaminta |eṇvakiyiṉāṟ perumi |iyinta|iyalpiṉaḷāki niṟṟaṟkaṇṇum |eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>|eṇvakiyāvatu meyppāṭṭiyaluḷ maṉaṉ |aḻivillāta kūṭṭam |eṉa|otukiṉṟa,
<BR>`muṭṭuvayiṟ kaḻaṟal muṉivumeyn niṟuttal
<BR>|accattiṉ |akaṟal |avaṉpuṇarvu maṟuttal
<BR>tū tumuṉi viṉmi tuñcic cērtal
<BR>kātal kimmikal kaṭṭuri yiṉmi' (meyppāṭ.23)
<BR>|eṉpaṉa. |avaṟṟuḷ,

<P>muṭṭuvayiṟ kaḻaṟal |āvatu--kaḷavoḻukkam nikaḻāniṉṟuḻi nilavuveḷippāṭu, kāvalarkaṭukutal,, tāytuñcāmi, |ūrtuñcāmi,|ūrtuñcāmi, talivaṉ kuṟivaruvataṟku |iṭiyīṭupaṭutal, |ivvaḻikkaḷavoḻukkattiṉāṟ payaṉiṉmi kūṟal. |avvāṟu kūṟi |iṉi |ivvoḻukkam|amiyumeṉa varinteytutalkāṟum puṇarccaṭayi virumpātukalakkamiṉṟit teḷivuṭiyaḷām.

<P>muṉivu meynniṟuttal |āvatu--|ivvoḻukkattiṉāṉ vanta tuṉpattippiṟarkkup pulaṉākāmi meyyiṉ kaṇṇē niṟuttal.

<P>|avvaḻiyum varinteytal cāṉṟamiyum puṇarcciyeṉak kuṟi vaḻiccellāḷām.

<P>|accattiṉ |akaṟal |āvatu--|italip piṟaraṟivar |eṉṉum|accattiṉāṉum kuṟivaḻic cellāḷām.

<P>|avaṉ puṇarvumaṟuttal |āvatu--|avvaḻit talivaṉmāṭṭut tūtākivaruñ coṟkēṭṭali muṉiviṉmi.

<P>tañcik cērtal |āvatu--|uṟaṅkāmiyiṉṟi yuṟakkam nikaḻtal.

<P>kātal kimmikal |āvaratu--|ivvāṟu ceyyuṅ kātal |aṉpiṉmiyaṉṟi|aṉpu mikutal.

<P>kaṭṭuri yiṉmi |āvatu--kūṟṟu nikaḻtaliṉmi.

<P>|iviyellām kalkakamillāta nilimi yātaliṟ perumicāṉṟa|iyalpāyiṉa.

poytaliyaṭutta maṭaliṉ kaṇṇum |eṉpatu--poymmiyāl maṭalēṟuvaṉ|eṉat talivaṉ kūṟiyavaḻiyum veṟutta |uḷḷattaḷāyk kuṟivaḻiccellāḷām.

kiyaṟu tōḻi kaṇṇīrtuṭippiṉum |eṉpatu--tōḻikiyiṉāl talivikaṇṇīr tuṭittavaḻiyuṅ kuṟivaḻic cellāḷām.

<P>veṟiyāṭṭiṭattu veruviṉ kaṇṇum |eṉpatu--talivi vēṟupāṭu|eṟṟiṉāyiṟṟeṉac cevili veṟiyāṭṭuvikkavarum |accattiṉāṉuṅkuṟivaḻic cellāḷām.

kuṟiyiṉ |oppumi maruṭaṟ kaṇṇum |eṉpatu--talivaṉ ceyta kuṟiyi|oppumipaṟṟi ceṉṟu |aḵtu |avvaḻi maruḷutaṟkaṇṇum kuṟivaḻiccellāḷām.
|aḵtāvaṉa puṉṉeḻupputal pōlvaṉa. |avipeṟṟup puḷḷaravam |eḻum.|avvāṟu maruḷutal.

varivutali variṉum |eṉpatu-talivaṉ variyavarukiṉṟa nāḷ|aṇittākavariṉum kuṟivaḻic cellāḷām.

tamartaṟkātta kāraṇamaruṅkiṉum |eṉpatu--taṉṉit tamar kāttakāraṇap pakkattiṉum |eṉṟavā#āṟu.
|aḵtu |aiyamuṟṟuk kāttal.

<P>|avaṟṟuḷ vēṟṟuvarivu variṉ |atu māṟṟutaṟkut talivi kūṟiyaceyyuḷ :-

<P>``|aṉṉi vāḻivēṇ ṭaṉṉi puṉṉi
poṉniṟam viriyum pūkkeḻu tuṟivaṉi
|eṉṉi |eṉṟum yāmē |ivvūr
piṟitoṉ ṟākak kūṟum
|āṅkum |ākkumō vāḻiya pālē.'' (|ainkuṟu.110)
|eṉa varum.

<P><B>((neṟippaṭu nāṭṭatta nikaḻntami maṟittaṟkuc ceyyuḷ))</B>

<P>``tuṟivaṉ tuṟanteṉat tuṟiyirun taḻuta|eṉ
mmamar vāṇmuka nōkki |aṉṉiniṉ
|avalam |uriyeṉ ṟaṉaḷē kaṭaleṉ
pañcāyp pāvi koṇṭu
vaṇṭalañ ciṟumaṉi citittateṉ ṟēṉē.''
|eṉa varum

<P><B>((muṭṭuvayiṟ kaḻaṟkuc ceyyuḷ:))</B>

<P>``|irumpiḻi māri |aḻuṅkaṉ mūtūr
viḻaviṉ ṟāyiṉun tuñcā tākum
mallal |āvaṇam maṟukuṭaṉ maṭiyiṉ
vallurik kaṭuñcol |aṉṉi tuñcāḷ
piṇikōḷ |aruñciṟi |aṉṉi tuñcil
tuñcāk kaṇṇar kāvalar kaṭukuvar
|ilaṅkuvēl |iḷiyar tuñciṉ vi|eyiṟṟu
valañcurit tōki ñāḷi makiḻum
|aravavāy ñamali makiḻātu maṭiyiṟ
pakaluru |uṟaḻa nilavukkāṉṟu vicumpiṉ
|akalvāy maṇṭilam niṉṟuviri yummē
tiṅkaḷkal cērpu kaṉiyiruḷ maṭiyiṉ
|illeli valci valvāyk kūki
kaḻutuvaḻaṅ kiyāmat taḻitakak kuḻaṟum
vaḷikkaṭa cēval vāḷātu maṭiyiṉ
maṉicceṟi kōḻi māṇkural |iyalpum
|ellā maṭinta kāli yorunāḷ
nillā neñcat tavarvā ralarē, |ataṉāl
|aripey puṭṭil |ārppap pariciṟantu
|āti pōkiya pāypari naṉmā
nocci vēlit tittaṉ |uṟantik
kalmutir puṟaṅkāṭ ṭaṉṉa
palmuṭṭiṉṟāl tōḻinaṅ kaḷavē.'' (|akam. 122)
|eṉa varum.
muṉivu meynniṟuttaṟkuc ceyyuḷ :-
``nōmē neñcē nōmē neñcē
|imitīyp paṉṉa kaṇṇīr tāṅki
|amitaṟ kamintanaṅ kātalar
muṉivu meynniṟuttaṟkuc ceyyuḷ :-
``nōmē neñcē nōmē neñcē
|imitīyap paṉṉa kaṇṇīr tāṅki
|amitaṟ kamintanaṅ kātalar
|amivilar |ākutal nōmē neñcē.'' (kuṟun.4)
|eṉa varum.
|accattiṉ |akaṟaṟkuc ceyyuḷ:-
``pēṇupa pēṇār periyōr |eṉpatu
nāṇuttak kaṉṟatu kāṇuṅ kāli
|uyirōr |aṉṉa ceyirtīr naṭpiṉ
niṉakkiyāṉ maṟittal yāvatu mikapperitu
|aḻitak kaṉṟāl tāṉē koṇkaṉ
yāṉyāy |añcuval |eṉiṉun tāṉ|eṟ
pirital cūḻāṉ maṉṉē |iṉiyē
kāṉal |āyam |aṟiyiṉum |āṉātu
|alarvatu |aṉṟukol |eṉṉu mataṉāl
pularvatu kol|avaṉ naṭpeṉa
|añcuval tōḻi|eṉ ṉeñcat tāṉē.'' (naṟṟiṇi.72)
|eṉa varum
|avaṉ puṇarvu maṟuttaṟkuc ceyyuḷ :-
``yāru millit tāṉē kaḷvaṉ
tāṉatu poyppiṉ yāṉ|evaṉ ceykō
tiṉittā ḷaṉṉa ciṟupacuṅ kāla
|oḻukunīr |āral pārkkuṅ
kurukum |uṇṭutām maṇanta ñāṉṟē.'' (kuṟun.25)
|eṉa varum.
tū tumuṉiviṉmikkuc ceyyuḷ :-
``pulvīḻ |iṟṟik kallivar veḷvēr
variyiḻi yaruviyiṉ tōṉṟu nāṭaṉ
tī til neñcattuk kiḷavi namvayiṉ
vantaṉṟu vāḻi tōḻi nāmum
neypey tīyiṉ |etirkoṇṭu
tāmvarin taṉiyameṉa viṭukam tūtē.'' (kuṟun. 106)
|eṉa varum.
tuñcic cērtaṟkuc ceyyuḷ vantavaḻik kāṇka.
kātal kimmikutaṟkuc ceyyuḷ :-
``kaṉṟum |uṇṇātu kalattiṉumpaṭātu
nallāṉ tīmpāl nilattuk kā |aṅku
|eṉakku mākā teṉṉikkum |utavātu
pacali |uṇī|iyar vēṇṭun
titali |alkul|eṉ māmik kaviṉē.'' (kuṟun.27)
|eṉa varum.
kaṭṭuriyiṉmikkuk kūṟṟu nikaḻātu.
poytaliyaṭutta maṭaliṉkaṇ talimakaḷ kūṟiya ceyyuḷ vanta vaḻikkāṇka.

<P>kiyaṟu tōḻi kaṇṇīr tuṭittaṟkuc ceyyuḷ:-
``yām|em kāman tāṅkavun tāmatam
keḻutaki miyiṉ |aḻutaṉa tōḻi
kaṉṟāṟṟup paṭutta puṉtalic ciṟā|ar
maṉṟa vēṅki malarpata nōkki
|ēṟā tiṭṭa |ēmap pūcal
viṇtōy viṭarakat tiyampum
kuṉṟa nāṭaṟ kaṇṭa|eṅ kaṇṇē.'' (kuṟun.241)
|eṉa varum.
veṟiyāṭṭiṭattu veruviṉāṟ kūṟiyataṟkuc ceyyuḷ:
``nammuṟu tuyaram nōkki |aṉṉi
vēlavaṟ ṟantaṉaḷ |āyiṉav vēlaṉ
veṟikamaḻ nāṭaṉ kēṇmi
|aṟiyumō tilla ceṟiyeyiṟ ṟōyē. (|aiṅkuṟu. 241)
|eṉa varum.
kuṟiyiṉ |oppumi maruṭaṟkuk kūṟiya ceyyuḷ :-
|aṇikaṭal taṇcērppaṉ tērppirimā pūṇṭa
maṇiyaravam |eṉṟeḻuntu pōntēṉ--kaṉivirumpum
puḷḷaravaṅ kēṭṭup peyarntēṉ |oḷiyiḻāy
|uḷḷuruku neñkiṉēṉ yāṉ.'' (|aintiṇiyim.50)
``.......................
kaṉipeyal naṭunāḷyāṉ kaṇmāṟak kuṟipeṟā |aṉ
puṉiyiḻāy |eṉpaḻi niṉakkurikkun tāṉeṉpa
tuḷinaci vēṭkiyāṉ micipāṭum puḷḷiṉṟaṉ
|aḷinaci|i |ārvuṟṟa |aṉpiṉēṉ yāṉāka.'' (kalit.46)
|eṉa varum.
varivu talivantavaḻik kūṟiya ceyyuḷ :-
``kollip puṉatta |akilcumantu kalpāyntu
vāṉiṉ |aruvi tatumpak kaviṉiya
nāṭaṉ nayamuṭiyaṉ |eṉpataṉāl nīppiṉum
vāṭal maṟantaṉa tōḷ.'' (|aintiṇiyeḻu.2)
nayamuṭiya ṉeṉṟataṉāṉ varivu talivantami yaṟintu kūṟiṉāḷām.
``|ilipaṭar taṇkuḷavi yēynta potumpiṟ
kuliyuṭik kāntaḷ |iṉavaṇ ṭimirum
variyaka nāṭaṉum vantāṉmaṟ ṟaṉṉi
|aliyum |alipōyiṟ ṟiṉṟu.'' (|aintiṇiyeḻu.3)
kaḷa vaṟivuṟṟavaḻik kūṟiya ceyyuḷ :-
``yāṅkā kuvamō |aṇinutaṟ kuṟumakaḷ
tēmpaṭu cāral ciṟutiṉip peruṅkural
cevvāyp piṅkiḷi kavara nīmaṟṟu
|evvāyc ceṉṟaṉi |avaṇeṉak kūṟi
|aṉṉi yāṉāḷ kaḻaṟamuṉ ṉiṉṟu
|aruvi |ārkkum peruvari nāṭaṉi
|aṟiyalum |aṟiyēṉ kāṇṭalum |ilaṉē
vetirpuṉi taṭṭiyēṉ malarpūk koytu
cuṉipāyn tāṭiṟṟum |ilaṉeṉa niṉivili
poyyal |antō vāyttaṉi yatukēṭṭut
taliyiṟiñ ciṉaḷē yaṉṉi
celavoḻin taṉiyā laṇiyi nīpuṉattē.'' (naṟṟiṇi. 147)
|eṉa varum.
tamartaṟkātta kāraṇap pakkattiṟkuk kūṟiya ceyyuḷ :-
``perunīr |aḻuvat tenti tanta'' |eṉṉuṅ kaḷiṟṟiyāṉi niriyuḷ
``palpūṅ kāṉal |alkiṉam varutal
kavvi nallaṇaṅ kuṟṟa |ivvūrk
koṭitaṟi peṇṭir coṟkoṇ ṭaṉṉi
kaṭikoṇ ṭaṉaḷē tōḻi peruntuṟi
|elliyum |iravum |eṉṉātu kalleṉa
valavaṉ |āynta vaṇpari
nilavumaṇal koṭkumōr tēruṇ ṭeṉavē.'' (|akam.20)
|eṉa varum.

<P><B>((taṉkuṟitaḷḷiya teruḷāk kāli vantavaṉ peyarnta vaṟunkaḷam nōkkit taṉpiḻippākat taḻī|it |itaṟiyataṟkuc ceyyuḷ))</B>

<P>`|iruḷkiḻippatupōl' |eṉṉum kaḷiṟṟiyāṉi niriyuḷ,

<P>``vāḷnaṭan taṉṉa vaḻakkaruṅ kavali
|uḷḷunar |uṭkuṅ kallaṭarca ciṟuneṟi
|aruḷpuri neñcamō |allaṉ tanta
nītava ṟuṭiyiyum |alli niṉvayiṉ
|āṉā |arumpaṭar ceyta
yāṉē tōḻi tavaṟuṭi yēṉē.'' (|akam.72)
|eṉa varum.

<P>vaḻuviṉṟu...|aṉṉavumuḷavē |eṉpatu--vaḻuviṉṟu nili|iya|iyaṟpaṭuporuṇ mutalāka `|ēmañcāṉṟa |uvaki' yīṟākac collappaṭṭa|iṭaṅkaḷil taṉṉiṭattu |urimiyum |avaṉiṭattup parattimiyum|aṉṉaviyum nikaḻappeṟum |eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>|aṉṉa |eṉpatu |avipōlvaṉa |eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>|oriṭattukkaṇ |eṉṟataṉāl |ivvāṟu |ellār māṭṭum |evviṭattumnikaḻātu |eṉṟavāṟām. |eṉavē mēṟ kuṟippiṉum |iṭattiṉumallatu(kaḷaviyal-18) kūṟṟu nikaḻāteṉpataṉi maṟuttu |oriṭattuk kūṟṟunikaḻum |eṉṟavāṟām.

<P>|avaṟṟuḷ, vaḻuviṉṟu nili|iya |iyaṟpaṭu poruḷiṉum |eṉpatutalivaṉi |iyaṟpaḻittavaḻi |avaṉ kuṟṟamilaṉākaniliniṟuttappaṭṭa |iyaṟpaṭamoḻinta |avaṉ kuṟmilaṉākaniliniṟuttappaṭṭa |iyaṟpaṭamoḻinta poruṇmik kaṇṇum taṉ vayiṉ|urimi tōṉṟavum |avaṉ vayiṟ parattimi tōṉṟavum kūṟum talivi|eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>|iraṇṭiṉuḷ |oṉṟutōṉṟa |urikku meṉṟavāṟu. |eṉavē |iraṇṭuntōṟṟa varuvaṉavu muḷavām.

<P>poḻutu māṟum...cintik kaṇṇum |eṉpatu--talivaṉ varuṅkālamum|iṭaṉum kuṟṟamuḷavātalāṉ, |āṇṭu |aḻivuvanta cintik kaṇṇumtalimakaḷ taṉvayiṉ |urimiyum |avaṉvayiṟ parattimiyumu/ tōṉṟakkūṟum |eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>kāmañ ciṟappiṉum |eṉpatu--talimakaṉmāṭṭaṭu vēṭki mikiṉumtaṉvayiṉ |urimiyum |avaṉvayiṟ parattimiyum |urikkun talivi|eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>|avaṉ |aḷi ciṟappiṉum |eṉpatu--talivaṉ taliyaḷi mikkavaḻiyumtaṉvayiṉ |urimiyum |avaṉvayiṟ parattimiyum tōṉṟakkūṟum|eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>|ēmañcāṉṟa |uvakikkaṇṇum |eṉpatu-|ēmam poruntiyamakiḻccivantuḻit taṉvayiṉ |urimiyum |avaṉvayiṟ parattimiyumtōṉṟak kūṟum |ēṉṟavāṟu. |aḵtāvatu |avaṉ varintallatu nīṅkāṉ|eṉṉum |uvaki.

<P><B>((|avaṟṟuḷ, vaḻuviṉṟu nili|iya |iyaṟpaṭu poruṭkaṇkūṟiyataṟkuc ceyyuḷ))</B>
``|aṭumpama laṅkoṭi |uḷputin toḻippa
veṇmalar virikkun taṇṇan tuṟivaṉ
koṭiyaṉ |āyiṉum |āka
|avaṉē tōḻi|eṉ ṉuyirkā valaṉē.'' (|aiṅkuṟu.taṉi.6)
|eṉa varum.

<P><B>((poḻutu māṟum puriva taṉmiyiṉ |aḻivutalivanta cintiyāltalivi kūṟiyaceyyuḷ))</B>"

<P>``koṭuvari vēṅki piḻittuk kōṭpaṭṭu
maṭicevi vēḻam |iriya-|aṭiyōci
|añci yotuṅkum |ataruḷḷi |āriruḷ
tuñcā cuṭarttoṭi kaṇ'' (|aintiṇiyim. 16)

<P>``vaḷivāyc ciṟukiḷi viḻitiṉi kaṭiyac
celkeṉ ṟāḷē |aṉṉi |eṉanī
colliṉ |evaṉān tōḻi kolli
neṭuṅki vaṉmāṉ kaṭumpakal |uḻanta
kuṟuṅki |irumpulik kōḷval |ēṟṟi
piṅkaṭ cennāy paṭupatam pārkkum
|āriruḷ naṭunāḷ varuti
cāral nāṭa vāralō |eṉavē.'' (kuṟun.141)
<BR>|eṉa varum.

<P><B>((kāma mikkavaḻik kūṟiya ceyyuḷ))</B>

<P>``|amma vāḻi tōḻi nalaṉē
|iṉṉa tākutal koṭitē puṉṉi
|aṇimalar tuṟitoṟu virikkum
maṇinīrc cērppaṉi maṟavā tōrkkē.'' (|aiṅkuṟu.117)
|itu taṉvayiṉ |urimi:
``naḷḷeṉ ṟaṉṟē yāmañ collavintu
|iṉitaṭaṅ kiṉarē mākkaḷ muṉiviṉṟi
naṉantali |ulakamun tuñcum
|oryāṉ maṉṟa tuñcā tēṉē.'' (kuṟun.6)

<P><B>((|iḵtu |avaṉvayiṟ parattimi:))</B>

<P>``koṭuntāḷ |alava kuṟiyām |irappēm
|oṭuṅkā |olikaṭaṟ cērppaṉ--neṭuntēr
kaṭanta vaḻiyi|eṅ kaṇṇārak kāṇa
naṭantu citiyāti nī.'' (|aintiṇiyim. 42)

<P><B>((|avaṉaḷi ciṟantavaḻit talivikūṟiya ceyyuḷ))</B>

<P>``cēṇōṉ māṭṭiya naṟumpuki ñekiḻi
vāṉa mīṉiṉ vayiṉ vayiṉ |imikkum
|oṅkumali, nāṭaṉ cāntupular |akalam
|uḷḷiṉ |uḷnōy malkum
pulliṉ māyva tevaṉkol |aṉṉāy.'' (kuṟun.150)
``maṉṟap palaviṉ cuḷiviḷi tīmpaḻam
|uṇṭuvantu manti mulivaruṭak--kaṉṟamarn(tu)
yāmāp piriva tilam.'' (|aintiṇiyeḻu.4)
|eṉa varum.

<P><B>((|ēmañ cāṉṟa |uvakikkaṇ kūṟiya ceyyuḷ))</B>

<P>|oṅkal |iṟuvarimēṟ kāntaḷ kaṭikaviṉap
pāmpeṉa |oṭi |urumiṭippak kaṇṭiraṅkum
pūṅkuṉṟa nāṭaṉ puṇarntavan nāḷpōlā
|īṅku nekiḻnta vaḷi.'' (tiṇimoḻi.3)
|eṉa varum.

<P><B>((parattimi tōṉṟa vantataṟkuc ceyyuḷ))</B>

``..........................
kaṇaṅkoḷ |iṭumaṇaṟ kāvi varuntap
piṇaṅkiru mōṭṭa tirivan taḷikkum
maṇaṅkamaḻ |aimpālār |ūṭali |āṅkē
vaṇaṅki |uṇarppāṉ tuṟi.'' (kalit. 131)
<BR>|eṉṉum pāṭṭiṉuḷ tāṉ |ūṭiṉāḷākavum makiḻntavāṟum |avaṉvayiṟparattimi kūṟiyavāṟum kāṇka.

<P>|iccūttirattāṟ colliyatu `maṟintavaṟ kāṇṭal' mutalāka|otappaṭṭa |aṟuvakip poruṇmiyum, `kippaṭṭuk kalaṅkal'mutalākak `kūṟiyavāyil koḷḷākkāli' |īṟākavarum makiḻcciyiṉālmaṉippaṭṭuk kalaṅkik citintavaḻi |eṇṇutal cāṉṟa |arumaṟiyiccollutalum, |ivvāṟum |eṇṇantāṉ |uriyākkālattut taṉṉuyircellumāṟu |urittalum, `vēṟṟuvarivu variṉ |atu māṟṟutal'mutalākat `tamartaṟkātta kāraṇappakkam' |īṟākat taṉ kuṟipiḻikkaniṟpakap peṟum |eṉavum, |avvaḻit talivaṉ vantu peyarntuḻikkalakkamiṉṟit teḷitalum, `vaḻuviṉṟu nili|iya |iyaṟpaṭu poruḷ'mutalāka |ēmam cāṉṟa |uvaki' |īṟākat tāṉ |uriyaḷākiya neṟiyumtalivaṉ |ayalākiya niliyumpō lavariṟ collappeṟum |eṉavumkuṟippiṉum |iṭattiṉum |allatu vēṭki neṟippaṭṭavāṟākattalivikkuk kūṟṟu nikaḻumiṭamum |uṇarttiyavāṟu.


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_110">{SA TP110i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li> variviṭi vitta kālattu varuntiṉum
<li>variyā nāḷiṭi vantōṉ muṭṭiṉum
<li>|uriyeṉat tōḻikku |urittaṟ kaṇṇum
<li>tāṉē kūṟuṅ kālamum |uḷavē.
</ol>

<P>|ituvum talivimāṭṭuc col nikaḻumiṭam |uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.


<P>(|i-ḷ.) talivaṉ |iyaṟkippuṇarcci puṇarntu nīṅkukiṉṟāṉ;|iṉṉanāḷ varintu koḷval |eṉakkūṟit tōḻiyiṟ kūṭṭattiṟku muyalātutaṇantavaḻi yataṉit tōḻi |aiyappaṭuṅ kuṟipputtōṉṟāmimaṟittoḻukiya talivi |avaṉ varuntuṇiyum |āṟṟātu varuttamuṟiṉumvariyāta nāḷiṉ kaṇ maṟintoḻukāniṉṟa talivaṉ cevilimutalāyiṉāri muṭṭiṉavaḻiyum |ivvoḻukkattiṉi niṉ tōḻikku|uriyeṉat talivaṉ kūṟiyavaḻiyum talivi tāṉē kūṟuṅ kālamum |uḷa|eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>|ummi |etirmaṟiyātalāṟ kūṟāmi perumpāṉmi. kālamum |eṉṟatu|ivvoḻukkam puṟattārkkup pulaṉāṅ kālam. |akkālattut tōḻimatiyuṭampaṭāmal |aṟivikkum |eṉṟavāṟu.
|iṉi, variviṭivitta kālattu varuttamuṟṟavaḻik kūṟiya ceyyuḷ:-
``puṉavaṉ tuṭavip poṉpōṟ ciṟutiṉik
kaṭiyuṇ kaṭavuṭ kiṭṭa cilkural
|aṟiyā tuṇṭaṉam maññi yāṭumakaḷ
veṟiyuṟu vaṉappiṉ vērttuṟṟu naṭuṅkuñ
cūrmali nāṭaṉ kēṇmi
nīrmali kaṇṇoṭu niṉippā kiṉṟē.'' (kuṟun.105)
|eṉa varum.
variyā nāḷiṭi vantōṉ muṭṭiyavaḻit talivi kūṟiyataṟkuc ceyyuḷ:-
``tāḻi kurukīṉun taṇṇan tuṟivaṉi
māḻimāṉ nōkkiṉ maṭamoḻi--nūḻi
nuḻiyu maṭamakaṉ yārkoleṉ ṟaṉṉi
puḻiyum |aṭittāḷ katavu.'' (kinnili.59)
|eṉavum,
``|aṟiyā miyiṉ |aṉṉi |añcik
kuḻiyaṉ kōtiyaṉ kuṟumpin toṭiyaṉ
viḻavayar tuṇaṅki taḻuvukañ cella
neṭunimir teruviṟ kipuku koṭumiṭi
notuma lāḷaṉ katumeṉat tākkaliṉ
kēṭpār |uḷarkol |illikol pōṟṟeṉa
yāṇatu pacali |eṉṟaṉaṉ |ataṉetir
nāṇili |eluva |eṉṟavan ticiṉē
ceṟunarum viḻiyuñ cemma lōṉeṉa
naṟunutal |arivi pōṟṟēṉ
ciṟumi perumiyiṟ kāṇātu tuṇintē.'' (naṟṟiṇi.50)
|eṉavum varum. |itaṉkaṇ |eṉṟāṉeṉa |oru col varuvikka.
|uriyeṉat tōḻikku |urittaṟkuc ceyyuḷ:-
``poṉ|iṇar vēṅki kaviṉiya pūmpoḻiluḷ
naṉmali nāṭaṉ nalampuṉiya-meṉmuliyāy
pōyiṉa tinnāḷ puṉattu maṟiyiṉāl
|ēyiṉār |iṉṟum |iṉitu.'' (|aintiṇiyim.11)
|eṉa varum
|iṉṉum, `|uriyeṉat tōḻik kurittaṟ kaṇṇum' |eṉpataṟkuttalivaṟku |uriyeṉat tōḻikku |uriyeṉat tōḻikku |urittaṟ kaṇṇum|eṉṟumām.
|utāraṇam-
``|eṉṉikol tōḻi |avarkaṇṇum naṉkilli
|aṉṉi mukaṉum |atuvākum--poṉṉalar
puṉṉiyam pūṅkāṉaṟ cērppaṉit takkatō
niṉṉalla tilleṉ ṟuri.'' (|aintiṇiyeḻu.54)
|eṉa varum. (22)


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_111">{SA TP111i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li>|uyiriṉum ciṟantaṉṟu nāṇē nāṇiṉum
<li>ceyirtīr kāṭcik kaṟpucciṟan taṉṟeṉat
<li>tollōr kiḷavi pulliya neñcamoṭu
<li>kāmak kiḻavaṉ |uḷvaḻip paṭiṉum
<li>tāvil naṉmoḻi kiḻavi kiḷappiṉum
<li>|āvaki piṟavum tōṉṟumaṉ poruḷē.
</ol>

<P>|ituvum |atu.


<P>(|i-ḷ.) |uyiriṉum nāṇ ciṟantatu; |ataṉiṉum kuṟṟantīrntakāṭciyiṉiyuṭiya kaṟpuc ciṟantatu |eṉa muṉṉōr kūṟṟi yuṭkoṇṭaṭutalivaṉuḷḷa viṭattuc cellum varutta millāc collit talivicollutalumākiya |avvaki piṟavuntōṉṟum |avi poruḷām |eṉṟavāṟu.
maṉ |ākkattiṉkaṇ vantatu. |eṉavē |ivvāṟu ceytal poruḷalla |eṉṟukūṟaṟka |eṉṟavāṟu. |itaṉuḷ nāṇattiṉum kaṟpuc ciṟanta teṉṟavāṟu.
notumalar varivu nōkkik kūṟuvatu--
``|aḷitō tāṉē nāṇē nammoṭu
naṉinīṭu |uḻantaṉṟu maṉṉē |iṉiyē
vāṉpūṅ karumpiṉ |oṅkumaṇaṟ ciṟuciṟi
tīmpuṉal neritara vīḻntuk kā |aṅkut
tāṅkum |aḷavit tāṅkik
kāma neritarak kinnil lātē.'' (kuṟun. 149)
``kōṭī rilaṅkuvaḷi nekiḻa nāṭoṟum
pāṭila kaliḻuṅ kaṇṇoṭu pulampi
|īṅkivaṇ |uṟitalum |uykuvam |āṅkē
|eḻu|iṉi vāḻiyeṉ neñcē muṉā|atu
kullik kaṇṇi vaṭuvar muṉiyatu
palvēṟ kaṭṭi naṉṉāṭṭu |umpar
moḻipeyar tē|ettā rāyiṉum
vaḻipaṭal cūḻnticiṉ |avaruṭi nāṭṭē.'' (kuṟun.11)
|itu kākkiḻava ṉuḷvaḻip paṭutal.
tāvil naṉmoḻi kūṟiyataṟkuṟkuc ceyyuḷ:-
``maṉṟa marā|atta pē|emutir kaṭavuḷ
koṭiyōrt teṟū|um |eṉpa yāvatuṅ
koṭiyar |allar|em kuṉṟukeḻu nāṭar
paci|iya pacantaṉṟu nutalē
ñekiḻiya ñekiḻntaṉṟu taṭameṉ tōḷē.'' (kuṟun.87)
|eṉa varum. (25)


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_112">{SA TP112i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li>nāṟṟamum tōṟṟamum |oḻukkamum |uṇṭiyum
<li>ceyviṉi maṟippiṉum celaviṉum payilviṉum
<li><li>puṇarcci yetirppā ṭuḷḷuṟuttu varū|um
<li>|uṇarcci |ēḻiṉum |uṇarnta piṉṟi
<li>meyyiṉum poyyiṉum vaḻinili piḻiyātu
<li>palvōṟu kavarporuḷ nāṭṭat tāṉuṅ
<li>kuṟiyuṟaṟ ketiriya kiḻavaṉi maṟiyuṟap
<li>perumiyiṟ peyarppiṉum |ulakurit toḻippiṉum
<li>|arumiyiṉ |akaṟciyum |avaḷaṟi vuṟuttup
<li>piṉvā veṉṟalum pētimi yūṭṭalum
<li>muṉṉuṟu puṇarcci muṟiniṟut turittalum
<li>|añciyac cuṟuttalum |urittuḻik kūṭṭamoṭu
<li>|eñcātu kiḷanta |irunāṉku kiḷaviyum
<li>vanta kiḻavaṉi māyañ ceppip
<li>poṟutta kāraṇaṅ kuṟitta kāliyum
<li>puṇarntapiṉ |avaṉvayiṉ vaṇaṅkaṟ kaṇṇuṅ
<li>kuṟintavaṭ paṭariṉum maṟintava ḷarukat
<li>taṉṉoṭum |avaḷoṭum muṉṉamuṉ taḷi|ip
<li>piṉṉili nikaḻum palvēṟu maruṅkiṉum
<li>naṉṉayam peṟṟuḷi nayampuri |iṭattiṉum
<li>|eṇṇarum paṉṉaki kaṇṇiya vakiyiṉum
<li>puṇarcci vēṇṭiṉum vēṇṭāp piriviṉum
<li>|ōmpaṭik kiḷavip pāṅkiṉ kaṇṇum
<li>ceṅkaṭu moḻiyāl citivuṭit tāyiṉum
<li>|eṉpunekap pirintōḷ viḻicceṉṟu kaṭi|i
<li>|aṉputali |aṭutta vaṉpuṟik kaṇṇum
<li>|āṟṟatu tīmi |aṟivuṟu kalakkamum
<li>kāppiṉ kaṭumi kiyaṟa variṉum
<li>kaḷaṉum poḻutum varinīli vilakkik
<li>kātal mikuti |uḷappaṭap piṟavum
<li>nāṭum |ūrum |illuṅ kuṭiyum
<li>piṟappuñ ciṟappum |iṟappa nōkki
<li>|avaṉvayiṉ tōṉṟiya kiḷaviyoṭu toki |i
<li>|aṉinila vakiyāṉ varital vēṇṭiṉum
<li>|aiyac ceyki tāykketir maṟuttup
<li>poyyeṉa māṟṟi meyvaḻik koṭuppiṉum
<li>|avaḷvilaṅ kuṟiṉuṅ kaḷampeṟak kāṭṭiṉum
<li>piṟaṉvari vāyiṉum |avaṉvarivu maṟuppiṉum
<li>muṉṉili |aṟaṉeṉap paṭutaleṉ ṟiruvakip
<li>puritīr kiḷavi tāyiṭip pukuppiṉum
<li>varivuṭaṉ paṭṭōrk kaṭāval vēṇṭiṉum
<li>|āṅkataṉ taṉmiyiṉ vaṉpu|aiṟa |uḷappaṭap
<li>pāṅkuṟa vanta nāleṭṭu vakiyiṉum
<li>tāṅkaruñ ciṟappiṉ tōḻi mēṉa.
</ol>

<P>|eṉṟatu, kaḷavoḻukkattiṉkaṇ tōḻikkuriya kiḷaviyellāmtōḻikkuriya kiḷaviyellām tokuttu |uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.


<P>(|i-ḷ.) nāṟṟamu.....nāṭṭattāṉum |eṉpatu--nāṟṟamutalākaccollappaṭṭa |ēḻiṉāṉum puṇarccikku muntuṟṟa nilimiyi |uṭkoṇṭuvarum maṉanikaḻcci yēḻiṉum puṇarcciyuṇmi yaṟinta piṉṟimeyyiṉāṉum poyyiṉāṉun talivi kulattiṉuḷḷār nilimiyiṟ piḻiyātu palavāki vēṟupaṭṭa kavarnta poruṇmiyiyuṭiya |ārāytaṟ kaṇṇum |eṉṟavāṟu.

nāṟṟam |eṉpatu--pūviṉāṉum cāntiṉāṉum talivaṉ māṭṭuḷatākiya kalaviyāl talivimāṭṭuḷatāya nāṟutal.

tōṟṟam |eṉpatu--puṇarcciyāṉ varum poṟpu.

|oḻukkam |eṉpatu--|āyattāroṭu vēṇṭiyavā ṟoḻukutalaṉṟit taṉṉip pēṇiyoḻukutal.

|uṇṭi |eṉpatu--|uṇṇum |aḷaviṟ kuṟital.

ceyviṉi maṟittal |āvatu--pūkkoytalum puṉalāṭalum pōlum viṉikaḷit tōḻiyi maṟintut taṉittu nikaḻttutal, |aṉṟiyum talivaṉ ceyta puṇarcciyākiya karumattiṉip pulappaṭaviṭātu tōḻiyi maṟittalum |eṉṟumām.

celaviṉum |eṉpatu--|etticiyiṉum ceṉṟu viḷiyāṭuvāḷ |oru ticiyi nōkkiccēṟal.

payilviṉum |eṉpatu--|oriṭattup payilutal.

puṇarcci |etirppāṭu |āvatu--puṇarvataṟku muntuṟṟa kālam.

|uḷḷuṟuttal |āvatu--|uṭkōṭal.

|uṇarcci |ēḻāvatu--nāṟṟa mutalākac collappaṭṭavaṟṟāl varum maṉa nikaḻcci |ēḻum.

palvēṟu kavarporuḷ nāṭṭam |eṉpatu--|oṉṟōṭoṉṟu |ovvāta vēṟupaṭṭaṉavāki |iruporuḷ payakkum coṟkaḷālē yārāytal.

|avṟṟuḷ cila varumāṟu :-
``kaṇṇuñ cēyari parantaṉṟu nutalum
nuṇviyar poṟittu vaṇṭārk kummē
vāṅkami meṉṟōḷ maṭanti
yāṅkā yiṉaḷkol |eṉṉum|eṉ neñcē.'' (ciṟṟeṭṭakam)
|itu talivi tōṟṟaṅkaṇṭu pāṅki kūṟiyatu. piṟavum |aṉṉa.

kuṟiyuṟaṟ ketiriya kaḻivaṉi maṟiyuṟa |eṉpatu--kaḷavoḻukkattiṉ kaṇṇē yuṟutaṟkākat taṉatu kuṟiyic collavēṇṭi |etirppaṭṭa talivaṇi yeṉṟavāṟu.
maṟiyuṟa |eṉpataṉi muṉṉē kūṭṭuka.

perumiyiṟ peyarppiṉum |eṉpatu--talivaṉatu perumiyāṉ nīkkalum |eṉṟavāṟu.
``|ivaḷē, kāṉal naṇṇiya kāmar ciṟukuṭi
nīlniṟap poruṅkaṭal kalaṅka |uḷpukku
mīṉeṟi paratavar makaḷē nīyē
neṭuṅkoṭi nuṭaṅkum niyama mūtūrk
kaṭuntērc celvar kātal makaṉē
niṇaccuṟā |uṟutta |uṇakkal vēṇṭi
|iṉappuḷ |oppum |emakkunalaṉ |evaṉō
pulavu nāṟutum celaniṉ ṟīmō
perunīr viḷiyuḷ ciṟunal vāḻkki
nummoṭu purivatō |aṉṟē
|emma ṉōriṟ cemmalum |uṭittē.'' (naṟṟiṇi.45)
|eṉa varum.
|ulakurit toḻittal |eṉpatu--|ulakattār makaṭkoḷḷumāṟu koḷḷeṉak kūṟutal.
``kōṭīr |elvaḷik koḻumaṭaṟ kūntal
|āytoṭi maṭavaral vēṇṭuti yāyiṉ
teṇkaḻic cēyiṟāṟ paṭū|un
taṇkaṭaṟ cērppa varintaṉi koṇmō.'' (|aiṅkuṟu. 199)
|iṉṉum |ulakurit toḻittal |eṉṟataṉāṟ kiyuṟimaṟiyuṅ koḷka.
``nīṭunīrk kāṉal nerunalum nittilaṅkoṇ ṭiya vantīr
kōṭuyar veṇmaṇaṟ koṟkiyem |ūrivaṟṟāṟ kuṟiyi
|āṭuṅ kaḻaṅkum |aṇiviḷakkum |ammaṉiyum [lēmiyām
pāṭi yavippaṉavum pantāṭap paṭuvaṉavum paṉinīr muttam.''

|arumiyiṉ |akaṟciyum |eṉpatu--taliviyik kiṭṭitaṟku |arumi kūṟiyakaṟṟutal.
|utāraṇam:-
``nerunalum muṉṉā ḷelliyum |oruciṟip
putuvi yākaliṉ |ataṟkeyta nāṇi
nēriṟi vaḷittōḷniṉ tōḻi ceyta
|āruyir varuttaṅ kaḷiyā yōveṉa
|eṟkuṟi yuṟuti rāyiṟ coṟkuṟi
|empatat kaṭavuḷ |allaḷō peruma
vālkōṉ virippuṟan tivarum
mañcucūḻ maṇivari maṉṉavaṉ makaḷē.''
|eṉa varum.
|avaḷaṟi vuṟuttup piṉvāveṉṟalum |eṉpatu--niṉṉāṟ kātalikkappaṭṭāṭkuc ceṉṟu |aṟivittup piṉṉar |eṉmāṭṭuvā |eṉṟavāṟu.
|avaṟṟuḷ, nīyē ceṉṟu |aṟivu |eṉṟataṟkuc ceyyuḷ:-
``taṉṉiyun tāṉnāṇuñ cāyalāṭ kī turippiṉ
|eṉṉiyum nāṇappaṭuṅ kaṇṭāy--|eṉṉiya
vēyērmeṉ tōḷikkuka vēṟāy |iṉiyorunāḷ
nīyē yurittu viṭu.''
piṉvā veṉṟaṟkuc ceyyuḷ:-
``nāḷvēṅki poṉviḷiyum naṉmali naṉṉāṭa
kōḷvēṅki pōṟkoṭiyar |eṉṉiyaṉmār--kōḷvēṅ
|aṉṉiyāl nīyumaṭ |aruntaḻiyām |ēlāmikku [ki
|eṉṉiyō nāḷi |eḷitu.''
|eṉavarum. (tiṇimāli.2)

pētimi yūṭṭal |eṉpatu--nēriṉum |avaḷ |aṟivāḷorutti yallaḷ |eṉṟu talivaṟkuk kūṟal.
|utāraṇam:-
``naṟuntaṇ takaram vakuḷam |ivaṟṟi
veṟumputalpōl vēṇṭātu vēṇṭi--|eṟintuḻutu
centiṉi vittuvār taṅki piṟarnōykku
nontiṉiya vallaḷō nōkku.'' (tiṇimāli.24)
/|iṉṉum, pētimi yūṭṭal |eṉpataṉāl tōḻi tāṉ |aṟiyāḷ pōlak kūṟutaluṅ koḷka.
|utāraṇam:-
``puṉtali mantik kallā vaṉpaṟaḻ
kuṉṟuḻi naṇṇiya muṉṟil pōkātu
|eriyakintu |aṉṉa vītati |iṇara
vēṅkiyam paṭuciṉip poruntik kiya
tēmpey tīmpāl vuvaliṟ koṭicci
|eḻuteḻil citiya |aḻuta kaṇṇē
tērvaṇ cōḻar kuṭanti vāyil
māriyaṅ kiṭaṅkiṉ |īriya malarnta
peyaluṟu nīlam pōṉṟaṉa viralē
pā|aya |avvayiṟu |alittaliṉ |āṉātu
|āṭumaḻi tavaḻuṅ kōṭuyar potiyiṉ
|oṅkiruñ cilampil pūtta
kāntaḷaṅ koḻumuki pōṉṟaṉa civantē.''
|eṉa varum. (naṟṟiṇi.379)

muṉṉuṟu puṇarcci muṟiniṟut turittalum |eṉpatu--muṉṉuṟu puṇarcci muṟiyē niṟuttuk kūṟalum |eṉṟavāṟu.
 niṟuttuk kūṟalāvatu nīṅkaviṭātu |uṭaṉpaṭṭuk kūṟal. |iṉṉum muṉpukūṭiṉāṟ pōlak kūṭa |amiyumeṉṟu kūṟutal, |utāraṇam vantavaḻikkāṇka.

|añci |accuṟuttalum |eṉpatu--tāṉ |accamuṟṟu |añciṉa taṉmiyit talivaṟku |aṟivittalum |eṉṟavāṟu. |atu yāy varuva ḷeṉṟāṉum tamiyaṉmār varuva reṉṟāṉum kāvalar varuva reṉṟāṉum kūṟutal.
|utāraṇam:-
``yāṉi |uḻalum |aṇikiḷar nīḷvarik
kāṉaka vāḻkkik kuṟavar makaḷirēm
|ēṉaluḷ |aiya varavumaṟ ṟeṉṉikol
kāṇiṉum kāyvar |emar.'' (tiṇimoḻi.6)
|eṉavarum,

|urittuḻik kūṭṭamoṭu |eṉpatu--niṉṉāṟ kātalikkappaṭṭāḷ yāvaḷ |eṉa viṉāyavaḻi |ittaṉmiyāḷ |eṉac collakkēṭṭa tōḻi|avaḷum niṉ taṉmiyāḷ |eṉa |ivaṉōṭu kūṭṭiyurittalum |eṉṟavāṟu.
|oṭu |eṇṇiṉkaṇ vantatu.
|utāraṇam:-
``neṟinīr |iruṅkaḻi nīlamuñ cūṭāṉ
poṟimāṇ variyalavaṉ |āṭṭalum |āṭṭāḷ
tirunutal vērarumpuc cintiyā niṉṟāḷ
ceṟinīr/ttaṇ cērppayā ṉeṉcollic cērkēṉ.''
|eṉa varum.

|eñcātu kiḷanta |irunāṉku kiḷaviyum |eṉpatu--|oḻiyātu kūṟiya |eṭṭuk kūṟṟum |eṉṟavāṟu. muṉṉip puṇarccimuṟi yaṟintāḷātaliṉ |avaṉ |irantu piṉṉiṉṟuḻi |īṇṭuk kūṟiya |ellām |avaṉ |uḷḷakkarut taṟiyuntuṇiyum taḻī|ikakoṇṭu kūṟiṉallatu |oḻittal poruḷākak kūṟāḷ |eṉpatu koḷḷappaṭum. |ivi |eṭṭum kuṟiyuṟavuṇartaliṉ pakuti.

vanta kiḻavaṉi māyañ ceppip poṟutta kāraṇaṅ kuṟitta kāliyum |eṉpatu--māyam collivanta kiḻavaṉit talivi poṟuttakāraṇam kuṟittakāliyum tōḻi kūṟṟu nikaḻum |eṉṟavāṟu.
|avvaḻit talivaṉ kuṟippumu/ talivikuṟippum |uṇartalum talivaṉ kēṭṭataṟku māṟṟam kūṟutalum |uḷavām. māyam ceppivanta kiḻavaṉ |eṉa māṟṟuka. māyam cepputalāvatu yāṉi pōntatō māṉ pōntatō |eṉakkūṟal.
``|irantu kuṟiyaṟātu kiḻaviyun tōḻiyum
|oruṅkutalip peyta cevvi nōkkip
patiyum peyarum piṟavum viṉā|ayp
putuvōṉ pōlap poruntupu kiḷantu
matiyuṭam paṭuttaṟkum |uriyaṉ |eṉpa.'' (|iṟiyaṉārakap.6)
|ēṉpataṉāṟ kuṟiyuṟavuṇartal nikaḻntuḻi |itu nikaḻāteṉṟu koḷka.
|ataṉkaṭ kuṟippuṇarvataṟkuc ceyyuḷ:-
``vēṅki malara veṟikamaḻ taṇcilampiṉ
vāṅkami meṉtāḷ kuṟavar makaḷirēm
cōrntu kuruti |oḻukamaṟ ṟippuṟam
pōntatil |aiya kaḷiṟu.'' (tiṇimoḻi.1)
|eṉavum,
``neṭuntēr kaṭi|it tamiyarāy niṉṟu
kaṭuṅkaḷiṟu kāṇīrō |eṉṟīr koṭuṅkuḻiyār
yāṉi |ataruḷḷi niṟparō tampuṉattuḷ
|ēṉaṟ kiḷikaṭiku vār.''
|eṉavum,
``|ēṉal kāval |ivaḷum |allaḷ
māṉvaḻi varukuvaṉ |ivaṉum |allaṉ
narantaṅ kaṇṇi |ivaṉō ṭivaḷiṭik
karanta |uḷḷamoṭu karutiyatu piṟitē
nammuṉ nāṇiṉar pōlat tammuḷ
matumaṟin tuṇṭōr makiḻcci pōla
|uḷḷat tuḷḷē makiḻpa
collum |āṭupa kaṇṇi ṉāṉē.''
|eṉavum,
puṇarntapiṉ |avaṉvayiṉ vaṇaṅkaṟ kaṇṇum |eṉpatu--mēṟ collappaṭṭa mūvakiyāṉum puṇarcciyuṇmi poruntiyapiṉ talivaṉakaṇ tāḻaniṟṟaṟ kaṇṇum |eṉṟavāṟu.
|atu nī karutiyatu muṭikkaṟpāli |eṉavum nī |ivaḷip pātukāttal vēṇṭumeṉavum |ivvaki kūṟutal.
|utāraṇam:-
``.....................
|araviṉ poṟiyum |aṇaṅkum puṇarnta
|uravuvil mēlacitta kiyi |orāṅku
nirivaḷi muṉkiyeṉ tōḻiyi nōkkip
paṭukiḷi pāyum pacuṅkural |ēṉal
kaṭital maṟappittā yāyiṉ |iṉinī
neṭituḷḷal |omputal vēṇṭum |avaḷē
........................
kaṭumā kaṭavuṟū|uṅ kōlpōl |eṉittum
koṭumiyili yāvatu |aṟintu maṭuppal
vaḻivaḷar cāral varuṭi naṉmāṉ
kuḻavi vaḷarppavar pōlap pārāṭṭi
|uḻiyiṟ piriyiṟ piriyum
|iḻiyaṇi |alkul|eṉ tōḻiyatu kaviṉē.'' (kalit.50)
|eṉavarum.
kuṟintu |avaṭpaṭariṉum |eṉpatu--mēl talivaṉ puṇarcciyuṇmiyaṟintu tāḻaniṉṟa tōḻi tāṉuṅkuṟiyuṟṟut talivimāṭṭuc cellutaṟkaṇṇuṅ kūṟṟu nikaḻum |eṉṟavāṟu.
|ik kiḷavi |irantu piṉṉiṉṟa talivaṉ |uḷḷappuṇarcci yuḷvaḻiyumkuṟiyuṟṟu meyyuṟupuṇarcci vēṇṭit talivimāṭṭuc celluṅkālattum|okkum.
|utāraṇam:-
``vaḷi |aṇi muṉki vāl|eyiṟ ṟiṉṉaki
|iḷiyar |āṭun taḻiyaviḻ kāṉaṟ
kuṟuntuṟi viṉavi niṉṟa
neṭuntēr |aṇṇalik kaṇṭikum yāmē.'' (|aiṅkuṟu.198)
|eṉavarum.

maṟintu |avaḷ |arukat taṉṉoṭum |avaḷoṭum muṉṉam muṉtaḷi|ippiṉṉili nikaḻum palvēṟu maruṅkiṉum |eṉpatu--mēl talivaṉmāṭṭuttōḻi kuṟinayappikkac ceṉṟavaḻit tōḻi collum kuṟippumoḻikku |avaḷmaṟintu |ariyaḷākat taṉṉoṭum |avaḷoṭum kuṟippiḷi muṉṉarttaṭuttukkoṇṭu vaḻipaṭṭu muyalum pala vēṟupakkattiṉ kaṇṇumtōḻikūṟṟu nikaḻum |eṉṟavāṟu.
maṟittalāvatu--taṉ maṉattu nikaḻcciyi |oḷittal.|arukutalāvatu--|icivilātārippōla niṟṟal. muṉṉamuṉtaḷitalāvatu--kūṟṟiṉāṉṉṟik kuṟippiṉāṉuṇartal. mutalmūṉ ṟaḷi|i|eṉṟu pāṭamāyiṉ, maṉattiṉāṉum moḻiyiṉāṉum |uṭampiṉāṉum |oruṅkē|aḷavi |eṉṟumām. piṉṉili nikaḻum palvēṟu maruṅkāvatu--vaḻipāṭukoṭuvaruṅ kūṟṟuvēṟupāṭu. |eṉavē talivikkut taḻiyum kaṇṇiyamkoṇṭu |oruvaṉ nam puṉattayal vārāniṉṟāṉ |eṉavum, |avaṉ |eṉmāṭṭu|orukuṟiyuṭiyaṉpōlum |eṉavum, |aruḷuvārkku |iḵtu |aṭameṉavum,|avaṉ kuṟimaṟuppiṉ maṭalēṟuval |eṉak kūṟip pōntāṉ piṉpuvarakkaṇṭilēṉ |eṉavum, |in nikakaraṉa kūṟutal. |avi varumāṟu:-
``puṉipūn taḻi|alkul poṉ|aṉṉāy cāral
tiṉikāt tiruntēmyā māka--viṉivāyttu
māviṉavu vārpōla vantavar nammāṭṭut
tāmviṉaval |uṟṟatoṉ ṟuṇṭu.'' (|aintiṇiyim. 14)
|eṉavum,
``neyyoṭu mayakkiya |uḻuttu nūṟ ṟaṉṉa
vayaliyañ cilampiṉ taliyatu
ceyaliyam pakittaḻi vāṭum |aṉṉāy.'' (|aiṅkuṟu.211)
|eṉavum,
``|ilicūḻceṅ kāntaṉ |erivāy mukiyaviḻtta |īrntaṇ vāṭi
kolivēl neṭuṅkaṭ koṭicci katuppuḷaruṅ kuṉṟa nāṭaṉ
|ulipaṭu vennōy |uḻakkumāl |antō
muliyiṭi nērpavar nērum |iṭaṉitu moykuḻalē.''
|eṉavum,
``puṇartuṇiyō ṭāṭum poṟiyalavaṉ nōkki
|iṇartatiyum pūṅkāṉal |eṉṉiyum nōkki
|uṇarvoḻiyap pōṉa |olitirinīrc cērppaṉ
vaṇarcuriyim pālāy vaṇṇam |uṇarēṉāl.'' (cilap.kāṉal.31)
|eṉavum,
``taṉkuṟiyī teṉṉāṉ taḻikoṇarun taṇcilampaṉ
niṉkuṟi yeṉṉum niṉippiṉaṉāyp poṉkuṟiyum
nāḷvēṅki nīḻalum naṇṇāṉ |evaṉkolō
kōḷvēṅki |aṉṉāṉ kuṟippu.'' (tiṇimāli.31)
|eṉavum,
``|orunāḷ vāralaṉ |irunāḷ vāralaṉ
paṉṉāḷ vantu paṇimoḻi payiṟṟi
naṉṉar neñcam nekiḻnta piṉṟi
varimutir tēṉiṟ pōki yōṉē
|ācāku |enti yāṇṭuḷaṉ kollō
vēṟupula ṉal nāṭṭup peyta
|ēṟuṭi maḻiyiṟ kaliḻumeṉ neñcē.'' (kuṟuntoki.176)
|eṉavum,
māyōṉ |aṉṉa mālvarik kavā|aṉ
vāliyōṉ |aṉṉa vayaṅkuveḷ |aruvi
|ammalik kiḻavaṉ namnān teṉṟum
varuntiṉaṉ |eṉpatōr vāyccol tēṟāy
nīyuṅ kaṇṭu numaroṭum |eṇṇi
|aṟivaṟin taḷaval vēṇṭu maṟutaraṟku
|ariya vāḻi tōḻi periyōr
nāṭi naṭpiṉ |allatu
naṭṭu nāṭārtam |oṭṭiyōr tiṟattē'' (naṟṟiṇi.31)
|eṉavum varum.

naṉṉayam peṟṟuḻi nayampuri yiṭattiṉum |eṉpatu--tali#āvikuṟinayantami peṟṟavaḻi |at talivi nayamporuntum |iṭattiṉuṅkūṟṟu nikaḻum |eṉṟavāṟu.
talimakaḷ kuṟinayantami talimakaṭkuk kūṟiya ceyyuḷ:-
`neytaṟ parappiṟ pāvi kiṭappi
niṉkuṟi vantaṉeṉ koṇmō vikalum
|āral |arunta vayiṟṟa
nāri mitikkum |eṉmakaḷ nutalē.'' (kuṟun.114)
|eṉavum,
``kaṭumpulāl puṉṉi kaṭiyun tuṟiva
paṭumpulāl puḷkaṭivāṉ pukka--taṭampul|ām
tāḻimā ñāḻal tatintuyarnta tāḻpoḻil
|ēḻimāṉ nōkki |iṭam.'' (tiṇimāli, 44)
|eṉavum varum.
|iṉṉum nayampuri yiṭattum |eṉṟataṉāl kaḷavoḻukkam nikaḻā niṉṟuḻik kūṟuṅ kūṟṟum >ṇṭē koḷka. |atu talivaṉ varumeṉavum vantā ṉeṉavuṅ kūṟutalum talimakaṉ pakaṟkuṟikkaṇ nīṅkiyavaḻik kūṟutalum |eṉap palavām.
``kavarpari neṭuntēr maṇiyum |icikkum
peyarpaṭa viyaṅkiya |iḷiyavarum |olippar
kaṭalāṭu viyaliṭip polinta naṟuntaḻit
titali yalkul nalampā rāṭṭiya
varumē tōḻi vārmaṇaṟ cērppaṉ
|iṟpaṭa vāṅkiya muḻavumutaṟ puṉṉi
māvari maṟikam vammati pāṉāḷ
pūviri kāṉal puṇarkuṟi vantunam
melliṇar naṟumpoḻiṟ kāṇātavaṉ
|allal |arumpaṭar kāṇkanām ciṟitē.'' (naṟṟiṇi.307)
|itu varukiṉṟāṉ |eṉak kūṟiyatu.
``nilavu maṟintaṉṟu |iruḷum paṭṭaṉṟu
|ovat taṉṉa |iṭaṉuṭi varippil
pāvi |aṉṉa nappuṟam kākkuñ
ciṟanta celvattu |aṉṉiyun tuñciṉaḷ
keṭuttuppaṭu naṉkalam |eṭuttukkoṇ ṭāṅku
naṉmārpu |aṭiya muyaṅki meṉmelak
kaṇṭaṉam varukañ celmō tōḻi
kīḻu mēluṅ kāppōr nītta
vaṟuntalip peruṅkaḷiṟu pōlat
tamiyaṉ vantōṉ paṉiyali niliyē.'' (naṟṟiṇi.182)
|itu vantāṉ |eṉak kūṟiyatu.
``neytal kūmpa niḻalkuṇak koḻukak
kalcēr maṇṭilañ civantu ciṉantaṇiyap
palpūṅ kāṉalum |alkiṉ ṟaṉṟē
|iṉamaṇi |olippap potupaṭap pūṭṭi
tēruñ celpuṟam maṟiyum |ūrōṭu
yāṅkā vatukol tāṉē tēmpaṭa
miṉṉivar perumpūṇ koṇkaṉoṭu
|iṉṉaki mēvinām |āṭiya poḻilē.'' (naṟṟiṇi.187)
|itu pakaṟkuṟikkaṇ...talivaṉ nīṅkiyavaḻik kūṟiyatu.
|itu pakaṟkuṟikkaṇ...talivaṇ nīṅkiyavaḻik kūṟiyatu.

|eṇṇarum paṉṉaki kaṇṇiya vakiyiṉum |eṉpatu--|eṇṇutaṟku |ariyapalanakiyāṭṭukkaḷit talivaṉiṭam kuṟitta vakiyuṅkūṟṟu nikaḻum|eṉṟavāṟu.
|aḵtu |alarākumeṉṟu kūṟutal. |ivvoḻukkam puṟattārkkup pulaṉāyiṉāl|avar tūṟṟi nakipparākaliṉ nakiyāyiṟṟu.
|utāraṇam:-
``niṟi |ariyar maṉ |aḷiyar |eṉṉātu kāmam
maṟi|iṟantu maṉṟu paṭum.'' (kuṟaḷ. 1138)

``|aṉṉiyum |aṟintaṉaḷ |alaru māyiṉṟu
naṉ maṉi neṭunakar pulampukoḷa |uyirkkum
|iṉṉā vāṭiyum maliyum
nummūrc celkam |eḻukamō teyyō.'' (|aiṅkuṟu. 238)
|eṉavum varum.

puṇarcci vēṇṭiṉum |eṉpatu--mēṟcollappaṭṭa pallāṟṟāṉumtalivaṟkaṟivuṟuttavaḻip piṉṉum puṇarcci vēṇṭiṉum |āṇṭut tōḻikūṟṟu nikaḻum |eṉṟavāṟu.
``neyyāl |eri nutuppēm |eṉṟaṟṟāṟ kuviyāṟ
kāmam nutuppēm |eṉal.'' (kuṟaḷ.1148)
``|ivaḷē, niṉcoṟ koṇṭa |eṉcol tēṟip
pacunaṉi ñāḻaṟ palkiḷi |oruciṟip
putunala ṉiḻanta pulampumār |uṭiyaḷ
|utukkāṇ teyya |uḷḷal vēṇṭum
nilavum |iruḷum pōlap pulavuttirik
kaṭaluṅ kāṉalun tōṉṟum
maṭaltāḻ peṇṇiyañ ciṟunal lūrē.'' (kuṟun.81)
|itu piṉṉum puṇarcci vēṇṭiya talivaṟku |iṭamuṇarttiyatu. |iravuvaruvāṉip pakal vāleṉṟalum pakal varuvāṉi |iravu vāveṉṟaluṅkuṟipeyarttalum |ellām |īṇṭē koḷka.
``|ūrkkum |aṇittē poyki poykikkuc
cēyttum veṇkuruku |allatu yāvatum
tuṉṉal pōkiṉṟāṟ koṇarkañ cēṟum
kūḻik kerumaṇ poṇarkañ cēṟum
|āṇṭum varukuvaḷ perumpē tiyē.'' (kuṟun.113)
|itu pakaṟkuṟi nērntatu. |āṇṭut talivikkuk kūṟumāṟu:-
``|oliveḷ ḷaruvi |oṅkumali nāṭaṉ
ciṟukaperuṅkaḷiṟu vayappuli tākkit
tolmuraṇ cōrun tuṉṉuruñ cōli
naṭunāḷ varutalum varū|um
vaṭunā ṇalamē tōḻi nāmē.'' (kuṟun.88)
|eṉavarum.

vēṇṭāp piriviṉum |eṉpatu--puṇarcci vēṇṭātu pirivu vēṇṭiṉum |eṉṟavāṟu.
|itu talivaṉ neñciṉāṟ piriyāṉeṉpataṉāṉ vēṇṭāp piriveṉṟār. |atu tāḷā...veṉpatu |alarākumeṉṟu |añci |oruvaḻit taṇattalum. |oṉṟu. |avvaḻit talivikku |urittaṉavum talivaṟ kurittaṉavum |uḷavām. |avi varumāṟu:-
``|iṟavuppuṟat taṉṉa piṇarpaṭu taṭavumutaṟ
cuṟavukkōṭ ṭaṉṉa muḷḷilit tāḻi
peruṅkaḷiṟṟu maruppiṉ |aṉṉa |arumpumutirpu
naṉmāṉ |uḻiyiṉ vēṟupaṭat tōṉṟi
viḻavukkaḷaṅ kamaḻum |uravunīrc cērppa
|iṉamaṇi neṭuntēr pākaṉ |iyakkac
celī|iya cēṟi yāyiṉ |ivaḷē
varuvi yākiya ciṉṉāḷ
vāḻā ḷātalnaṟ kaṟintaṉi ceṉmē (naṟṟiṇi.19)
|itu, talivaṉ pirivu vēṇṭiyavaḻik kūṟiyatu.
``cāraṟ palaviṉ koḻuntuṇar naṟumpaḻam
|iruṅkal viṭaraḷi vīḻnteṉa veṟpiṟ
peruntēṉ |iṟāloṭu citaṟu nāṭaṉ
pēramar maḻikkaṇ kaliḻattaṉ
cīruṭi naṉṉāṭṭuc cellum |aṉṉāy.'' (|aiṅkuṟu. 214)
|itu talivikku |urittatu.
``kāṉalalam peruntuṟik kalitiri tiḷikkum
vāṉuyar |eṟimaṇal |ēṟi |āṉātu
kāṇkam vammō tōḻi
ceṟivaḷi nekiḻttōṉ |eṟikaṭal nāṭē. (|aiṅkuṟu. 199)
|itu taliviyi |āṟṟuvittatu.
``|iruḷ tiṇin taṉṉa |īrntaṇ poḻuniḻal
nilavuk kuvittaṉṉa veṇmaṇa loruciṟik
karuṅkōṭṭup puṉṉip pūmpoḻil pulampa
|iṉṉum vārār varū|um
palmīṇ vēṭṭat teṉṉiyar timilē.'' (kuṟun 123)
|eṉavum varum.

vēḷāṇ peruneṟi vēṇṭiya viṭattiṉum |eṉpatu--vēḷā#āṇyi#āvatu |upakāram. peparuneṟiyāvatu |upakāramākiya peruneṟi |eṉka. |ataṉit tōḻi talivaṉi vēṇṭikkōṭṟkaṇṇum |eṉṟuvātu.
``neṭuvēḷ mārpiṉ |āram pōlac
cevvāy vāṉan tīṇṭimī
ṉ |aruntum
piṅkāṟn taṉṟē paltiri ñāyiṟu.
|elli pippayak kaḻippik kuṭaviṉ
kalcērn taṉṟē palkatir ñāyiṟu
matareḻil maḻikkaṇ kaliḻa |ivaḷē
perunāṇ |aṇinta ciṟumeṉ cāyal
māṇalañ citiya |ēṅki |āṉātu
|aḻal toṭaṅ kiṉaḷē peruma |ataṉāṟ
kaḻiccuṟā veṟinta puṭṭāḷ |attiri
neṭunīr |iruṅkaḻip perimelin taci|i
vallil |iḷiyarā ṭellic collātu
cērntaṉi celiṉē citikuva tuṇṭō
peṇṇi |oṅkiya veṇmaṇal paṭappi
|aṉṟil |akavum |āṅkaṇ
ciṟukural neytalem peruṅkaḻi nāṭṭē.'' (|akam.120)
|eṉpatum,
``nilāviṉ |ilaṅkum'' |eṉṉum |akappāṭṭiṉuḷ,
``cērntaṉir celkuvi rāyiṉ yāmum
|emvari |aḷaviyiṟ peṭkuvam
nummop patuvō |uritticiṉ |emakkē.'' (|akam 200)
|eṉapatum koḷka.
|itaṉāṟ payaṉ |illaṟam naṭattalvēṇṭum |eṉpatu.

puṇarntuḻi yuṇarnta |aṟimaṭac ciṟappiṉum |eṉpata--talivaṉoṭu talivi yuṇarntavaḻi |āṇṭup |aṟimaṭac ciṟappiṉum |eṉpatu--talivaṉoṭu talivi puṇarntavaḻi |āṇṭup poruntiya |aṟivumaṭampaṭṭa ciṟappiṉ kaṇṇum |eṉṟavāṟu.
|aḵtāvatu |allakuṟippaṭutal. |avvaḻiyum tōḻi kūṟṟu nikaḻum.
``koṭumuḷ maṭaltāḻik kūṭamviḻanta |oṇpū
|iṭiyuḷ |iḻutoppat tōṉṟayap |eṉṟa--paṭiyelār
teyvam kamaḻuk teḷikaṭal taṇcērppaṉ
ceytāṉ teḷiyāk kuṟi.'' (|aintiṇiyim.49)
``|iṭumaṇal |ēkkar |akaṉkāṉal cērppaṉ
kaṭumāṉ maṇiyaravam |eṉṟu--koṭuṅkuḻi
puḷḷaravaṅ kēṭṭup peyarntāḷ ciṟuṟukuṭiyar
|uḷḷaravam nāṇuvar |eṉṟu. (|aintiṇiyeḻu.57)
``|amma vāḻiyō |aṉṉinam paṭappi
miṉṉēr nuṭankiṭic ciṉṉiḻa lākiya
puṉṉi meṉkāy poruciṉi |ariya
vāṭuvaḷi tūkkiya |aciviṟ kollō
teṇṇīr yurimō |uṇarkkuval yāṉē.''
|eṉa varum.
|ompaṭik kiḷavip pāṅkiṉ kaṇṇum |eṉpatu--|ompaṭuttutaṟporuṭpakutikkaṇṇuṅ kūṟṟu nikaḻum |eṉṟavāṟu.
|aḵtāvatu |oruvaḻit taṇakkumvaḻi |ompaṭi kūṟutal.
``perunaṉ ṟoṉṟiṟ pēṇārum |uḷarē
|orunaṉ ṟuṭiyā ḷāyiṉum purimāṇṭu
pulavitīra vaḷimati yilikavar
pāmaruta yoḻukiya taṇṇaṟuñ cāral
meṉṉaṭi ma|airayā tuñcum
naṉmali nāṭa niṉṉala tilaḷē.''
|eṉavum, (kuṟun.115)
``|eṟintemar tāmuḻuta |īrṅkural |ēṉal
maṟantuṅ kiḷiyaṉamum vārā--kaṟaṅkaruvi
māmali nāṭa maṭamoḻi taṉkēṇmi
nīmaṟaval neñacattuc koṇṭu'' (|aintiṇiyim. 18)
|eṉavum varum.
|itaṉuḷ kiḷikaṭiya yām vārēm nīmaṟavā toḻitalvēṇṭu meṉṟavāṟu.

ceṅkaṭu moḻiyāṟ kitivuṭittāyiṉu meṉpu tekap pirintōḷ vaḻicceṉṟu kaṭi|i |aṉputali paṭutta vaṉpuṟikkaṇṇum |eṉpatu--cevviya kaṭiya colliṉāṉē talivaṉ |aṉpu citivuṭit tāyiṉum |eṉpurukumāṟu piriyappaṭṭavaḷiṭattuc ceṉṟu talivaṉ |aṉpumiyiṉ |aḷippaṉ |eṉa |āṟṟuvitta vaṟpuṟuttaṟkaṇṇun tōḻikūṟṟu nikaḻum |eṉṟavāṟu.

neṅkaṭumoḻi |eṉṟatu--koṭiya kaṭumoḻiyēyaṉṟi maṉattiṉāṉ |iṉiyaḷākik kūṟuṅ kaṭumoḻi. |aḵtāvatu |iyaṟpaḻittal. |avvāṟu |iyaṟpaḻittavaḻit talivaṉ |aṉpu citivuṭittāyiṉum |eṉṟavāṟu. |aṉputaliyaṭutta vaṉpuṟiyāvatu talivaṉ |iṉṟiyamiyāṉ |eṉa |āṟṟuvittal.

|iyaṟpaḻittaṟkuc ceyyuḷ:
``mācaṟaka, kaḻī|iya yāṉi pōlap
perumpeyal |uḻanta |irumpiṇart tuṟukal
pital |orutali cēkku nāṭaṉnīṭu
nōytan taṉaṉē tōḻi
pacali |ārntaṉa kuvaḷiyaṅ kaṇṇē.'' (kuṟun.13)
vaṉpuṟikkuc ceyyuḷ:-
``makiḻnaṉ mārpē veyyi |eṉanī
|aḻiyal vāḻi tōḻi naṉṉaṉ
naṟumā koṉṟu nāṭṭiṟ pōkiya
|oṉṟumoḻik kōcar pōla
vaṉkaṭ cūḻcciyum vēṇṭumāṟ ciṟitē.'' (kuṟun.73)
``meyyil tīrā mēvaru kāmamoṭu
|eyyāy |āyiṉum |urippal tōḻi
koyyā muṉṉuṅ kuralvārpu tiṉiyē
|aruvi |āṉṟa piṅkāl tōṟum
|iruvi tōṉṟiṉa palavē nīyē
murukumuraṇ koḷḷun tēmpāy kaṇṇip
pariyal nāyoṭu paṉmalip paṭarum
vēṭṭuvaṟ peṟalō ṭamintaṉi yāḻaniṉ
pūkkeḻu toṭali nuṭaṅka veḻunteḻuntu
kiḷḷit teḷviḷi yiṭiyiṭi payiṟṟi
|āṅkāṅ koḻukā yāyiṉ |aṉṉi
ciṟukiḷi kaṭital tēṟṟāḷ |ivaḷeṉap
piṟar/ttantu niṟukkuva ḷāyiṉ
|uṟaṟkari tākumavaṉ malarnta mārpē.'' (|akam.28)
|āṟṟuvittaṟkuc ceyyuḷ:-
``kuṟuṅki |irumpuli kōḷval |ēṟṟi
neṭumputaṟ kāṉattu maṭappiṭi |īṉṟa
naṭuṅkunaṭik kuḻavi koḷī |iya palaviṉ
paḻantūṅku koḻuniḻal |oḷikku nāṭaṟkuk
koytiṭu taḷiriṉ vāṭiniṉ
meypiṟi tākal |evaṉkol |aṉṉāy.'' (|ainkuṟu.216)
``|aḻiyal |āyiḻi |aṉpuperi tuṭiyaṉ
paḻiyumu/ |añcum payamali nāṭaṉ
nillā miyē niliyiṟ ṟākaliṉ
nallici vēṭṭa nayaṉuṭi neñciṟ
kaṭappāṭ ṭāḷaṉ |uṭipporuḷ pōlat
taṅkutaṟ kuriya taṉṟuniṉ
|aṅkuluḻ mēṉip pā |aya pacappē.'' (kuṟuntoki.143)
|eṉavum,
``peruṅki |iruṅkaḷiṟu |aivaṉam māntik
karuṅkāl marāmpoḻiṟ pācaṭit tuñcuñ
curumpimir cōli malināṭaṉ kēṇmi
poruntiṉārk kēmāp puṭittu.'' (|aintiṇiyeḻu.12)
|eṉavum varum.

|āṟṟatu tīmi |aṟivuṟu kalakkamum...varital vēṇṭiyum |eṉpatu--talivaṉ varuneṟiyiṉatu tīmiyit tāṅkaḷ |aṟivuṟṟataṉāl |eytiya kalakkattāṉum kāvaṟ kaṭumi variyiṟantataṉāṉum kuṟiyiṭamum kālamumākat tāṅkaḷ varinta nilimiyi vilakkit talivi kātalmikutal |uṭpaṭap piṟavun talivaṉatu nāṭum |ūrum |illum kuṭiyum piṟappum ciṟappum mikutiyum nōkkit talivaṉmāṭṭuk kiḷakkuṅ kiḷaviyōṭē kūṭa |attaṉmittākiya nilavakiyiṉāṉē varital vēṇṭiyum tōḻi kūṟum |eṉṟavāṟu.
|avaṟṟuḷ, |āṟiṉṉāmi kūṟiyataṟkuc ceyyuḷ:-
``cāraṟ puṉatta peruṅkuraṟ ciṟutiṉip
pēramar maḻikkaṇ koṭicci kaṭiyavuñ
cōlic ciṟukiḷi |uṇṇum nāṭa
|āriruḷ perukiṉa vāral
kōṭṭumā vaḻaṅkuṅ kāṭṭaka neṟiyē.'' (|aiṅkuṟu.282)
kāppu variyiṟantataṟkuc ceyyuḷ:-
``pallōr tuñcu naḷ|eṉ yāmattu
|uravukkaḷiṟu pōlvan tiravukkatava muyaṟal
kēḷēm |allēṅ kēṭṭaṉam peruma
|ori muruṅkap pīli cāya
naṉmayil valippaṭ ṭāṅkuyām
muyaṅkutoṟu muyaṅkum |aṟaṉil yāyē.'' (kuṟun.244)
|eṉavum,
``karuṅkaṇ tākkali perumpiṟi tuṟṟeṉak
kimmi |uyyāk kāmar manti
kallā vaṉpaṟaḻ kiḷimutaṟ cērtti
|oṅkuvari yaṭukkattup pāyntuyir cekukkuñ
cāral nāṭa naṭunāḷ
vāral vāḻiyō varuntutum yāmē.'' (kuṟun.69)
|eṉavum varum.
kātaṉ mikuti kūṟiyataṟkuc ceyyuḷ:-
``vēral vēli vērkkōṭ palaviṉ
cāral nāṭa cevviyi |ākumati
yāraḵ taṟintici ṉōrē cāraṟ
ciṟukōṭṭup perumpaḻan tūṅki yāṅkivaḷ
|uyirtavac ciṟitu kāmamō peritē.'' (kuṟun. 18)
piṟavum |eṉṟataṉāṉ talivaṉip paḻittaluṅ koḷka.
``neṭuvari miciyatu kuṟuṅkāl varuṭi
tiṉipāy kiḷḷi veruvum nāṭa
vallimaṉ ṟamma poyttal
vallāy maṉṟanī |allatu ceyalē.'' (|aiṅkuṟu.287)
|itu, talivaṉip paḻittatu.
``kuṉṟak kuṟavaṉ kātal maṭamakaḷ
meṉtōṭ koṭicciyip peṟaṟkaritu tilla
pimpuṟap paṭukiḷi yōppavavar
puṉpula mayakkattu viḷintaṉa tiṉiyē.'' (|aiṅkuṟu-260)
|itu, puṉakkāvaliṉi |iṉṟeṉṟatu.
``koṭicci yiṉkural kiḷicet taṭukkattup
piṅkural |ēṉaṟ paṭartaruṅ kiḷiyeṉak
kāvaluṅ kaṭiyunar pōlvar
māmali nāṭa varintaṉi koḷmē.'' (|aiṅkuṟu.289)
|itu, kuṟavariyalpu |uṇartti varika veṉṟatu.
``veṟikamaḻ veṟpaṉ|eṉ meynnīrmi koṇṭa(tu)
|aṟiyāḷmaṟ ṟaṉṉō |aṇaṅkaṇaṅkiṟ ṟeṉtu
maṟiyīrt tutirantūy vēlaṟ ṟarī|i
veṟiyō ṭalamvarum yāy.'' (|aintiṇiyim.20)
|itu, veṟi yaccuṟuttiyatu.
``|iṉamī ṉiruṅkaḻi |otam |ulāva
maṇinīr parikkun tuṟiva takumō
kuṇanīrmi kuṉṟāk koṭiyaṉṉāḷ pakkam
niṉinīrmi |illā |oḻivu.'' (tiṇimoḻi.44)
|iḵtaruḷal vēṇṭu meṉṟatu.
|iṉṉum piṟavum |eṉṟataṉāl talimakaḷ taṉṉi yaḻintami kūṟutalun talivaṉmāṭṭu varumiṭiyūṟu |añcutaluṅ koḷka. |atu varumāṟu:-
``....................
taṉ |evvaṅ kūriṉum nīceyta |aruḷiṉmi
|eṉṉiyu maṟittāḷ |eṉtōḻi |atukēṭṭu
niṉṉiyāṉ piṟarmuṉṉarp paḻikūṟal tāṉnāṇi.'' (kalit.44)
|itu, talimakaḷ taṉṉi |aḻintataṟkaṇ vantatu.
``kariporu kāṉyāṟṟaṅ kallata remmuḷḷi varuti rāyiṉ
|ariyiruḷ yāmat taṭupuliyō nummañci yakaṉṟu pōka
nariyurumē ṟuṅkivēl |añcuka nummi
variyara maṅkiyar vavvuta lañcutum vāra liyō.''
|iḵtu |avaṉūṟu |añcutaṟkaṇ vantatu.
nāṭumutalāyiṉa cuṭṭit talivaṉmāṭṭut tōṉṟuṅ kiḷavi yāvaṉa--nī |ittaṉmiyākiya nāṭṭiyuṭiyi; |ittaṉmiyākiya nakariyuṭiyi; |ittaṉmittāyākiya |illiyuṭiyi; |ittaṉmittākiya kuṭippiṟappi yuṭiyi; |iṉtaṉmittākiya ciṟappuṭiyi; |eṉa |avaṟṟiṉ mikutipaṭak kūṟutal. |avi varumāṟu:
``kōḻili vāḻi'' |eṉṉum neṭuntokip pāṭṭiṉuḷ,
``kuṟiyā viṉpam |eḷitiṉ niṉmalip
palvēṟu vilaṅkum |eytu nāṭa
kuṟitta |iṉpam niṉakkevaṉ |ariya.''
|eṉa nāṭu cuṭṭivantatu.
``kāmaṅ kaṭappa |uḷḷam |iṉippa
yāmvantu kāṇpatō paruva māyiṉ
|oṅkit tōṉṟum |uyarvarikku
yāṅkeṉap pāṭuvatu nummūr teyyō.'' (|aiṅkuṟu.237)
|iḵtu |ūrpaṟṟi vantatu.
``tuṇipuṇarn teḻutarum'' |eṉṉum kalittokip pāṭṭiṉuḷ,
``kaṭimalarp puṉṉikkīḻk kāriki tōṟṟāḷit
toṭinekiḻnta tōḷaḷāt tuṟappāyāl maṟṟuniṉ
kuṭimikkaṭ periyatōr kuṟṟamākak kiṭavātō.''
|itu, kuṭimipaṟṟi vantatu.
``|āymalarp puṉṉikkīḻ |aṇinalan tōṟṟāḷi
nōymali niliyaḷāt tuṟappāyāl maṟṟuniṉ
vāymikkaṇ periyatōr vañcamāyk kiṭavātō.''

``tikaḻmalarp puṉṉikkīḻt tirunalan tōṟṟāḷi
tukaḻmalark kaṇṇaḷāt tuṟappāyāl maṟṟuniṉ
pukaḻmikkaṭ periyatōr pukarākik kiṭavātō.'' (kalit.135)

``.......................
tāmarik kaṇṇiyit taṇṇaṟuñ cāntiṉi
nēritaḻk kōtiyāḷ ceykuṟi nīvariṉ
maṇaṅkamaḻ nāṟṟatta maliniṉṟu palipeṟū|um
|aṇaṅkeṉa |añcuvar ciṟukuṭi yōrē.'' (kalit.52)
piṟavu maṉṉa.

|aiyac ceyki tāyk ketirmaṟuttup poyyeṉa māṟṟi meyvaḻik koṭuppiṉum |eṉpatu--talivikkup piṟarōṭu kūṭṭamuṇ ṭeṉac colli |aiyuṟṟavaḻi |ataṉi maṟuttut talivi ceyta ceykiyip poyyeṉa nīkkip piṟitōr |āṟṟāṉ meyvaḻikkaṭpaṭuttiṉum |eṉṟavāṟu.
|aḵtāmāṟu talivi kuṟivaḻic celkiṉṟataṉik kāṇṭal.
``|urum|uraṟu karuviya perumaḻi tali|ip
peyalāṉ ṟavinta tūṅkiruḷ naṭunāḷ
miṉṉunimirn taṉṉa kaṉaṅkuḻi |imippap
piṉṉuviṭu neṟiyiṟ kiḷi|iya kūntalaḷ
variyiḻi mayiliṉ |olkuvaṉaḷ |otuṅki
miṭiyūr piḻiyak kaṇṭaṉeṉ |ivaḷeṉa
|aliyal vāḻivēṇ ṭaṉṉinam paṭappic
cūruṭic cilampiṟ cuṭarppū vēyntu
tāmvēṇ ṭuruviṉ |aṇaṅkumār varumē
naṉaviṉ vāyē pōlat tuñcunark
kaṉavāṇṭu maruṭṭalum |uṇṭē |ivaḷtāṉ
cuṭariṉṟu tamiyaḷum paṉiṉkum veruvara
maṉṟa marātta kūki kuḻaṟiṉum
neñcaḻin taraṇañ cēru mataṉṟalip
pulikkaṇt taṉṉa nāytoṭar viṭṭu
murukaṉ |aṉṉa cīṟṟattuk kaṭuntiṟal
|entiyum |illa ṉāka
|añcuvaḷ |allaḷō |ivaḷatu ceyalē.'' (|akam.158)
|eṉa varum.
``vēṅki naṟumalar veṟpiṭi yāmkoytu
māntaḷir mēṉi viyarppaṟ--ṟāṅkeṉittum
pāyntaruvi |āṭiṉēm |ākap paṇimoḻikkuc
cēntaṉavāñ cēyarikkaṇ tām.'' (|aintiṇiyim.15)
|eṉpatum |atu.

|avaḷvilaṅkuṟiṉum...tāyiṭippukuppiṉum |eṉpatu--talivi kāppumikutiyāṉuṅ kātaṉ mikutiyāṉum notumalar variviṉāṉum tamarvarivumaṟuttatiṉāṉum vēṟupaṭṭavaḻi |iḵtu |eṟṟiṉāṉ |āyiṟṟu |eṉac cevili |aṟivari viṉā|ayk kuṟipārkkum |iṭattiṉum, |aḵtaṉṟi veṟiyāṭṭiṭattiṉum, piṟar varivu vantuḻiyum |avar varivu maṟutu/tavaḻiyum, muṉṉilivakiyāṉātal |aṟattoṭunili vakiyāṉātal |ivviruvakiyāṉātal |aṟattoṭunili vakiyāṉātal |ivviruvakiyāṉun talivaṟkum talivikkum taṉakkuṅ kulattiṟkum kuṟṟan tīrnta kiḷaviyit tāymāṭṭup pukutaviṭuttalum |eṉṟavāṟu.

pukutaviṭuttalāvatu nirampac collātu tōṟṟuvāy ceytal.
|annālvakip poruḷiṉum muṉṉilik kiḷavi varumāṟu:-
``poypaṭu paṟiyāk kaḻaṅkē meyyē
maṇivarik kaṭci maṭamayil |ālum
malarnta vaḷḷiyaṅ kāṉaṅ kiḻavōṉ
|āṇṭaki viṟalvēḷ |allaṉ |ivaḷ
pūṇtāṅ kiḷamuli |aṇaṅki yōṉē.'' (|aiṅkuṟu.250)
|itu, kuṟipārttavaḻik kūṟiyatu, kaḻaṅku muṉṉiliyāka.
``|amma vāḻi tōḻi paṉmalar
naṟuntaṇ cōli nāṭukeḻu neṭuntaki
kuṉṟam pāṭā ṉāyiṉ
|eṉpayañ ceyumō vēlaṟku veṟiyē.'' (|aiṅkuṟu.244)
|itu, taliviyi muṉṉiliyākak kūṟiyatu.
``neytal naṟumalarc ceruntiyoṭu viri|ik
kipuṉi naṟuntār kamaḻu mārpaṉ
|aruntiṟaṟ kaṭavu ḷallaṉ
|aruntiṟaṟ kaṭavu ḷallaṉ
peruntuṟik koṇṭivaḷ |aṇaṅki yōṉē.'' (|aiṅkuṟu. 182)
|itu, vēlaṉi muṉṉiliyākak kūṟiyatu.
``kaṭavuṭ kaṟcuṉi |aṭiviṟan taviḻnta
paṟiyāk kuvaḷi malaroṭu kāntaḷ
kuruti |oṇpū |urukeḻak kaṭṭip
peruvari |aṭukkam poṟpac cūrmakaḷ
|aruvi |iṉṉiyat tāṭu nāṭaṉ
mārputara vanta paṭarmali yarunōy
niṉṉaṇaṅ kaṉmi yaṟintum |aṇṇāntu
kārnaṟuṅ kaṭampiṉ kaṇṇi cūṭi
vēlaṉ vēṇṭa veṟimaṉi vantōy
kaṭavu ḷāyiṉum |āka
maṭavi maṉṟa vāḻiya murukē.'' (naṟṟiṇi.34)
|itu, murukaṉi muṉṉiliyākak kūṟiyatu. piṟavumaṉṉa.
``|aṉṉi vāḻivēṇ ṭaṉṉi muḻaṅkukaṭal
tiritaru muttam veṇmaṇal |imikkun
taṇṇan tuṟivaṉ vanteṉap
poṉṉiṉuñciṟantaṉṟu kaṇṭiciṉ nutalē.'' (|aiṅkuṟu.105)
|itu, muṉṉilippakuti: notumalarvarivupaṟṟi vantatu.
``kuṉṟak kuṟavaṉ kātal maṭamakaḷ
|aṇimayi laṉṉa |acinaṭik koṭicciyip
peruvari nāṭaṉ variyu mākil
toṭuttaṉam |āyiṉā naṉṟē
|iṉṉum |āṉātu naṇṇuṟu tuyarē.'' (|aiṅkuṟu.258)
|iḵtu, |avaṉ varivu maṟuttuḻik kūṟiyatu.
|iṉi, |aṟattoṭunilip pakuti |eḻuvakippaṭum. |aviyāmāṟu:
``|eḷittal |ēttal vēṭki yurittal
kūṟutal |ucāvutal |ētīṭu talippāṭu
|uṇmi ceppuṅ kiḷaviyoṭu toki|i
|avveḻu vakiya |eṉmaṉār pulavar'' (poruḷiyal.102)
|eṉap poruḷiyaluṭ kūṟiya cūttirattāṉē koḷka.

|eḷittal |eṉpatu--talivaṉ nammāṭṭu |eḷiya ṉeṉṟu kūṟutal. |ataṉatu payam makaḷuṭittāyar tamvaḻi |oḻukuvārkku makaṭkoṭi vēṇṭuva rātalāṉ, |eḷiyaṉeṉpatu kūṟi |aṟattoṭuniṟkap peṟumeṉṟavāṟu.
``|aṉṉi |aṟiyiṉum |aṟika |alarvāy
|ammeṉ cēri kēṭpiṉuṅ kēṭka
piṟitoṉ ṟiṉmi |aṟiyak kūṟik
koṭuñcuḻip pukā |art teyva nōkkik
kaṭuñcūḷ tarukuval niṉakkē
toṭali |āyamoṭu kaṭaluṭaṉ |āṭiyuñ
ciṟṟil |iḻittuñ ciṟucōṟu kuvi|iyum
varuntiya varuttan tīra yāmciṟitu
|iruntaṉa māka |eyta vantu
taṭameṉ paṇittōḷ maṭanal līrē
|ellum |elliṉ ṟacivumika |uṭiyēṉ
mellilip parappiṉ viruntuṇ ṭiyāṉumik
kalleṉ ciṟukuṭit taṅkiṉmaṟ ṟevaṉō
|eṉamoḻin taṉaṉē |oruvaṉ |avaṟkaṇṭu
|iṟiñkiya mukattem puṟañcērpu porunti
|ivinumak kuriya |alla |iḻinta
koḻumīṉ valci |eṉṟaṉam |iḻumeṉa
neṭuṅkoṭi nuṭaṅku nāvāy tōṉṟuva
kāṇā mōveṉak kāliṟ citiyā
nillātu peyarnta pallō ruḷḷum
|eṉṉē kuṟitta nōkkamoṭu naṉṉutāl
|oḻikō yāṉeṉa |aḻitakak kūṟi
yāṉpeyar keṉṉa nōkkit tāṉtaṉ
neṭuntērk koṭiñci paṟṟi
niṉṟōṉ pōlum |iṉṟum|eṉ kaṭkē.'' (|akam.110)
|eṉa varum. |aṉṉi |eṉṟatu naṟṟāyi.

|ēttal |eṉpatu--talivaṉi |uyarttukkūṟutal. |atu, makaḷuṭit tāyar `talivaṉ |uyarntāṉ' |eṉṟavaḻi maṉamakiḻvarākaliṉ, |avvāṟu kūṟappaṭṭatu. |uyarttuk kūṟi |aṟattoṭu niṟkappeṟum |eṉṟavāṟu.
``|aṉṉāy vāḻivēṇ ṭaṉṉi niṉmakaḷ
pālum |uṇṇāḷ paḻaṅkaṇ koṇṭu
naṉipacan taṉaḷeṉa viṉavuti |ataṉtiṟam
yāṉun teṟṟeṉa |uṇarēṉ mēṉāḷ
malipūñ cāraleṉ tōḻi mārōṭu
|oliciṉi vēṅki koykuvañ ceṉṟuḻip
pulipuli |eṉṉum pūcal tōṉṟa
|oṇaceṅ kaḻunīrk kaṇpōl |āyitaḻ
|ūci pōkiya cūḻcey māliyaṉ
pakkañ cērttiya ceckik kaṇṇiyaṉ
kuyamaṇ ṭākañ ceñcāntu nīvi
varipuṉi villaṉ |orukaṇi terintukoṇṭu
yātō maṟṟam mātiṟam paṭareṉa
viṉavi niṟṟan tōṉē |avaṟkaṇṭu
|emmuḷ |emmuḷ meymmaṟi poṭuṅki
nāṇi niṉṟaṉe mākap pēṇi
|aivaki vakutta kūntal |āynutal
miyīr |oti maṭavīr numvāyp
poyyum |uḷavō |eṉṟaṉaṉ piyeṉap
parimuṭuku tavitta tēraṉ |etirmaṟuttu
niṉmakaḷ |uṇkaṇ paṉmā ṇōkkic
ceṉṟōṉ maṉṟa|ak kuṉṟukiḻa vōṉē
pakalmāy |antip paṭucuṭar |amiyattu
|avaṉmaṟi tē|em nōkki maṟṟivaṉ
makaṉē tōḻi |eṉṟaṉaḷ
|ataṉaḷa vuṇṭukōḷ matival lōrkkē.'' (|akam.48)
|itaṉuḷ kaḻunīr māliyaṉ, veṭcikkaṇṇiyaṉ |eṉak kūṟiṉamiyāl, |avaṉ nāṭṭiṟkum malikkun talivaṉ |eṉpatu paṭavum, |orukaṇi terintukoṇṭu puli vēṭkiyum kūṟutal. vēṭkikūṟi |aṟattoṭu niṟkum |eṉṟavāṟu.
``niṉmaka ḷuṇkaṇ paṉmā ṇōkkic ceṉṟōṉ'' |eṉpatu talivaṉ vēṭki kūṟiyavāṟām.
``|aṉṉāy vāḻivēṇ ṭaṉṉi |eṉtōḻi
naṉinā ṇuṭiyaḷ |eṉiṉum |añcum
|oliveḷ ḷaruḷi #ē#āṅkumali nāṭaṉ
malarnta mārpiṟ pāyal
tavanaṉi veyya nōkō yāṉē.'' (|aiṅkuṟu.215)
|itu, talivi vēṭki kūṟiyatu.

kūṟutalāvatu--taliviyit talivaṟkuk koṭukkavēṇṭu meṉpatu paṭak kūṟutal.
|utāraṇam:-
``vāṭāta cāṉṟōr varavetir koṇṭirāyk
kōṭātu nīrkoṭuppiṉ |allatu--vāṭā
|eḻilum muliyum |iraṇṭiṟku munnīrp
poḻilum viliyāmō pōntu'' (tiṇimāli-15)
|eṉa varum.
``kaṟivaḷar cilampiṟ kaṭavuṭ pēṇi
|aṟiyā vēlaṉ veṟiyeṉak kūṟum
|atumaṉaṅ koḷkuvi |aṉṉiyivaḷ
putumalar maḻikkaṇ pulampiya nōykkē'' (|aiṅkuṟu.243)
|eṉavum varum.

|ucāvutal |eṉpatu--veṟiyāṭṭuṅ kaḻaṅkum |iṭṭurittuḻi vēlaṉōṭātal piṟarōṭātal tōḻi |ucāvutal.
``murukayarntu vanta mutuvāy vēla
ciṉaval |ompumati viṉavuva tuṭiyēṉ
palvē ṟuruviṟ cillaviḻ maṭiyoṭu
ciṟumaṟi tōṉṟiya vaṉṟunutal nīvi
vaṇaṅkiṉi koṭutti yāyiṉ |aṇaṅkiya
viṇṭēr māmalic cilampaṉ
taṇṭā rakalamum |uṇṇumō paliyē.'' (kuṟun.362)
|itu, vēlaṉoṭu |ucāvutal.
``|iṉṟiyāṇ ṭiyaṉō tōḻi kuṉṟattup
paḻaṅkuḻi |akaḻnta kāṉavaṉ kiḻaḻaṅkiṉōṭu
|uṇṇami matuttuḷi peṟū|u nāṭaṉ
|aṟivukāḻk koḷḷum |aḷavic ceṟitoṭi
|emmil varukuvi nīyeṉap
pommal |oti nīvi yōṉē.'' (kuṟun.279)
|itu cevili taliviyoṭu tōḻi |ucāviyatu. piṟavu maṉṉa.

|ētīṭu talippāṭu |eṉpatu--yātāṉumōr |ētuvi |iṭiyiṭṭuk koṇṭu talippaṭṭami kūṟutal.
|utāraṇam:-
``kāmar kaṭumpuṉal kalantemmō ṭāṭuvāḷ
..............................
|arumaḻi taralvēṇṭil tarukiṟkum perumiyaḷē.'' (kalit.39)
|itu, puṉaliṭi |utaviṉāṉeṉat talippāṭu kūṟiyatu.
``cuḷḷi cuṉinīlañ cōpā likiceyali
|aḷḷi |aḷakattiṉ mēlāyntu--teḷḷi
|ataṇāṟ kaṭiyoṭuṅkā |īrṅkaṭā yāṉi
|utaṇāṟ kaṭintāṉ |uḷaṉ.'' (tiṇimālinūṟ.2)
|itu, kaḷiṟṟiṭi |utaviṉāṉeṉat talippāṭu kūṟiyatu.
``|aṉṉi vāḻivēṇ ṭaṉṉi |eṉṉi
tāṉu malintāṉ |emakkuntaḻi yāyiṉa
poṉvī maṇi |arum piṉavē
|eṉṉa maraṅkolavar cāra lavvē.'' (|aiṅkuṟu.201)
|itu, taḻiyum kaṇṇiyuṟ tantāṉeṉpatupaṭak kūṟiyatu.

|uṇmi ceppam kiḷavi yāvatu--paṭṭāṅku kūṟutal.
``|alkalaṉ maḻi poḻinta |akaṉkaṇ |aruvi
|āṭukaḻi |aṭukkat tiḻitaru nāṭaṉ
peruvari |aṉṉa tiruviṟal vayiṉmārpu
muyaṅkātu kaḻinta nāḷivaḷ
mayaṅkitaḻ maḻikkaṇ kaliḻum |aṉṉāy.'' (|aiṅkuṟu220)
/|ivvaki yellām tattaṅ kuṭimik kēṟṟavaḻikkoḷka.

varivuṭaṉ paṭpōrk kaṭāval vēṇṭiyum |eṉpatu-- tamar variyumpaṭṭamiyit talivaṟku |urikka vēṇṭiyum |eṉṟavāṟu.
|utāraṇam vantavaḻik kāṇka.

|āṅkataṉ ṟaṉmiyiṉ vaṉpuṟi |eṉpatu--|avvāṟu varivuṭam paṭṭataṉmiyiṉāl taliviyi vaṟpuṟuttaṟ kaṇṇum |eṉṟavāṟu.
``kūr kūḷ muṇṭākak kūrpaṉi māmalar
nūlaṟa muttiṟ kāloṭu pāṟit
taṟitoṟum parakkuṅan tūmaṇaṟ cērppaṉi
yāṉuṅ kātaleṉ yāyumnaṉi veyyaḷ
|entiyuṅ koṭī|iyar vēṇṭum
|ampal |ūrum |avaṉoṭu moḻimē.'' (kuṟun.51)
``|amma vāḻi tōḻi nammoṭu
ciṟutiṉik kāval ṉākip perituniṉ
meṉtōḷ nekiḻavum tinutal pacappavum
poṉpōl viṟaṟkaviṉ tolitta
kuṉṟa nāṭaṟ kārntar maṇaṇē.''(ṅaṅkuṟu.230)
|eṉa varum
 pāṅkuṟa vanta nāleṭṭu vakiyum |eṉpatu--pakutippaṭavantamuppattiṇṭu vakippaṭṭa poruṇmiyum |eṉṟavāṟu.
|aviyāvaṉa mēṟ collappaṭṭa muṉṉuṟa vuṇartal vaki kuṟiyuṟavuṇartaṟkaṇ perumiyiṟ peyarttal, |ulakurit toḻittal,|arumiyiṉakaṟṟal, piṉ vāveṉṟal, pētimi yūṭṭal, muṉṉuṟupuṇarcci muṟiniṟut turittal, |añci yaccuṟuttal, |urittuḻikkūṭṭam |eṉac collappaṭṭa |eṇvaki māyañ ceppi vanta kiḻavaṉippoṟutta kāraṇam kuṟittalākiya |iruvarumuḷvaḻi |avaṉ varavuṇartal, puṇarntapiṉ |avaṉvayiṉ vaṇaṅkal, kuṟinayappac cēṟal,kuṟinayappuvaki, nayantamikūṟal, |alarā meṉṟal, puṇarccivēṇṭiyavaḻik kūṟal, pirivu vēṇṭiyavaḻik kūṟal, vēḷāṇ peru neṟivēṇṭik kūṟal, |allakuṟippaṭṭavaḻik kūṟal, |ompaṭikūṟal,|iyaṟpaḻittu vaṟpuṟuttal, |āṟiṉṉāmi kūṟal, kāppu mikutikūṟal,kātal mikutikūṟal, |avaṉvayiṟ ṟōṉṟiya kiḷavi, |aiyacceykitāykketir maṟuttal, kuṟipārttal vilakkal, veṟivilakkal. piṟaṉvarivu maṟuppittal, |avaṉ varivuṭampaṭuttal, varivuṭampaṭṭamitalivaṟkuk kūṟal, |uṭampaṭṭami talivikkuk kūṟi vaṟpuṟuttal|eṉa |ivi.

tāṅkaruñ ciṟappiṟ ṟōḻi mēṉa |eṉpatu--|ivi muppattiraṇṭuporuṇmiyum talivikku |iṉṟiyamiyāta tōḻi mēlaṉa |eṉṟavāṟu. (24)


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_113">{SA TP113i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li>kaḷavala rāyiṉuṅ kāmamēṟ paṭuppiṉum
<li>|aḷavumikat tōṉṟiṉun talippeytu kāṇiṉuṅ
<li>kaṭṭiṉuṅ kaḻaṅkiṉum veṟiyeṉa |iruvarum
<li>|oṭṭiya tiṟattāṟ ceytik kaṇṇum
<li>|āṭiya ceṉṟuḻi |aḻivutali variṉuṅ
<li>kātal kimmikak kaṉaviṉ |araṟṟaluṅ
<li>tōḻiyi viṉāvalun teyvam vāḻttalum
<li>pōkkuṭaṉ |aṟintapiṉ tōḻiyoṭu keḻī|ik
<li>kaṟpiṉ |ākkattu niṟṟaṟ kaṇṇum
<li>piriviṉ |eccattu makaḷneñcu valippiṉum
<li>|irupāṟ kuṭipporuḷ |iyalpiṉ kaṇṇum
<li>|iṉṉa vakiyiṟ patiṉmūṉṟu kiḷaviyoṭu
<li>|aṉṉavi piṟavuñ cevili mēṉa.
</ol>

<P>|eṉṟatu mēṟ ṟalivaṟkun talivikkun tōḻikkumuriya kiḷaviyellāṅ kūṟi |iṉic cevilikkuriya kiḷavi yuṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.
kaḷavalarātal mutalākac collappaṭṭa patiṉmūṉṟu kiḷaviyum|attaṉmiya piṟa kiḷaviyum kaḷavukālattuc ceviliyiṉ mēlaṉa |eṉṟavāṟu. |ivaṟṟuḷ tōḻiyi viṉātaleṉa vēṟorukiḷaviyāka |otiṉārāyiṉum, |ataṉ muṉpu nikaḻum kiḷaviyellām |avaḷi viṉātaṟkukkāraṇamātaliṉ |avi yīṇṭup patiṉmuṉṟeṉa veṇṇappaṭṭaṉa veṉka.



<P>(|i-ḷ.) kaḷavala rāyiṉum |eṉpatu--talivaṉ |oḻukalāṟu puṟattārkkup pulaṉāki |alar tūṟṟappaṭṭa viṭattut tōḻiyi viṉāvum |eṉṟavāṟu.
|utāraṇam:-
``pāvaṭi |urala pakuvāy vaḷḷi
|ētiṉ mākkaḷ nuvaṟalum nuvampa
|aḻiva tevaṉkol|ip pēti |ūrkkē
perumpūṭ poṟiyaṉ pē|emutir kollik
karuṅkaṭ ṭeyvaṅ kuṭavari |eḻutiya
nalliyaṟ pāvi |aṉṉa |eṉ
melliyaṟ kuṟumakaḷ pāṭiṉaḷ kuṟiṉē.'' (kuṟun.89)

kāma mēṟ paṭuppiṉum |eṉpatu--talivimāṭṭuḷatākiya vēṭki |aḷaviṟappiṉum tōḻiyi viṉāvum |eṉṟavāṟu.
``maṇiyil tikaḻtaru nūlpōl maṭanti
|aṇiyil tikaḻvatoṉ ṟuṇṭu.'' (kuṟaḷ.1273)

|aḷavu mikat tōṉṟiṉum |eṉpatu--petumpip paruvattaḷākiya talivi puṇarcciyāṟ katir/ttu vīṅkukiṉṟa muliyum putituṟṟa kaviṉuṅ kaṇṭaviṭattun tōḻiyi viṉāvum |eṉṟavāṟu.
``kaṇniṟinta kāriki/ kāmpērtōṭ pētikkup
peṇniṟinta nīrmi peritu.'' (kuṟaḷ.1272)

talippeytu kāṇiṉum |eṉpatu--talivaṉōṭu taliviyit talip peytu kāṇiṉum viṉāvum |eṉṟavāṟu.
peyteṉpataṉip peyaveṉat tirikka.
`............................
miṭiyūr piḻiyak kaṇṭaṉeṉ' (|akam.158)
|eṉa varum.

kaṭṭiṉum |eṉpatu--kaṭṭu vippittavaḻiyum |avarcoṟkēṭṭut tōḻiyi viṉāvum |eṉṟavāṟu.

kaḻaṅkiṉum |eṉpatu--kaḻaṅku vittuḻiyum |avarcoṟ kēṭṭut tōḻiyi viṉāvum |eṉṟavāṟu.

veṟiyeṉa viruvaru moṭṭiya tiṟattāṟ ceytikkaṇṇum |eṉpatu--ceviliyum naṟṟāyum poruntiyapakkattuk kaṇṭu veṟiyāṭuvā meṉṟavaḻit talivi ceytikkaṇṇun tōḻiyi viṉāvum |eṉṟavāṟu.

|āṭiya ceṉṟuḻi |aḻivu talivariṉum |eṉpatu--veṟiyāṭiya ceṉṟavaḻi |ataṟkaḻivuṟumiṭattu variṉum |eṉṟavāṟu.
|aḵtāvatu: ``kaṭavuṭ kaṟcuṉi'' |eṉat toṭaṅkum naṟṟiṇip pāṭṭil,
``niṉṉaṇaṅ kaṉmi |aṟintum |aṇṇāntu
vēlaṉ vēṇṭa veṟimaṉi vantōy
kaṭavu ḷāyiṉum |āka
maṭavi maṉṟa vāḻiya murukē'' (naṟṟiṇi.34)
|eṉat tōḻi kūṟutal. |avvāṟu kūṟiyavaḻiyuṅ kāraṇa meṉṉi yeṉa viṉāvum,

kātal kimmikak kaṉavi ṉaraṟṟalum |eṉpatu--kātaṉ mikutiyāl talivaṉi ḷḷik kaṉaviṉkaṇ |araṟṟutaṟkaṇṇum viṉāvum.

tōḻiyi viṉātalum |eṉpatu--|ivi nimittamākat tōḻiyi viṉātalum |eṉṟavāṟu. |eṉavē kaḷavalarātal mutaṟ kaṉaviṉaraṟṟa līṟāka |otiya voṉpatu kiḷaviyum tōḻiyi viṉātaṟpakuti. |avi nikaḻātavaḻi viṉātalilli. |ataṉāl tōḻiyi viṉātaleṉa |orukiḷaviyāka |eṇṇaṟka.

teyvam vāḻttalum |eṉpatu--|ivvāṟu paṭṭateṉat tōḻiyurittavaḻiyitaṉi naṟṟāykkum tantikkum kūṟalāṟṟātāḷ teyvatti vēṇṭikkōṭal.

pōkkuṭaṉ |aṟintapiṉ...niṟṟaṟ kaṇṇum |eṉpatu--talivaṉuṭaṉ pōyiṉāḷ|eṉṟu |aṟintavaḻit tāṉun tōḻiyōṭu keḻumi |illattiṉka ṇiṟuttaṟkaṇṇum |eṉṟavāṟu.
``paṟipaṭap paṇilam |ārppa |iṟikoḷpu
toṉmū tālattup potiyil tōṉṟiya
nālūrk kōcar naṉmoḻi pōla
vāyā kiṉṟē tōḻi |āykaḻaṟ
cēyili veḷvēl viṭaliyoṭu
tokuvaḷi muṉki maṭanti naṭpē.'' (kuṟun.15)

pirivi ṉeccattu maṉaṇeñcu valippiṉum |eṉpatu--talivaṉ variyātupirintavaḻi yoḻinta talimakaḷ |alarākutalu miṉṟi vēṟupāṭumiṉṟi|oru malippaṭṭirunta vuḷḷakkarutti yaṟntavaḻiyum |eṉṟavāṟu.valittal |eṉpatu teḷital.

|irupāṟ kuṭipporu ḷiyalpiṉ kaṇṇum |eṉpatu--talivaṉ kuṭimi taṉkuṭimiyō ṭokkumeṉa vārāytaṟkaṇṇum |eṉṟavāṟu.
kuṭiyeṉṉātu poruḷ |eṉṟataṉāl poruḷuṅ kuṇamum |āyappeṟu meṉṟavāṟu.

|aṉṉavi piṟavum |eṉṟataṉāṉ,
``nāṟṟam peṟṟu nilippuk kāṇṭal
|uṇṭiyiṟ kuṟital |uṭampunaṉi curuṅkal
kaṇtuyil maṟuttal kōlañcey yāmi''
mutalāyiṉa koḷka. |iviyum viṉātaṟkētuvām. |ivaṟṟiṟ kelmutalāyiṉaceyyuḷ vantavaḻik kāṇka. (25)


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_114">{SA TP114i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li>tāykkum variyār |uṇarvuṭam paṭiṉē.
</ol>

<P>|itu naṟṟāykku |uriyatōr |ilakkaṇamuṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.


<P>(|i-ḷ.) ceviliyuṇarvōṭu |uṭampaṭṭa vuḷḷattaḷāyiṉ, naṟṟāykkummēṟcollappaṭṭavi yellām variyappaṭā veṉṟavāṟu.
|uṇarvuṭampaṭutalāvatu--taliviyi yuṟṟu nōkkamnikaḻntavaḻiyaṉṟit tāṉum ceviliyippōla |uṟṟu nōkkāḷeṉṟu koḷka.|ipporuḷmēṟ kiḷavi varuvaṉa |uḷavēṉuñ ceviliyippōla veruppaṭṭavuḷḷattaḷāyiṉ |avaḷkaṇṇum |ikkiḷaviyellām nikaḻum |eṉṟavāṟu.|uṭampaṭātavāṟu |eṉṉi yeṉiṉ, yāriṭattum makkaḷi vaḷarppārceviliyarākalāṉum tamakkut tam |illaṟanilikkuk kaṭava pakutiyāṉa|aṟaṉum poruḷum |iṉpamum vēṇṭutalāṉum kūṟṟoṭu vēṟupāṭu tōṉṟātu.(26)


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_115">{SA TP115i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li>kiḻavōṉ |aṟiyā |aṟiviṉaḷ |ivaḷeṉa
<li>miyaṟu ciṟappiṉ |uyarntōr pāṅkiṉ
<li>|aiyak kiḷaviyiṉ |aṟitalum |urittē.
</ol>

<P>|itu naṟṟāyum ceviliyum tuṇiyumāṟu kūṟikiṉṟatu.


<P>(|i-ḷ.) kiḻavōṉ |aṟiyā |aṟiviṉaḷ |eṉpatu--talimakaṉ |aṟiyā|aṟiviṉiyuṭiyavaḷ |eṉṟavāṟu. |eṉavē |orupakkam |etirkālamnōkkik kūṟiṉār pōlat tōṉṟum; |orupakkam |iṟantakālam tōṉṟum.|avaṉ |aṟiyāta |aṟivurimi pūṇṭu mayaṅkutal, |avaḷ |ettuṇiyummayakkamilaḷ |eṉavum |avaṉ poruṭṭu mayaṅkiṉāḷ |eṉavumpaṭakkūṟutal, talivaṉ |aṟiyāta |aṟiviṉiyuṭiyavaḷ |eṉak kuṟṟamaṟṟaciṟappiṉiyuṭiya |uyarntōrmāṭṭu |uḷatākiya |aiyakkiḷaviyālpuṇarppaṟitalum |urittu, cevilikkum naṟṟāykkum |eṉṟavāṟu.
|iḵtu |eṟṟiṉāṉ |āyiṟṟu |eṉak kuṟṟamaṟṟa tavari viṉāyavaḻi |avar|ivvāṟu paṭṭateṉa meykūṟutalun takutiyaṉṟām; poy kūṟutalumtakutiyaṉṟām. |ātalāl |aiyappaṭumāṟu cila kūṟiyavaḻi, |ataṉāṉēyuṇarpa |eṉṟavāṟu. kiḻavōṉaṟiyā vaṟiviṉaḷeṉṟavāṟu kūṟiyavaḻik.kiḻavōṉetiṉappaṭa..|iṟanta kālattuḷ talivaṉ |uḷaṉ |eṉṟavāṟām.(27)


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_116">{SA TP116i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li>taṉṉuṟu vēṭki kiḻavaṉmuṟ kiḷattal
<li>|eṇṇuṅ kālik kiḻattik killip
<li>piṟanīr mākkaḷiṉ |aṟiya |āyiṭip
<li>peynnīr pōlum |uṇarviṟ ṟeṉpa.
</ol>

<P>|itu, talivikku |uriyatōr |iyalpuṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.


<P>(|i-ḷ.) talivi taṉatu vēṭkiyik kiḻavaṉ muṉpu collutalniḷikkuṅ kālattuk kiḻattikku |illi. |aṅṅaṉam collāta viṭattumputukkalattiṉkaṭ peyta nīrpōlap puṟampocintu kāṭṭum |uṇarviṉiyumuṭittu |avvēṭki |eṉṟavāṟu.
|eṉavē, kuṟippiṉ |uṇaraniṟkum |eṉṟavāṟu. talivaṉmāṭṭukkūṟṟiṉāṉum nikaḻappaṭumeṉṟu koḷḷappaṭum. (28)


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_117">{SA TP117i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li>kāmak kūṭṭan taṉimiyiṟ poritaliṉ
<li>tāmē tūtuva rākalum |urittē.
</ol>

<P>|eṉṟatu, kaḷaviṟpuṇarccik kuriyatōr vēṟupāṭuṇarttutalnutaliṟṟu.

<P>(|i-ḷ.) mēṟ coṉṉavāṟṟāl pāṅkaṉun tōḻiyunimittamākakkūṭutalēyaṉṟit tāmē tūtuvarākiya kūṭṭaṅkaḷ nikaḻappeṟum; |atuciṟappuṭit tātalāl |eṉṟavāṟu.
|eṉavē, pāṅkaṟ kūṭṭam tōḻiyiṟ kūṭṭam |eṉpaṉa niyamamilli;yārmāṭṭum |eṉṟavāṟām. taṉimiyiṟ politaliṉ |eṉṟamiyāṉ |itumikaḻum naṉṟu. (29)


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_118">{SA TP118i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li>|avaṉvaram piṟatta laṟantaṉak kiṉmiyiṉ
<li>kaḷañcuṭṭuk kiḷavi kiḻaviya tākun
<li>tāṉcelaṟ kuriyavaḻi yāka lāṉa.
</ol>

<P>|itu, collappaṭṭa kūṭṭattiṟkuk kuṟiyiṭam kūṟuvāṉuṇarttutalnutaliṟṟu.


<P>(|i-ḷ.) talivaṉ |iyaṟkippuṇarcci puṇarnta piṉpu,talivaṉelliyi maṟattal talivikku |aṟamāka liṉmiyāṉēkuṟiyiṭam kūṟutal talimakaḷatām: |atu tāṉ cēṟaṟ kuriya|iṭamātalāṉ |eṉṟavāṟu. (30)

<P>|eṉavē, |ittuṇikkūṟiṉ mikiyaṉṟu |eṉṟavāṟām.


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_119">{SA TP119i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li>tōḻiyiṉ muṭiyum |iṭaṉumār |uṇṭē.
</ol>

<P>|itu, tōḻiyiṟ kūṭṭattiṟ kāyatōr ciṟappuviti |uṇarttutalnutaliṟṟu.


<P>(|i-ḷ.) mēl, `kāmakkūṭṭan taṉimiyiṟ politaliṟṟāmē tūtuvarākalum |urit' teṉak kūṟippōntār; |avvāṟaṉṟi mēṟ collappaṭṭa|iyaṟkippuṇarcciyāvatu tōḻiyiṉ muṭiyumiṭattu |oriṭattu |uṇṭu|eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>``|aṉpoṭu puṇarnta vintiṇi'' (|iṟiyaṉār kaḷaviyal-1)|eṉṟataṉāl yāṇṭum |uḷḷap puṇarcciyāṉ vēṭki mītūrnta vaḻiyētōḻiyiṉ muṭiyap peṟuvatu |eṉṟu koḷka. |allākkāṟperuntiṇippāṟpāṭum. (31)


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_120">{SA TP120i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li> munnā ḷallatu tuṇiyiṉṟu kaḻiyātu
<li>|annā ḷakattum |atuvari viṉṟē.
</ol>

<P>|itu, pāṅkaṟ kūṭṭam nikaḻumiṭam |uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.


<P>(|i-ḷ.) mēl, tōḻiyiṟ kūṭṭattiṉ vikaṟpaṅkūṟiṉā rākaliṉ, |īṇṭuttuṇi yeṉṟatu pāṅkaṉ |āyiṟṟu. mūṉṟu nāḷallatu tuṇiyiṉṟik kaḷaviṟpuṇarcci cellātu; |annāḷakattum tuṇiyi nīkkavum paṭātu|eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>|eṉavē, |etirppaṭṭa talivaṉ |iyaṟkip puṇarcci puṇarvataṉ muṉpāṅkaṟku |uṇarttavum peṟum |eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>|utāraṇam mēṟkāṭṭappaṭṭatu. (32)


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_121">{SA TP121i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li> paṉṉūṟu vakiyiṉun taṉvayiṉ varū|um
<li>naṉṉaya maruṅkiṉa nāṭṭam vēṇṭalil
<li>tuṇiccuṭṭuk kiḷavi kiḻaviya tākun
<li>tuṇiyōr karuma māta lāṉa.
</ol>

<P>|itu, talivikku |uriyatō riyalpu |uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>(|i-ḷ.) paṉṉūṟu vakiyiṉum |eṉpatu--palavakiyāṉum |eṉṟavāṟu.nūṟu, pattu, |āyiram |eṉapaṉa palporuṭpeyar.

taṉvayiṉvarū|u...mātalāṉa |eṉpatu--taṉṉiṭattu varum nallanayayappāṭṭup pakkattiṉi |āraytal talivaṉ māṭṭu vēṇṭumātalāl,tuṇiyic cuṭṭikkūṟuluṟum col talimakaḷatākum; tāṉ kūṟum karumamtuṇiyōrāṟ ceyyappaṭum karumamātalāṉ |eṉṟavāṟu.
|eṉavē, talimakaṉ kaḷavukālattup pāṅkaṟku |uṟṟaturitta piṉpupāṅkaṉic cuṭṭi yātu ceyvāmeṉak kūṟappeṟum |eṉṟavāṟāyiṟṟu. (33)


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_122">{SA TP122i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li> |āyperuñ ciṟappiṉ |arumaṟi kiḷattaliṉ
<li>tāyeṉap paṭuvāḷ cevili yākum.
</ol>

<P>|itu, cevilikku |uriyatōr ciṟappu|uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.


<P>(|i-ḷ.) nalla periya ciṟappiṉiyuṭiya |aṟitaṟkariyamaṟipporuḷ yāvaṟṟiyuṅ kūṟum kaṭappāṭuṭiyaḷātaliṉ tāy|eṉappaṭuvāḷ ceviliyākum |eṉṟavāṟu.
naṟṟāy |ittuṇic ciṟappilaḷ |eṉṟavāṟu. |itaṉāṟpayaṉ,kaḷavukkālattiyac co......cevilittāykkuṅ kittāykkum potuvāyiṉum, tāyeṉṟu vēṇṭappaṭuvāḷ cevili |eṉṟaṟivittal. (34)


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_123">{SA TP123i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li> tōḻi tāṉē cevili makaḷē.
</ol>

<P>|itu, tōḻikku |uriyatōr ciṟappu |uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.


<P>(|i-ḷ.) kaḷavukkālattum |iṉṟiyamiyāḷākat taliviyālvēṇṭappaṭṭāḷ cevilimakaḷ |eṉṟavāṟu.
|eṉavē, payiṉṟā rellārun tōḻiyarākār. |arumaṟi kiḷakkappaṭutalāṉ|uṭaṉ muliṇṭu vaḷarnta cevili makaḷē tōḻi |eṉappaṭuvāḷ|eṉṟavāṟu. |arumaṟi kiḷattal |eṉpataṉi yīṇṭu varuvikka.


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_124">{SA TP124i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li> cūḻtalum |ucāttuṇi nilimiyiṟ polimē.
</ol>

<P>|itu, tōḻikku |uriyatōr |iyalpu |uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.


<P>(|i-ḷ.) mēṟcollappaṭṭa tōḻi tāṉ cūḻtaṟkum talivicūḻccikku|ucāttuṇiyākiyum varum nilimiyāṟ polivupeṟum |eṉṟavāṟu.
|eṉavē, cevilimakaḷ |eṉṉun tuṇiyāṟ polivupeṟāḷ; |eṉṟum tōḻiyāvāḷcevilimakaḷātalēyaṉṟic cūḻavum |ucāttuṇiyākavum vallaḷ|ātalvēṇṭum |eṉṟavāṟu. (36)


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_125">{SA TP125i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li> kuṟiyuṟa |uṇartal muṉṉuṟa |uṇartal
<li>|iruvarum |uḷvaḻi |avaṉvara vuṇartaleṉa
<li>matiyuṭam paṭutal |orumū vakittē.
</ol>

<P>|itu, talivaṉ puṇarcci yuṇmi tōḻi |aṟiyun tiṟaṉ pākupaṭumāṟu|uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.


<P>(|i-ḷ.) talivaṉ kuṟiyuṟa vuṇartalum |avaṉ kuṟiyuṟāvaḻittalivi kuṟippukkaṇṭu |uṇartalum tāṉum taliviyuṅ kūṭiyiruntuḻittalivaṉ vantamikaṇṭu ṇartalum |eṉa mūvakittut tōḻi|aṟivuṭampaṭutaṟkaṇṇa |eṉṟavāṟu.
matiyuṭampaṭutal |eṉiṉum puṇarcciyuṇartal |uṉiṉum |okkum.|immūṉṟiṉum |oṉṟu kaṇṭuḻi |avaravar kuṟippiṉāṟ puṇarcciyuṇarum|eṉṟavāṟu. `kuṟipuṇartal' muṉvittār. naṉku pulappaṭutaliṉ.muṉṉuṟavuṇartal' |ataṉpiṉ vittār, talivi vēṟupāṭu kaṇṭupaṇṭiyiṟpōlāḷ |eṉṉum nikaḻcciyāṉ muṟṟat tuṇiviṉmiyiṉ, `|iruvarumuḷvaḻi yavaṉ varavuṇartal' |ataṉ piṉvittār. |āṇṭup putuvōṉpōlattalivaṉ varutalāṉum talivi karanta |uḷḷattaḷāy niṟkumātalāṉum|attuṇip pulappāṭiṉmiyiṉ, |akkaruttiṉāṉē mēṟcollappaṭṭatōḻikūṟṟu mūvakiyākap poruḷ |urittateṉṟu koḷka. (37)


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_126">{SA TP126i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li> |aṉṉa vakiyāṉ |uṇarntapiṉ |allatu
<li>piṉṉili muyaṟci peṟāḷ|eṉa moḻipa.
</ol>

<P>|ituvum tōḻikku |uriyatōr tiṟaṉ |uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>(|i-ḷ.0 mēṟcollappaṭ kūṟupāṭṭāṉ |iruvar māṭṭum |aṉpumimi|uṇarntapiṉ |allatu vaḻipāṭṭu nilimiyāṟ kūṭṭattiṟkumuyalappeṟāḷ tōḻi |eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>|aḵtēl, |uḷḷappuṇarcciyāṉiṉṟu pemyuṟātu kūṭṭattiṟku muyalvār|uḷar. |āyiṉ, |aḵteṟṟāṟ peṟum |eṉiṉ |āṇṭum |iruvar māṭṭuḷatākiya|aṉpuṭimiyāṉ maṉanikaḻcciyuḷavāka |annikaḻcci kaṇṭuḻiyummuyalappeṟumeṉṟu koḷka. |ataṉāṉēyaṉṟē `muṉṉuṟavuṇartal' |eṉṉumcūttirattiṉum `puṇarcciyuṭampaṭutal' |eṉṉātu `matiyuṭampaṭutaloru mūvakiya' |eṉap pa#e#ātuppaṭa |oruvārāyiṟ ṟeṉka.|avvaṉpiṉāṉ varunikaḻcci yuḷvaḻiyum |ivviya mūṉṟiṉum kātaluṇmi|aṟiyalākum. (38)


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_127">{SA TP127i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li> muyaṟcik kālat tataṟpaṭa nāṭip
<li>puṇartta ḷāṟṟalum |avaḷvayi ṉāṉa.
</ol>

<P>|ituvum |atu.

<P>(|i-ḷ.) tōḻi vaḻimoḻintu muyaluṅkālattu |avaṉniṉiviṉkaṭpaṭuntiṟaṉ |ārāyntu puṇarttalic ceyyum |avaḷiṭattu|eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>|aḵtāvatu, |iṉṉuḻic cel' |eṉavum, `|iṉṉuḻi vā' |eṉavumtaliviyi |āyattuṇiṉṟum pirittut taṉi niṟuttip paṭṭāṅkukūṟiyumpiṟavāṟṟāṉum |ārāyttu kūṭṭutal.
|ivvintu cūttirattāṉun tōḻikku |uriya maravu |uṇarttiyavāṟukāṇka. (39)


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_128">{SA TP128i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li> kuṟiyeṉap paṭuva tiraviṉum pakaliṉum
<li>|aṟiyak kiḷanta |āṟṟa teṉpa.
</ol>

<P>|eṉṟatu, mēl `kaḷañcuṭṭuk kiḷavi kiḻaviyatākum' |eṉṟār.|ataṟku |ilakkaṇam |uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.


<P>(|i-ḷ.) kuṟi |eṉṟu collappaṭuvatu |iraviṉāṉum pakaliṉāṉum|iruvarum |aṟiyac colppaṭṭa |iṭatti yuṭittu |eṉṟavāṟu.
|eṉavē, |iraviṟkuṟi pakaṟkuṟi |eṉa |iruvakippaṭum |eṉpatukoḷḷappaṭum. (40)


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_129">{SA TP129i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li> |iravuk kuṟiyē |allakat tuḷḷum
<li>maṉiyōr kiḷavi kēṭkumvaḻi yatuvē
<li>maṉiyakam pukā|ak kāli yāṉa.
</ol>

<P>|eṉṟatu, |aravukkuṟikku |iṭamuṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.


<P>(|i-ḷ.) |iravukkuṟiyām |iṭamē |illakattuḷ maṉiyakampukāviṭattukkaṇ maṉiyōr kiḷavikēṭkum |aṇimittām |eṉṟavāṟu.
|eṉavē, maṉikkum |eyiṟkum naṭuvaṇatōriṭam |eṉṟu koḷḷappaṭum.(41)


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_130">{SA TP130i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li> pakaṟpuṇar kaḷaṉē puṟaṉeṉa moḻipa
<li>|avaḷaṟi vuṇara varuvaḻi yāṉa.
</ol>

<P>|eṉṟatu, pakaṟkuṟi yāmāṟu |uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.


<P>(|i-ḷ.) pakaṟkuṟiyākip puṇarumiṭam |eyiṟpuṟaṉ |eṉṟu colluvar;|āṇṭun talimakaḷ |aṟivuṟṟuvarum |iṭaṉākalvēṇṭum |eṉṟavāṟu. (42)


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_131">{SA TP131i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li> |allakuṟip paṭutalum |avaḷvayiṉ |urittē
<li>|avaṉkuṟi mayaṅkiya |amivoṭu variṉē.
</ol>

<P>|ituvumatu:


<P>(|i-ḷ.) |allakuṟippaṭutalun talimakaṭku |urittu: talivaṉceyta kuṟimayaṅkiya poruttattoṭuvariṉ |eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>|utāraṇam mēṟkāṭṭappaṭṭatu.

<P>mayaṅkiya |amivu |āvatu--|avaṉ ceyyum kuṟiyō ṭamivuṭiyaṉa.(43)


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_132">{SA TP132i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li> |āṅkāṅ koḻukum |oḻukkamum |uṇṭē
<li>|ōṅkiya ciṟappiṉ |oruciṟi yāṉa.
</ol>

<P>|ituvumatu:


<P>(|i-ḷ.) |avvavviṭat toḻukum |oḻukkamun talivimāṭṭu |uṇṭu,|oṅkiya ciṟappiṉiyuṭiya |orupakkattu |eṉṟavāṟu.
|oruciṟi yeṉṟatu maṉattāṉum moḻiyāṉum meyyāṉum kaṟpuṭi makaḷir|oḻukum |oḻukkattiṉ maṉattāṉ |oḻukum |oḻukkamum |uṇṭu |eṉṟavāṟu.(44)


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_133">{SA TP133i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li> maṟinta |oḻukkat tōriyum nāḷun
<li>tuṟanta |oḻukkaṅ kiḻavaṟ killi.
</ol>

<P>|eṉṟatu, talivaṟku |uriya |iyalpu |uṇarttukal nutaliṟṟu.


<P>(|i-ḷ.) kaḷavoḻukkattu mukurttamum nāḷum tuṟantoḻukum |oḻukkamtalivaṟku |illi |eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>|eṉṟataṉāṉ, |āṇṭu |aṟattiṉ vaḻuviṉāṉallaṉ, talivimāṭṭuttaliyaḷi kuṟitalāṉ |eṉṟavāṟu. (45)


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_134">{SA TP134i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li> |āṟika tarumiyum |aḻivum |accamum
<li>|ūṟum |uḷappaṭa |ataṉō raṟṟē.
</ol>

<P>|ituvumatu:


<P>(|i-ḷ.) neṟiyiṉatu |arumiyum maṉaṉ |aḻivum |añcutalum|iṭiyūṟum talivaṉ māṭṭu nikaḻā |eṉṟavāṟu. (46)


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_135">{SA TP135i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li> tantiyun taṉṉiyum muṉṉattiṉ |uṇarpa.
</ol>

<P>|eṉṟatu, tantiyum, taṉṉiyarum kaḷavu |uṇarumāṟu |uṇarttutalnutaliṟṟu.


<P>(|i-ḷ.) tantiyarum taṉṉiyarum kuṟippiṉ |uṇarpa |eṉṟavāṟu.
|eṉavē, kūṟṟiṉāṉ |urikkappeṟār |eṉṟavāṟām. (47)


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_136">{SA TP136i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li> tāy |aṟivuṟutal ceviliyō ṭokkum.
</ol>

<P>|eṉṟatu, naṟṟāykku |uriyatōr marapuṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.


<P>(|i-ḷ.) naṟṟāy kaḷavoḻukkam |aṟivuṟutal ceviliyōṭokkum|eṉṟavāṟu. cevili kavaluntuṇik kavalutalallatu tantiyiyumtaṉṉiyaṉmāriyumpōla vekuṭalilaḷ |eṉṟavāṟu. |avar vekuḷvarō|eṉiṉ.
``kāmar kaṭumpuṉal'' |eṉattoṭaṅkum kalittokip pāṭṭiṉuḷ,
``|aṟattoṭu niṉṟēṉik kaṇṭu tiṟappaṭa
|eṉṉiyark kuytturittāḷ yāy.'' (kalit.39)
|eṉat tāyvekuḷāmi kāṇappaṭṭatu.
``|avarum terikaṇi nōkkic cilinōkkik kaṇcēntu
|orupaka lellām |urutteḻun tāṟi'' (kalit.39)
|eṉṟataṉāṉ vekuṭci peṟṟām. (48)


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_137">{SA TP137i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li> |ampalum |alaruṅ kaḷavuveḷip paṭuttaliṉ
<li>|aṅkataṉ mutalvaṉ kiḻava ṉākum.
</ol>

<P>|eṉṟatu kaḷavu veḷippaṭuppār |avar |eṉpatu |uṇarttutalnutaliṟṟu.


<P>(|i-ḷ.) |ampal |eṉpatu mukiḻttal. |aḵtu |oruvaroruvarmukakkuṟippiṉāṟ ṟōṟṟuvittal. |alarāvatu collutal |ataṉāṉē |ivi|iraṇṭum kaḷaviṉi veḷippaṭuttaliṉ |ataṟkuk kāraṇamāvāṉ talivaṉ|eṉṟavāṟu. |eṉṉi, |avaṉi yaṟintuḻiyallatu |ivi nikaḻāmiyiṉ.talivivēṟupāṭṭāṉ |ākātō |eṉiṉ, |āṇṭu |eṟṟiṉāṉ |āyiṟṟu. |eṉa|aiyam nikaḻtalallatu tuṇivu piṟavātām |eṉṟu koḷka.


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_138">{SA TP138i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li> veḷippaṭa varital paṭāmi varital |eṉṟu
<li>|āyiraṇ ṭeṉpa varital |āṟē.
</ol>

<P>|itu, variyum pakuti |uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.


<P>(|i-ḷ.) kaḷavu veḷippaṭṭapiṉ varitalum kaḷavu veḷippaṭāmivaritalum |eṉa |avviraṇṭeṉṟu colluvar variyum neṟi |eṉṟavāṟu.
|itaṉāl colliyatu |iruvāṟṟāṉum |aṟaṉ |iḻukkāteṉṟavāṟu. |aḵtu|iḻukkātavāṟu varukiṉṟa cūttirattāṉ |uṇarka. (50)


<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_139">{SA TP139i}</A></H3>
<ol>
<li> veḷippaṭi tāṉē kaṟpiṉo ṭoppiṉum
<li>ñāṅkark kiḷanta mūṉṟu poruḷāka
<li>variyātu pirital kiḻavōṟ killi.
</ol>

<P>|itu, talivaṟku |uriyatōr |iyalpu |uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.


<P>(|i-ḷ.) kaḷavu veḷippaṭutal kaṟpiṉōṭoppiṉum mēṟcollappaṭṭamūṉṟu poruḷāka variyātu pirital kiḻavōṟku |illi |eṉṟavāṟu.
|aviyāvaṉa muṟkūṟiya |otaṟpirivum, pakivayiṟpirivum,tūtiṟpirivum. |eṉavē poruḷvayiṟ piritalum vēntarkkuṟṟuḻippiritalum kāvaṟpiritalum nikaḻappeṟum |eṉṟavāṟām. (51)

<P>((mūṉṟāvatu kaḷaviyal muṟṟiṟṟu.))





